<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2SA" style="id">- Adele Old Testament</book>
  <para style="h">2 Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc1">Samweli Gɩkpa-Nyɔɔfɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Sam</para>
  <para style="mt1">Samweli Gɩkpa-Nyɔɔfɛ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2SA 1" />
  <para style="s1">Dafidi ɛ nʋn Sawulo diku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 1:1" />Sawulo diku dɩɩ gama fɔ, Dafidi e biri e ye akpa gɛtɛ ɛ ma kpà ma Amaleki bete gɛ e di boo koro fɔ yaanɩ ɛ ba, gɛ ɛ sara Sikilagi ditele daanɩ awi anyɔɔ. <verse eid="2SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 1:2" />Duwi-siyeefɛ daanɩ fɔ, ɛsaranyan ɛkɩ e ye Sawulo gɛsarakʋn ɛ ba Sikilagi, ma wanyan fɛɛranlɛ, gɛ atɩn i gyu wɔ duyu. Gɛtɛ e gyu Dafidi wakʋn fɔ, e kura gɛtʋnkwaa ɛ tɛ wɔ gebù.<verse eid="2SA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 1:3" />Gɛ Dafidi e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ganɩ gɛ a ye?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:3">Gɛ ɛsaranyan fɔ e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Na serenti na ye Isareli bete bɔɔ gɛsarakʋn gaanɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 1:4" />Gɛ Dafidi e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn na ba? Dɔ̀ mɩ!&gt;&gt; Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛsaranyan fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Tɩɩ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ be serenti be ye bɩtà baanɩ. Gɛ baanɩ kpekpesi be ku. Gɛ Sawulo ma wobi Yonatan mɔ be ku.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 1:5" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Dafidi e lila ɛsaranyan gɛtɛ ɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ ade fɔ alan,&lt;&lt;Lan gɛ a mɛ gɛ a we alɛ Sawulo ma wobi Yonatan be ku?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 1:6" />Gɛ ɛsaranyan fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Fɔ ǹ gyaga Gilibowa odon wuu koro. Dʋkɔ gɛ na we Sawulo ɛ kpasa ma wo giturunyan. Fɔ wɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ boo betiiramisan ma yɩɩ bɛsaralɛ bɛ gbɛma wɔ. <verse eid="2SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 1:7" />Gɛtɛ e fi ɛ nya gɛ e we mɩ fɔ, e kpèlè mɩ, gɛ na yera wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Miinfonte.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 1:8" />Gɛ e lila mɩ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛnyan gɛ à di?&gt;&gt; Gɛ na tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Ǹ di gɛ Amaleki-te.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 1:9" />Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ mɩ alan, &lt;&lt;Ba, fɔ àà be wolo mɩ! Ǹ tɛ kpà ma diku, mɔ min te ku.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 1:10" />Okoro na san, gɛ na ma wolo wɔ. Yema na we gɛtɛ, wʋ̀ mɛ lann fɔ, ɛn nan wura nkpa. Gɛ na tiri digyu-koto gɛtɛ è tin fɔ, ma gʋlɔ gaagbarɩgbarɩ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa fɔ, gɛ na ka yɩ ntɛ mɔma awɔ miinfonte.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 1:11" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Dafidi ma bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa wakʋn fɔ powu be gye bɔɔ ngba bɛ fɛɛran. <verse eid="2SA 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 1:12" />Okoro bɛ yɩyɛ, gɛ be wula, gɛ bɛ ban onyun ma sere ɔgyɔlɔ, yema Sawulo ma wobi Yonatan ma Isareli bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bè di Yahwe woyo ɛbɛ, gɛ be ku akpa fɔ yaanɩ fɔ boo koro.<verse eid="2SA 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 1:13" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Dafidi e lila ɛsaranyan gɛtɛ ɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ ade fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ditele-mɔmɔ dɩɩnɩ gɛ à di?&gt;&gt; Gɛ e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Ǹ di gɛ esela Amaleki-te fɔ wobi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 1:14" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Dafidi e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Okoro wʋn mɛ wɔ̀ gɩsaa gɛtɛ àà wolo ɛnɩ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ sʋrʋ bʋnɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 1:15" />Dʋkɔ gɛ Dafidi e kpèlè wɔ bɛsaranyan baanɩ ɛkɩ, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;San ma wolo wɔ.&gt;&gt; Okoro ɛsaranyan fɔ ɛ e wolo wɔ ɛ fɩna. <verse eid="2SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 1:16" />Pɛ Dafidi ɛ̀ɛ̀ bɛ yɛ bàà wolo wɔ fɔ, ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Awɔ na len aa diku. Aanyun gɛtɛ a ka a dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Nmɩ na wolo Yahwe wɔnɩ gɛtɛ ɛ sʋrʋ wɔ bʋnɔ fɔ na tin wɔ̀ dɩpwɛ lɛ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dafidi ɛ nʋma dɩkpʋkpʋ dɩɩnʋn Sawulo ma wobi Yonatan boo diku daanɩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 1:17" />Dafidi e tiri dɩkpʋkpʋ dɩɩnʋn Sawulo ma wobi Yonatan boo diku dii koro, <verse eid="2SA 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 1:18" />gɛ ɛ tɛ ose alɛ be wùlà Yuda bete dɩkpʋkpʋ dɩɩnʋn nyawʋ. Bɛ ŋwara wʋ bɛ sa Yasa Gɩkpa gaanɩ alan,<verse eid="2SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 1:19" />&lt;&lt;Oo Isareli, aa gingyebi gɩɩnɩ gbaa e ku idon yii koro!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:19">Bɩtà bʋʋtàlɛ-dɩrɛ ɛ nʋ̀n bɩtà baanɩ!<verse eid="2SA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 1:20" />Ɩ kara san ɩ dɔ̀ ade nyayɩ Gati bete baanɩ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:20">ɩ kara san ɩ dɔ̀ yɩ Asikelon wo-isele yaanɩ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:20">nka gɛlɛ fɔ waà mɛ Filisiti bɛnanɩ ɔsɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:20">nka gɛlɛ fɔ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛn nyɩ Wurubwarɛ bɔɔ bɛnanɩ baà di ɔsɛ.<verse eid="2SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 1:21" />Oo, Gilibowa idon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">dɩya abɛɛ ɛsʋn ɛ kara nʋ̀n yii koro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">gɛ dɩya abɛɛ ɛsʋn ɛ kara nʋ̀n yii-ili gɛtɛ ɩɩ tɛ yɩ oli waanyan fɔ yii koro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:21">Yema dʋkɔ gɛ ɛkpàlɛ-dɩrɛ wɔ gɩwɔrɔnyan panpasan-dɩyɛlɛ koro gɛtɛ è de ɛɛ dɩyɛ koro fɔ gɩ wɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">Bɛn mɩnɩ ka bʋnɔ sʋrʋ Sawulo gɩwɔrɔnyan panpasan-dɩyɛlɛ koto gɛtɛ è de ɛɛ dɩyɛ koro fɔ.<verse eid="2SA 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 1:22" />Sawulo ma Yonatan be wolo-wolo bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ-kɛmalɛ fɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:22">Ben ye akpa yaanɩ ba gɛtɛ nkalan ɛn kya boo bedon.<verse eid="2SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 1:23" />&lt;&lt;Gelen ma ɔsɛ-mɔmɔ mɩnɩ sara Sawulo ma Yonatan boo getite?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:23">Boo getite gɩn lanla kpa, bɔɔ dɩsarabi daanɩ, ma boo diku daanɩ powu, boo getite gɩn lanla kpa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:23">Bɛ̀ ba ɔsa da ɔkɔdɩyɛ ɛbɛ, gɛ bɛ̀ ba ɔkɛma da bɛdɩ̀rɛ̀.<verse eid="2SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 1:24" />Oo Isareli bɛnanɩ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:24">i wula Sawulo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:24">ɛwɔ na tin yɩ ayan-sɩya ma ɔmɩrɩ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:24">gɛ ɛ sa yɩ sɩka-sɩya wanyan.<verse eid="2SA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 1:25" />Anʋn na yɛ gɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ dɩrɛ-dɩrɛ bɛ nʋ̀n bɩtà baanɩ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:25">Yonatan na ku ɛ̀ dɔ yii-idon yii koro lɛ.<verse eid="2SA 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 1:26" />Mɩɩnwɔlɔn Yonatan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:26">aade ɩ taga mɩ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:26">A len maade gepepe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:26">Gɛ gelen gɛtɛ à ba tɛ mɩ fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:26">gɩn ma dɩkʋsʋ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:26">Gɩ da gelen tɛ ɛnanɩ.<verse eid="2SA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 1:27" />Anʋn na yɛ gɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ dɩrɛ-dɩrɛ bɛ nʋ̀n bɩtà baanɩ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:27">baakpanyan i biligi tuntun.<verse eid="2SA 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2SA 2" />
  <para style="s1">Bɛ sʋrʋ Dafidi bʋnɔ èè di bugyu tɛ Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 2:1" />Nyawʋ wʋʋ gama fɔ, Dafidi e lila Yahwe alan, &lt;&lt;N biri n bʋn n ma sara Yuda atele fɔ dɩkɩ daanɩ abɛɛ?&gt;&gt; Gɛ Yahwe e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩɩn, san!&gt;&gt; Gɛ Dafidi e lila alan, &lt;&lt;Ganɩ gɛ n san?&gt;&gt; Gɛ Yahwe e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;San Hebron ditele!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 2:2" />Okoro Dafidi ma wɔsɔ ɛbɛ bɛnyɔɔ, gɛtɛ ɛbɛ n di Ahinoham gɛtɛ e ye Yesirele fɔ, ma Abigeli gɛtɛ nafɔ è di ekule Kameli-te Nabali wɔsɔ fɔ na bʋn na san. <verse eid="2SA 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 2:3" />Dafidi ɛ nɩ ka wɔ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bè si wakʋn fɔ, ɛkamasɛ ma wɔ dɩkpaara, gɛ bɛ ma sara Hebron ma watelebi yaanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 2:4" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yuda bete bɛ ba Hebron, gɛ bɛ sʋrʋ Dafidi bʋnɔ dʋkɔ bɛ sɩ̀ wɔ bugyu bɛ tɛ Yuda gɩfɩɩ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:4">Gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛ nʋn alɛ Yabesi-Gileyadi bɛnɩ na lò Sawulo fɔ, <verse eid="2SA 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 2:5" />ɛ sa bɛnɩ Yabesi-Gileyadi bɛnɩ baakʋn, bɛ ma dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe e hira yɩ gɛtɛ i tiri gelen nyagɩ i wùlà yiifonte Sawulo, gɛ i lò wɔ lɛ. <verse eid="2SA 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 2:6" />Yahwe e wula yii gutunkoro fɔ èè di nʋnkwarɩ tɛ yɩ, gɛ nmɩ mɔ, nan mɛ ade-kpara n tɛ yɩ, yema ade gɛtɛ ɩ mɛ lɛ yii koro. <verse eid="2SA 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 2:7" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro ɩ sa koro ɔkɛma fɔ yàà wura oturu, yema yiifonte Sawulo e ku, gɛ Yuda gɩfɩɩ gɩ sʋrʋ mɩ bʋnɔ alɛ n di bugyu n tɛ bɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 2:8" />Fɔ, Neri wobi Abineri, gɛtɛ è di Sawulo bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔndɩrɛ fɔ ɛ ka Sawulo wobi Isi-Boseti ɛ kààrà Yodan getu ɛ mɔma Mahanayim. <verse eid="2SA 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 2:9" />Gɛ Abineri ɛ sɩ̀ Isi-Boseti bugyu ɛ tɛ Gileyadi, ma Asuri ma Yesirele, ma Efrayim, ma Benyamin, ma Isareli bete powu. <verse eid="2SA 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 2:10" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Sawulo wobi Isi-Boseti e di bugyu fɔ ɛ̀ ba bɩkyan akpilin anyɔɔ (40), gɛ e di bugyu bɩkyan bʋnyɔɔ. Mɔ Yuda gɩfɩɩ gɩɩ bɛnɩ bɩrɛ, be yela gɛ Dafidi gama. <verse eid="2SA 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 2:11" />Gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛ̀ sa Hebron fɔ, e di bugyu bɩkyan kwarankɩ ma bebon kooron ɛ tɛ Yuda gɩfɩɩ.<verse eid="2SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 2:12" />Duwi dɩkɩ Neri wobi Abineri, fɩya ma Sawulo wobi Isi-Boseti bɛnɩ bɛ tɔ be ye Mahanayim bɛ sa Gibeyon. <verse eid="2SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 2:13" />Gɛ Seruwa wobi Yowabi, ma Dafidi bɛnɩ bɛ ma tuma bɛ Gibeyon dɩbʋna dɩɩpɩ. Dikpen fɔ dɩkɩ dɩ sara dɩbʋna fɔ diifen wʋkɩ, gɛ dikpen do mɔ dɩ sara ofen-do.<verse eid="2SA 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 2:14" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Abineri ɛ dɔ̀ Yowabi alan, &lt;&lt;Yɛ taà tiri tɩɩ bɛsaranyan fɔ baanɩ bɛkɩ ti ye ifen ɩnyɔɔ fɔ powu yaanɩ, bàà kpà ma bɛwɔlɔn fɔ tàà nya.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:14">Gɛ Yowabi ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Na nʋn, yɛ bàà kpà.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 2:15" />Okoro bɛnɩ fwo-bɛnyɔɔ gɛtɛ be yela bɛ tɛ Benyamin wofoli ma Sawulo wobi Isi-Boseti fɔ bɛ kpà ma bɛnɩ fwo-bɛnyɔɔ gɛtɛ be ye Dafidi bɛnɩ baanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 2:16" />Gɛ baanɩ-kamasɛ e gye wɔwɔlɔn wayungu gɛ bɛ ka bɔɔ bɛtata be sere bɛwɔlɔn bɔɔ bɩlan baanɩ, gɛ ɛbɛ powu be ye bɛ nʋ̀n be ku. Gɛlɛ wuu koro bɛ sa Gibeyon ditele dɩɩkʋn wʋtɔkɔ diyere alɛ Helikati-Hasurim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Helikati-Hasurim wuu wùlà alɛ bɛtata ma ɔyɛ bɔɔ gɛtʋnkwaa</char></note>.<verse eid="2SA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 2:17" />Duwi dɩtɔkɔ, akpa fɔ ɩ mɛ ɔkɛma gepepe, gɛ Dafidi bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ be di Abineri ma Isareli bete fɔ boo koro. <verse eid="2SA 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 2:18" />Fɔ, Seruya bebi besiyee gɛtɛ bee kpèlè alɛ Yowabi, ma Abisayi, ma Asaheli fɔ bɛ̀ sa dʋkɔbɛ. Gɛ Asaheli gɛtɛ ɛ̀ nyɩ̀ iti anlɛ ɛkwalan fɔ, <verse eid="2SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 2:19" />ɛ kpà ɛ gyaga Abineri wo koro tɩɩn. <verse eid="2SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 2:20" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Abineri e fi ɛ nya wɔ gama, gɛ e lila alan, &lt;&lt;Awɔ Asaheli n serenti à tɛrɛma mɩ lɛ?&gt;&gt; Gɛ e yera alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩɩn, nmɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 2:21" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Abineri ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Kere mɩ ya fɔ à fi san gɩlan ma gye bɛsaranyan fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ, fɔ àà to wakpanyan.&gt;&gt; Mɔ Asaheli en kere geberema wɔ fɔ ɛ ya.<verse eid="2SA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 2:22" />Gɛ Abineri e biri ɛ dɔ̀ Asaheli alan, &lt;&lt;Kere mɩ geserenti berema ya! Anʋn yii koro gɛ aa mɛ mɩ ade gɛtɛ yaà yɛ nan wolo wɔ̀? Gengyi ǹ wolo wɔ̀ fɔ, lan gɛ nan talɩ n bʋma bʋnʋn n nya aanobi Yowabi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 2:23" />Mɔ Asaheli ɛn nʋn wakʋn. Gɛlɛ wuu koro Abineri e fi wɔ gama, gɛ ɛ ka wɔ giturunyan e sere Asaheli diboro, gɛ giturunyan fɔ gi duru gi ye ma wɔ gama. E ye ɛ nʋ̀n, gɛ e ku dʋkɔbɛ. Ɛnɩ-kamasɛ ɛ̀ nɩma ɔkʋn gɛtɛ Asaheli ɛ nʋ̀n, gɛ e ku fɔ ee ten e yela.<verse eid="2SA 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 2:24" />Mɔ Yowabi ma Abisayi be berema Abineri, gɛ gɛtɛ ofila wʋ̀ bɛ nʋ̀n butu fɔ, bɛ ba Ama wodon gɛtɛ wʋ̀ gbɛma Giya gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa osele gɛtɛ wʋ̀ dɔ san Gibeyon wotonkuma waanɩ wʋʋ gɩlan fɔ wʋʋpɩ.<verse eid="2SA 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 2:25" />Gɛ Benyamin bɛnɩ bɛ bɛ fɩya ma Abineri. Gɛ bɛ kʋla akpen akpen gɛ bɛ pɩna be yela odon fɔ wuu duyu dii koro. <verse eid="2SA 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 2:26" />Gɛ Abineri ɛ gbɛrɛ afala e kpèlè Yowabi, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Okoro taà bɔ ti wolo bɛwɔlɔn gakpaakpa? An nyɩ̀ alɛ olòlò waanɩ gɛ ade nyayɩ yaà ma were? Ma sere ɔya-mɔmɔ waanɩ gɛ aà yɛ aa bɛnɩ bàà kere tiiko-tiiko geserenti-berema ya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 2:27" />Gɛ Yowabi e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Na nya Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa lɛ alɛ gengyi nafɔ an daà tabʋrʋ fɔ, nafɔ mɩɩn bɛnɩ bɛ̀ daa berema bɛ ma ye gagyɩgyan.&gt; <verse eid="2SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 2:28" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yowabi ɛ fʋ̀n dɩkantan, gɛ bɛnɩ fɔ powu be ten be yela. Bɛn mɩnɩ berema Isareli bete fɔ, gɛ bɛn mɩnɩ kpà ma ɛnɩ ɛkɩ. <verse eid="2SA 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 2:29" />Gɛ Abineri ma wɔ bɛnɩ bɛ san odente wʋtɔkɔ powu bɛ da ma Yodan dɩtagba daanɩ. Bɛ kààrà Yodan getu fɔ, gɛ bɛ kyaga ɩsan fɔ yaanɩ bɛ ma ye Bitron gɛ bɛ ka be be gyu Mahanayim ditele daanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 2:30" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yowabi e kere Abineri gɛtɛrɛma ya, gɛ ɛ kʋla wɔ bɛnɩ fɔ powu. Gɛtɛ bɛ kalan bɛnɩ fɔ, bɛnɩ fwo-yɛkɩ na ye baanɩ fɩya ma Asaheli. <verse eid="2SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 2:31" />Mɔ Dafidi bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ be wolo Benyamin bɛnɩ gɛkpɩn ma akpilin nɩyɛ (360) gɛtɛ bɛ̀ fɩya ma Abineri fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 2:32" />Gɛ Yowabi bɛnɩ bɛ ka Asaheli bɛ ma lò wote gɩsàn gaanɩ Betelehem ditele daanɩ. Wʋʋ gama fɔ, Yowabi ma wɔ bɛnɩ bɛ san odente fɔ powu, gɛ bɛ ma gyu Hebron ditele kere-kpalɛ.<verse eid="2SA 2:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2SA 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 3:1" />Akpa gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sara Sawulo dɩkpaara ma Dafidi dɩkpaara yii getite fɔ ɩ kyɛrɩ gepepe. Gɛ gɛtɛ Dafidi dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ fɔ bee wura ɔkɛma bɛ fɩya fɔ, Sawulo gɩlan gɩɩ bɛnɩ fɔ bɩrɛ, bɛɛ yɔlɔ bɛ fɩya gba gɛ.<verse eid="2SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 3:2" />Fɔ Dafidi e wo bebi teni Hebron ditele daanɩ. Wobi-gyegeyelɛ fɔ n di Aminon, gɛtɛ wɔna n di Ahinoham, gɛtɛ e ye Yaserele fɔ.<verse eid="2SA 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 3:3" />Ɛnyɔɔfɛ n di Kileba, gɛtɛ wɔna n di Abigeli, Kameli-te Nabali wɔkpɩnsɔ fɔ.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2SA 3:3">Esiyeefɛ n di Abisalom, gɛ wɔna n di Maaka, gɛtɛ è di Talimayi wogyu gɛtɛ e ye Gesuri wobi-nanɩ fɔ.<verse eid="2SA 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 3:4" />Ɛnaafɛ n di Adoniya, gɛtɛ wɔna n di Hagiti fɔ.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2SA 3:4">Etonfɛ n di Sefatiya, gɛtɛ wɔna n di Abitali fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 3:5" />Gɛ ekooronfɛ fɔ n di Itirem, gɛtɛ wɔna n di Dafidi wɔsɔ Egila fɔ.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2SA 3:5">Hebron ditele daanɩ gɛ be wo bebi nyabɛ powu bɛ tɛ Dafidi.<verse eid="2SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abineri ɛ ma fɩya ma Dafidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 3:6" />Gɛtɛ akpa fɔ ɩ̀ sangba ɩ̀ sa Sawulo ma Dafidi baakpaara yii getite fɔ, Abineri ee wura ɔkɛma gepepe ɛ tɛ Sawulo dɩkpaara. <verse eid="2SA 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 3:7" />Fɔ Sawulo e tì wura edima ɛkɩ gɛtɛ bee kpèlè wɔ alɛ Risipa, gɛtɛ è di Ayiya wobi-nanɩ fɔ. Gɛ Isi-Boseti e lila Abineri alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ a dʋrɔ ma miinte wodima?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 3:8" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Abineri ɛ ka owurufa gepepe ade gɛtɛ Isi-Boseti e lila wɔ fɔ yii koro, gɛ e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;A nyɩ̀ alɛ ǹ di gɛ ɛkpɛɛ gɛtɛ ǹ ma tɔnɔ Yuda bɛnɩ baanɩ? Ye sɩyɛɛ ma ɔŋman fɔ, na wùlà aate Sawulo dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ, ma wonobi ɛbɛ, ma wɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ miin gelen, gɛ mɩn ka wɔ n sa Dafidi walɔ yaanɩ. Mɔ ǹdò aa tin mɩ dɩpwɛ ɛnanɩ nyawɔ wo koro. <verse eid="2SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 3:9" />Wurubwarɛ e tiira nmɩ Abineri giten, gengyi mɩɩn kpà Dafidi èè wura gɩnyan gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ kan ntam ɛ dɔ̀ ɛ sɩ̀ wɔ alɛ, <verse eid="2SA 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 3:10" />eè to bugyu fɔ e ye Sawulo dɩkpaara, fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ka bʋ tɛ Dafidi ɛ̀ɛ̀ nya Isareli bete ma Yuda, ye Dan ma sere Beeseba&gt;&gt; fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 3:11" />Dʋkɔ fɔ, Isi-Boseti ɛn mɩnɩ talɩ sere oturu dɔ̀ Abineri digyebi dɩkɩ, yema è serenti wɔ.<verse eid="2SA 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 3:12" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Abineri ɛ sa bɛsaranyan ɛwɔ gbagba diyere daanɩ bàà ma lila Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛnyan gɛtʋnkwaa gɩ lɛ? Tà dikola ma nmɩ, fɔ nan kpà wɔ̀ àà kʋla Isareli bete powu bàà ba aakʋn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 3:13" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Wʋ̀ kɔlɔ. Nan tà dikola ma awɔ. Mɔ ade-kɩlɩn gɛ nte len àà mɛ pɛ. Ade fɔ n di alɛ, gengyi aà ba maakʋn fɔ, sɩyɛɛ a birima Sawulo wobi-nanɩ Mikali a bɛ tɛ mɩ pɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 3:14" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Dafidi ɛ sa bɛsaranyan Sawulo wobi-teni Isi-Boseti wakʋn alan, &lt;&lt;Birima mɩɩnsɔ Mikali gɛtɛ na ka Filisiti bete bɛnɩ akpilin ton (100) bɔɔ bɩsan baakpa-kpen na mɛ wo duyu daanɩ daade na tɛ Sawulo fɔ tɛ mɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 3:15" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Isi-Boseti ɛ sa bɛnɩ, gɛ bɛ ma ka wɔ be ye wɔsan Lasi wobi Palitile wakʋn. <verse eid="2SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 3:16" />Gɛ wɔsan ɛ ka gewula ɛ tɛrɛma wɔ gamaama gɛlɛɛ ɛ ma gyu Bahurim. Gɛ Abineri ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Biri san dɩkpaara!&gt;&gt; Gɛ e biri ɛ da. <verse eid="2SA 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 3:17" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Abineri ɛ ma tà dikola ma Isareli bɛndɩrɛ, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɔya wʋkɩ waanɩ fɔ, i len Dafidi ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɛ yiigyu. <verse eid="2SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 3:18" />Nkele ɔya fɔ wʋ nɩma. Yema Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi ɛ sɩ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Nan da gɛ ma mɩɩnsaranyan Dafidi wo koro n to mɩɩn bɛnɩ Isareli bete n ye Filisiti bete, ma bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ powu baalɔ yaanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 3:19" />Gɛ Abineri mɔ ɛ tabʋrʋ ma Benyamin bete, gɛ ɛ san Dafidi wakʋn Hebron ditele daanɩ, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ ade gɛtɛ Isareli bete ma Benyamin wofoli bɛ dɔ̀ be yera gɛtɛ baà mɛ fɔ powu. <verse eid="2SA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 3:20" />Gɛtɛ Abineri ma wɔ bɛndɩrɛ dikpilin fɔ bɛ ba Dafidi wakʋn Hebron ditele fɔ, Dafidi e kpele bɛ anyandilɛ <verse eid="2SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 3:21" />Dʋkɔ gɛ Abineri ɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Yɛ mɩ nan san disere-kɩlɩn, fɔ nan ma kʋla Isareli bete powu fɔ n bɛ tɛ miinfonte egyu, fɔ bàà mɛ onyun ma awɔ, fɔ bàà sɩ̀ wɔ̀ bugyu ɔkʋn gɛtɛ aaturu wuu len powu.&gt;&gt; Okoro Dafidi e tiri Abineri osele, gɛ ɛ da olila waanɩ.<verse eid="2SA 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yowabi e wolo Abineri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 3:22" />Gɛtɛ Abineri ɛ bɔ ɛ da fɔ, Dafidi bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ ma Yowabi be be gyu, ma baanyan gɛtɛ bɛ ma kpila dɩkpaatɩ daanɩ fɔ. Fɔ Abineri ɛn mɩnɩ ma Dafidi wakʋn Hebron ditele daanɩ, yema Dafidi e tiri wɔ osele, gɛ ɛ da olila waanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 3:23" />Gɛtɛ Yowabi ma bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛwɔ fɔ powu be be gyu fɔ, bɛ dɔ̀ Yowabi alan, &lt;&lt;Neri wobi Abineri ɛ ba egyu-dɩrɛ Dafidi wakʋn, gɛ ɛ yɛ wɔ ɛ da olila waanɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 3:24" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro Yowabi ɛ san egyu-dɩrɛ Dafidi wakʋn, gɛ ɛ ma lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn gɛ a mɛ lɛ? N nyɩ̀ gɛtɛ Abineri ɛ ba aakʋn. Anʋn yii koro gɛ a yɛ wɔ ɛ da? Nya gɛtɛ ɛ da! <verse eid="2SA 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 3:25" />À nyɩ̀ Neri wobi Abineri, ɛ bɛ gban wɔ̀, fɔ èè wura nyɩnla aa-ɩsanbi ma aade-mɛlɛ powu. <verse eid="2SA 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 3:26" />Gɛtɛ Yowabi e ye Dafidi wakʋn fɔ, ɛ sa bɛsaranyan alɛ bɛ tɛrɛma Abineri. Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛ ma we wɔ Sira wɔlɔkɔ wʋʋpɩ, gɛ be birima wɔ bɛ ba. Mɔ Dafidi ɛn nyɩnla wuu koro waade ɩkɩ. <verse eid="2SA 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 3:27" />Gɛtɛ Abineri e biri ɛ ba Hebron ditele daanɩ fɔ, Yowabi e kpèlè wɔ e ye gɩlan, otunu wʋʋpɩ, anlɛ ɛ̀ maà dɔ̀ wɔ gɛ ade ɩkɩ giten gaanɩ. Dʋkɔ gɛ Yowabi e sere wɔ edon diboro daanɩ, gɛ e ku. Nyawʋ wu le wonobi Asaheli diku dii gutoro. <verse eid="2SA 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 3:28" />Gamama gɛtɛ egyu Dafidi ɛ nʋn ade nyayɩ fɔ, ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Wurubwarɛ ee di mɩ adansɛ alɛ nmɩ ma miin bugyu tɩɩn nyɩ̀ Neri wobi Abineri diku nyadɩ daade ɩkɩ yaanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 3:29" />Wɔ nkalan wʋ ba Yowabi ma wote dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ powu baayu yii koro. Gɛ Yowabi dɩkpaara bɩrɛ, wo gewo tama giidu waanɩ powu fɔ, beteni bɛkɩ baà wura akʋ̀n gɛtɛ ii ye butu, gɛ bɛkɩ baà wura geyeba-sɩya, gɛ bɛkɩ baà yɛ bɛ mɛ gɛ bɛnanɩ bɔɔ gʋtʋn, gɛ bɛkɩ baà nʋ̀n bɩtà baanɩ, gɛ anyandilɛ yaà gbɛrɛ bɛ ɔya-kamasɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 3:30" />Yowabi ma wonobi Abisayi be wolo Abineri, yema e wolo boonobi Asaheli Gibeyon akpa yaanɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 3:31" />Gɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ Yowabi ma bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛwɔ fɔ powu alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ fɛɛran yɩɩ ngba fɔ yàà liba bekotoku baayan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyawʋ n di dɩyɩyɛ, abɛɛ diku daanyan-salɛ</char></note>, fɔ yàà san wula gyegeye Abineri gikpena fɔ. Egyu Dafidi gbagba mɔ ɛ tɛrɛma bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bè tola ekpena fɔ ɛ san gelòkʋn fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 3:32" />Be lò Abineri Hebron ditele daanɩ, gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Dafidi e wula kin-kin Abineri gɩsàn gɩɩpɩ. Gɛ bɛnɩ fɔ powu mɔ be wula.<verse eid="2SA 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 3:33" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ Dafidi ɛ nʋma diku dɩɩnʋn nyawʋ ɛ tɛ Abineri alan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 3:33">&lt;&lt;Lan na ba gɛ Abineri e ku gibisoro lɛ?<verse eid="2SA 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 3:34" />Bɛn ban aalɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 3:34">bɛn ban aa bɩsɩrɩ mɔ ke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 3:34">mɔ a ku anlɛ ɛnɩ gɛtɛ ɛ nʋ̀n bɛnɩ-kpen baalɔ yaanɩ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 3:34">Gɛ bɛnɩ fɔ powu be biri be wula Abineri. <verse eid="2SA 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 3:35" />Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛnɩ fɔ powu bɛ bɛ fɔ Dafidi èè di gɩnyankɩ. Ɔkʋna wʋtɔkɔ fɔ ofila wʋʋn tɛ nʋ̀n butu. Mɔ Dafidi ɛ kan ntam alan, &lt;&lt;Wurubwarɛ ɛ nyanla mɩ gepepe, gengyi n ka boroboro abɛɛ gɩnyankɩ n kya miinyun ɔya gɛtɛ ofila wʋʋn tɛ nʋ̀n butu fɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 3:36" />Bɛnɩ fɔ powu be we ade gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ mɛ fɔ, gɛ wu di bɛ gʋnʋn. Gbagbaagba fɔ, gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ egyu ɛ mɛ fɔ, wu di bɛnɩ fɔ powu gʋnʋn. <verse eid="2SA 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 3:37" />Ye duwi dɩtɔkɔ gɛ bɛnɩ fɔ ma Isareli bete powu bɛ nyɩnla alɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Dafidi ɛn nyɩ̀ Neri wobi Abineri wo diku fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 3:38" />Gɛ egyu Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ bɛnɩ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ nyɩnla alɛ egyegeyelɛ-dɩrɛ ɛkɩ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ ba gebù e ku Isareli gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ ǹdò. <verse eid="2SA 3:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 3:39" />Gɛ wʋ̀ sa waanɩ gɛtɛ ǹ di gɛ egyu gɛtɛ bɛ sʋrʋ bʋnɔ, mɔ na yɔlɔ. Gɛ Seruya bebi-teni fɔ bè di ditola tɛ mɩ. Yahwe e le ade-kpen yɩɩmɛlɛ-kamasɛ gutoro anlɛ gɛtɛ wade-kpen ì we.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 3:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2SA 4" />
  <para style="s1">Isi-Boseti diku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 4:1" />Gɛtɛ Sawulo wobi Isi-Boseti ɛ nʋn gɛtɛ Abineri e ku Hebron ditele daanɩ fɔ, koro gi ku wɔ, gɛ wʋ mɛ Isareli bete powu gɩsaa. <verse eid="2SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 4:2" />Fɔ Sawulo wobi Isi-Boseti ɛ̀ ba bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɛndɩrɛ bɛnyɔɔ bɛkɩ. Baayere n di Baana ma Rekabi. Boote n di Rimon, gɛtɛ e ye Bereto ditele, Benyamin wofoli waanɩ fɔ. Beereti bete bɛ̀ fɩya ma Benyamin bete, <verse eid="2SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 4:3" />yema bɛnɩ gɛtɛ nafɔ bè si Bereti ditele fɔ, be serenti bɛ san Gitayim, gɛ bè si dʋkɔ be ye ma ǹdò gisela gisela.<verse eid="2SA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 4:4" />Fɔ, Sawulo wobi Yonatan ɛ̀ ba ebi-tenibi ɛkɩ gɛtɛ bee kpèlè wɔ Mefiboseti. E di bɩkyan ton pɛgɛ be wolo Sawulo ma Yonatan Yesirele wakpa fɔ yaanɩ. Gɛtɛ wɔkyalalɛ fɔ ɛ nʋn ade fɔ gɛ ɛ ka wɔ ee serenti fɔ, ee kutuma gʋsɔ gʋsɔ okoro ebi fɔ e ye ɛ nʋ̀n, gɛ wʋ yɛ wɔ e bilingi ɔtagasɩ.<verse eid="2SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 4:5" />Duwi dɩkɩ Bereto-te Rimon bebi Rekabi ma Baana be ye bɛ da Isi-Boseti dɩkpaara. Gɛtɛ bɛ ma gyu dʋkɔbɛ ofila-kenken fɔ, ɛ̀ dɔ ee tuna. <verse eid="2SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 4:6" />Ɔya wʋtɔkɔ fɔ, dɩkpaara fɔ dɩɩnyalɛ gɛtɛ ɛɛ fʋba amɔrɔ fɔ, ɛ fwa bʋda. Okoro Rekabi ma wonobi Baana bɛ mɔlɩ be gyu dikwo fɔ dɩɩ gamɩ anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ ma kpa amɔrɔ, gɛ be sere wɔ edon diboro daanɩ, gɛ Rekabi ma wonobi be serenti bɛ da. <verse eid="2SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 4:7" />Gɛtɛ be gyu dikwo fɔ daanɩ gɛlɛ fɔ, Isi-Boseti ɛ̀ dɔ wɔ npa wo koro wo dikwo-dʋrɔlɛ daanɩ. Gɛtɛ be sere wɔ edon be wolo be were fɔ, be kebi wo duyu, gɛ bɛ ka dɩ bɛ da. Bɛ san odente fɔ powu waanɩ bɛ da Yodan dɩtagba daanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 4:8" />Gɛ bɛ ka Isi-Boseti duyu fɔ bɛ bɛ tɛ Dafidi Hebron ditele, gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Aakyʋnlɛ Sawulo, gɛtɛ e len èè wolo wɔ̀ fɔ wobi Isi-Boseti duyu dɩ lɛ. Ǹdò Yahwe e le Sawulo ma wɔ bɛnana gutoro ɛ tɛ awɔ miinfonte egyu.<verse eid="2SA 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 4:9" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ Bereto-te Rimon bebi, Rekabi ma wonobi Baana alan, &lt;&lt;Na nya Yahwe gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa gɛ e tiri mɩ e ye dɩyɩyɛ powu daanɩ alɛ, <verse eid="2SA 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 4:10" />ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ɛ bɛ dɔ̀ mɩ alɛ Sawulo e ku, fɔ ɛ̀ nyɩ̀ alɛ è de gɛ ade-kpara ɛɛ mɔma mɩ, mɔ fɔ, na gye wɔ, gɛ na wolo wɔ Sikilagi ditele daanɩ. Nyawʋ n di wo gutoro gɛtɛ na le wɔ ade gɛtɛ ɛ bɛ dɔ̀ mɩ fɔ yii koro. <verse eid="2SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 4:11" />Waà mɛ lan gɛ gengyi omiri-kpen wʋʋ bɛnɩ bè wolo ɛnɩ ɛwɔ gbagba wɔ npa wo koro, wo dikwo-dʋrɔlɛ daanɩ gɛtɛ ɛn nyɩ̀ ade ɩkɩ yaanɩ fɔ, n kara lila wɔ nkalan n ye baalɔ yaanɩ, fɔ nan muru bɛ n ye gɛtʋnkwaa nyagɩ gii koro?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 4:12" />Okoro Dafidi ɛ yɛ wɔ bɛnɩ be wolo bɛ. Be kebi baalɔ ma bɔɔ bɩsɩrɩ, gɛ bɛ ka koro-kpaba fɔ bɛ kyɔlɔga gbɛma Hebron ditiribun diinyun. Mɔ bɛ ka Isi-Boseti duyu, gɛ be lò di Abineri gɩsàn gaanɩ Hebron dʋkɔbɛ.<verse eid="2SA 4:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2SA 5" />
  <para style="s1">Dafidi e di bugyu Isareli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 5:1" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Isareli wo-ifoli yii begyegeyelɛ fɔ powu bɛ ba Dafidi wakʋn Hebron, gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛtɩ ma awɔ tì di gɛ nkalan kɩlɩn. <verse eid="2SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 5:2" />Ɔya fɔ waanɩ gɛtɛ Sawulo è di tiigyu-dɩrɛ gba fɔ, awɔ na gyegeye a tɛ Isareli bete fɔ akpa yaanɩ, gɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ̀ alan, &lt;Awɔ nan mɛ mɩɩn bɛnɩ Isareli bete bɔɔnyalɛ, gɛ aà bɛ mɛ boogyu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 5:3" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro Dafidi ma Isareli begyegeyelɛ fɔ powu bɛ tà dikola Yahwe bʋnʋn Hebron dʋkɔbɛ. Gɛ bɛ sʋrʋ Dafidi bʋnɔ bɛ sɩ̀ wɔ Isareli wogyu-dɩrɛ. <verse eid="2SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 5:4" />Dafidi e di bɩkyan dikpilin ma fwo (30), pɛgɛ bɛ sɩ wɔ bugyu, gɛ e di bugyu bɩkyan akpilin anyɔɔ (40). <verse eid="2SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 5:5" />Ɛ sara Hebron ditele e di bugyu ɛ tɛ Yuda wofoli fɔ bɩkyan kwarankɩ ma bebon kooron. Gɛ ɛ sara Yerusalem e di bugyu ɛ tɛ Isareli ma Yuda bete powu bɩkyan dikpilin ma fwo bisiyee (33).<verse eid="2SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dafidi e di Yerusalem ditele dii koro.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 5:6" />Duwi dɩkɩ Dafidi e gyegeye wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔ bʋnʋn bɛ san Yerusalem bàà ma kpà ma Yebusi bete gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa dʋkɔ fɔ. Ɛwʋ gɛ Yebusi bete bɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩɩn talɩ i gyu nfan. Bɛnʋn-gbenalɛ ma ɔtagasɩ ɛbɛ gba nan berema yɩ be ye nfan.&gt;&gt; Yema bɛ sa dɩmɩnlɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Dafidi ɛn nan talɩ e gyu dʋkɔbɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 5:7" />Mɔ fɔ Dafidi e di ditele gɛtɛ dì di ɔkɛmakʋn gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Siyon gɛtɛ be foma dii diyere alɛ Dafidi Ditele fɔ dii koro. <verse eid="2SA 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 5:8" />Duwi dɩtɔkɔ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ bɛnɩ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bee len bàà di Yebusi bete boo koro fɔ, wù di gɛtɛ bàà da gɛ ma butu buusele bɛ ma ye ɔtagasɩ ɛbɛ ma bɛnʋn-gbenalɛ gɛtɛ bè di Dafidi bɛkyʋnlɛ fɔ baakʋn. Gɛlɛ wuu koro gɛ wʋ dʋrɔ ade-dɔ̀lɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Bɛnʋn-gbenalɛ ma ɔtagasɩ ɛbɛ bɛn nan gyu digyu-kpara&gt;&gt; fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 5:9" />Gɛtɛ Dafidi e di ditele gɛtɛ be sere ɩpɔrɩ be silin di be tuma fɔ dii koro e were fɔ, ɛ sara daanɩ gɛ ɛ sa dɩ diyere alɛ &lt;&lt;Dafidi Ditele-dɩrɛ.&gt;&gt; Gɛ Dafidi e sere ɩpɔrɩ e silin atele ɛ fɩya ma ditele-dɩrɛ fɔ ye ofila wʋʋ gɛtàkʋn wʋʋ gɩlan. <verse eid="2SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 5:10" />Gɛ Dafidi e bè wura ɔkɛma gakpa yema Yahwe, Wurubwarɛ Kpatakpɩrɩ fɔ ɛ̀ sa ma ɛwɔ okoro.<verse eid="2SA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 5:11" />Duwi dɩkɩ Tire wogyu-dɩrɛ Hiram ɛ sa bɛsaranyan Dafidi wakʋn. Gɛ bɛ ka Seda wo-iyon, ma bɛkapɩnta, ma bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛɛ ka ataa bɛ mara akwo. Gɛ bɛ ma sere digyu-kpara bɛ tɛ Dafidi. <verse eid="2SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 5:12" />Nyawʋ wʋ yɛ Dafidi ɛ nyɩnla alɛ Yahwe na ka wɔ na sɩ̀ Isareli bete boogyu, gɛ wɔ bɛnɩ Isareli bete boo koro, ɛ yɛ wo bugyu bʋ bʋn. <verse eid="2SA 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 5:13" />Gɛtɛ Dafidi e ye Hebron ɛ san Yerusalem fɔ, ɛ ma ka bedima, ma bɛna kpekpesi, gɛ be ni wo bebi-teni ma bɛnanɩ bɛ tɛ wɔ. <verse eid="2SA 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 5:14" />Bebi gɛtɛ be wo bɛ tɛ wɔ dʋkɔ fɔ baayere n di Samuwa, ma Sobabi, ma Natan, ma Solomon, <verse eid="2SA 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 5:15" />ma Ibiha, ma Elisuwa, ma Nefegi, ma Yafiya, <verse eid="2SA 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 5:16" />ma Elisama, ma Eliyada, ma Elifeleti.<verse eid="2SA 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dafidi e di Filisiti bete boo koro.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 5:17" />Gɛtɛ Filisiti bete fɔ bɛ nʋn alɛ bɛ sʋrʋ Dafidi bʋnɔ, bɛ sɩ̀ bugyu bɛ tɛ Isareli fɔ, bɛ ka ɔkɛma-dɩrɛ bɛ tɔ bàà ma bugiti wɔ. Mɔ Dafidi ɛ nʋn ade fɔ, gɛ ɛ tɔ ɛ ma gyu gebukʋn. <verse eid="2SA 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 5:18" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Filisiti bete fɔ be be gyu Refayim dɩtagba gɛ bɛ yasɩ be gyu daanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 5:19" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Dafidi e lila Yahwe alan, &lt;&lt;N ma kpà ma Filisiti bete fɔ? Aà yɛ mɩ nan di boo koro?&gt;&gt; Ɛwʋ gɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩɩn, ma kpà, nan yɛ wɔ̀ àà nyɩ di Filisiti bete boo koro.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 5:20" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Dafidi ɛ san Bala-Perasim. Dʋkɔ gɛ ɛ ma kpà ma Filisiti bete, gɛ e di boo koro. Gɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe e di mɩɩn bɛkyʋnlɛ boo koro anlɛ getu gɛtɛ gɩ yɔn gɩ waalɩ.&gt;&gt; Okoro be kpèlè dʋkɔ alan, Bala-Perasim.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gɛtɛ wuu wùlà alɛ, Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ ɛɛ tana isele</char></note> <verse eid="2SA 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 5:21" />Filisiti bete bɛ tɔ bɛ da be kere boo bekpen bɛ ya, gɛ Dafidi ma wɔ bɛnɩ be tola bɛ bɛ da. <verse eid="2SA 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 5:22" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Filisiti bete fɔ be biri bɛ bɛ yasɩ be gyu Refayim dɩtagba fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 5:23" />Gɛ Dafidi e biri e lila Yahwe alɛ ɛ ma kpà ma ɛbɛ? Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Kara tuma bɛ bʋnʋn-bʋnʋn, mɔ fɔ, mɛ dikulukulubi sa bɛ ye gamama, fɔ àà bɛ sʋ bɛ sa Balisam wo-iyon fɔ yɩɩpɩ. <verse eid="2SA 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 5:24" />Gengyi gɛ a bɔ à nʋn bɩsɩrɩ baagingin Balisam wo-iyon yɩɩ gatala fɔ, san bilen, wuu wùlà alɛ nmɩ Yahwe ǹ gyegeye aa bʋnʋn ǹ ma wolo Filisiti bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 5:25" />Dafidi ɛ mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ fɔ, gɛ e wolo Filisiti bete fɔ, ye Gibeyon ma sere Gese.<verse eid="2SA 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2SA 6" />
  <para style="s1">Bɛ ka Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ bɛ san Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 6:1" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Dafidi e tiri bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ ɛbɛ powu bɛ ba disepekyi dɩkɩ ma ɩgbaa ton (30,000) e ye Isareli bɛnɩ baanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 6:2" />Dafidi e gyegeye bɔɔ bʋnʋn gɛ bɛ san Baala ditele gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa Yuda, fɔ bàà ma ka Wurubwarɛ Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka gɛtɛ bee kpèlè dɩ alɛ Yahwe, Ɔkɛma powu Wuute fɔ gɛ wo bugyu bʋ̀ sa Kerubi ɛbɛ bɛnyɔɔ fɔ boo getite fɔ bɛ ba.<verse eid="2SA 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 6:3" />Gɛ bɛ ma ka Wurubwarɛ Dɩdaka fɔ be ye Abinadabi wɔlɛ, gɛtɛ wʋ̀ gyaga odon wuu koro fɔ, gɛ bɛ ka dɩ bɛ taga tiiramisan-fon wʋkɩ waanɩ. Gɛ Wusa ma Ahiyo gɛtɛ bè di Abinadabi bebi teni fɔ, bɛɛ dɩyɛ tiiramisan-fon <verse eid="2SA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 6:4" />gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ dɩ̀ taga waanɩ fɔ. Fɔ Ahiyo ɛ̀ san dɩɩ bʋnʋn. <verse eid="2SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 6:5" />Gɛ Dafidi ma Isareli bete fɔ powu bee di ɔsɛ. Bè de bɔɔkɛma powu bɛɛ nʋma ɩnʋn, gɛ bɛɛ tà adʋlɛ ɛbɛ, ma adʋlɛ-dɩrɛ ɛbɛ, ma akyaka, ma akantan ma akyaka gɛ bee lèn bɛ sa Yahwe gingyebi.<verse eid="2SA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 6:6" />Gɛtɛ be be gyu Nakon wanaabi yii getibakʋn fɔ, ɛkwɔ-teni, gɛtɛ ee tiira tiiramisan fɔ, ɛ kpatɩ ɛ̀ɛ̀ nʋ̀n, gɛ Wusa ɛ sa gʋlɔ e gye Wurubwarɛ Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ, gɛtɛ dɩ kara ye dɩ nʋ̀n. <verse eid="2SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 6:7" />Disere-kɩlɩn fɔ, Yahwe wowurufa wʋ ba Wusa wo koro, yema ɛ mɛ gɛmanbu gaade wuu koro Wurubwarɛ ɛ gbɛrɛ wɔ ɛ fɩna Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ dɩɩpɩ gɛ e ku.<verse eid="2SA 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 6:8" />Wʋ taga Dafidi, yema Yahwe wowurufa-dɩrɛ wʋ ba Wusa wo koro, gɛ bè ye ma ǹdò bee kpèlè dʋkɔbɛ alɛ Peresi-Wusa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Peresi-Wusa gɛtɛ wuu wùlà alɛ Wurubwarɛ wowurufa wʋ tɔ Wusa wo koro</char></note><verse eid="2SA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 6:9" />Gɛ Dafidi e serenti Yahwe duwi dɩtɔkɔ, gɛ e lila alan, &lt;&lt;Lan gɛ nan mɛ gɛ nan ka Yahwe Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka nyadɩ n san maakʋn?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 6:10" />Okoro ɛn mɩnɩ taa ni len gɛtɛ èè to Yahwe Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ sɩ̀ wakʋn Dafidi Ditele-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ. Gɛ ɛ ka dɩ ɛ san Gati-te Obedi-Edom fɔ wɔlɛ. <verse eid="2SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 6:11" />Yahwe Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ dɩ wɔ Gati-te Obedi-Edom wɔlɛ bebon besiyee, gɛ Yahwe e hira Obedi-Edom ma wɔ dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ powu.<verse eid="2SA 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 6:12" />Duwi dɩkɩ bɛ bɛ dɔ̀ egyu Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe e hira Obedi-Edom, ma wɔ dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ powu, ma gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ ba fɔ, Wurubwarɛ Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ dii koro.&gt;&gt; Ɛwʋ gɛ Dafidi ɛ san ɛ ma ka Wurubwarɛ Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ e ye Obedi-Edom dɩkpaara, gɛ ɛ ka dɩ ɛ ba wo ditele-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ ɔsɛ waanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 6:13" />Gɛtɛ ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bè tola Yahwe Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ be dugba bɩsɩrɩ kooron fɔ, Dafidi ɛ ka ɛkwɔ-teni ma dɩkwɔ dɩtan gɛtɛ dɩ̀ ba ayo ɛ tɛ Yahwe gedi. <verse eid="2SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 6:14" />Dafidi ɛ sa gɛgba tinlɛ diboro fututu, gɛ e lèn ma wɔkɛma powu Yahwe bʋnʋn ɛ ka sa wɔ gebù. <verse eid="2SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 6:15" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro Dafidi ma Isareli bete fɔ powu, bɛ ka ɔsɛ wafala yɩɩ gɛgbɛrɛ, ma akantan yɩɩ gɛfʋ̀n bɛ ka Yahwe Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ bɛ ba Yerusalem.<verse eid="2SA 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 6:16" />Gɛtɛ Yahwe Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ dii gyu Dafidi ditele-dɩrɛ daanɩ fɔ, Sawulo wobi-nanɩbi Mikali ɛ nya ma nfansɩrɩ, gɛ e we egyu Dafidi ee lèn, gɛ ee firigi ɛ sa Yahwe gingyebi fɔ, ɛ nya wɔ ɛ waran.<verse eid="2SA 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 6:17" />Gɛ bɛ ka Yahwe Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ bɛ ma sɩ̀ dɩyan dii dikwo gɛtɛ Dafidi e sere ɛ sɩ̀ dàà mɛ dɩɩ gɛsarakʋn fɔ daanɩ. Gɛ Dafidi ɛ tɛ Yahwe gekuma ma olila yii gedi. <verse eid="2SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 6:18" />Gɛ gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛ tɛ gekuma gii gedi ma olila wuu gedi e were fɔ, e hira bɛnɩ fɔ powu Yahwe, Ɔkɛma powu Wuute fɔ diyere daanɩ.<verse eid="2SA 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 6:19" />Gɛ e yo boroboro, ma dati wo keki, ma resin wo keki ɛ tɛ Isareli wɔnɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ e tuma dʋkɔ fɔ, beteni ma bɛnanɩ powu. Wʋʋ gama fɔ, bɛnɩ fɔ powu bɛ da baakpaara yaanɩ.<verse eid="2SA 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 6:20" />Gɛtɛ Dafidi e biri ɛ san wɔ dɩkpaara ɛ̀ɛ̀ ma hira wɔ dɩkpaara dii bɛnɩ fɔ, Sawulo wobi-nanɩ Mikali e ye okòro e be tuma wɔ gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Isareli wogyu-dɩrɛ ɛ sa wo koro diyere dɩrɛ ǹdò. E tigi koro dibolon-kwaa wɔ bɛndɩrɛ-bi bɔɔ bɛsʋgʋgyan gɛtɛ be se fɔ bɔɔ bʋnʋn, anlɛ gɛtɛ enyimapulɛ ɛɛ mɛ fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 6:21" />Gɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ Mikali alan, &lt;&lt;Ǹ te lèn nàn tɔ̀là Yahwe gɛtɛ e tiri mɩ e kere aate ma wɔ dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ powu ɛ ya, gɛ ɛ mɛ mɩ egyegeyelɛ ɛ tɛ wɔ bɛnɩ Isareli bete fɔ. Okoro nan len n tɔ̀là wo diyere. <verse eid="2SA 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 6:22" />Nan tiri koro n tɩyɛra n da anlɛ gɛtɛ aa nya mɩ anlɛ miin di gɩnyankɩ lɛ. Mɔ bɛdɩ-nanɩ bɛtɔkɔ baà ka gebù-dɩrɛ bɛ tɛ mɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 6:23" />Sawulo wobi-nanɩ Mikali en wo ebi ka ma sere duwi gɛtɛ e ku.<verse eid="2SA 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2SA 7" />
  <para style="s">Ade gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛ dɔ̀ ɛ sɩ̀ ɛ tɛ Dafidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 7:1" />Gɛtɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ Dafidi ɛ yɛ è si wo digyu-kpaara daanɩ olila waanɩ, gɛ Yahwe e to wɔ e ye wɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ gɛtɛ be silin wɔ be tuma fɔ powu baalɔ yaanɩ fɔ, <verse eid="2SA 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 7:2" />ɛ dɔ̀ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Natan alan, &lt;&lt;Nya, gɛtɛ nmɩ ǹ si digyu-kpaara gɛtɛ bɛ ka seda wo-iyon be sere fɔ daanɩ, mɔ Wurubwarɛ Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ dɩ̀ sangba dɩ̀ dɔ dɩyan-kwo daanɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 7:3" />Gɛ Natan e tiri wuunyun ɛ tɛ egyu-dɩrɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Mɛ ade-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa aamɩnlɛ yaanɩ, yema Yahwe ɛ̀ sa ma awɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 7:4" />Mɔ odente wʋtɔkɔ ke Wurubwarɛ ɛ dɔ̀ Natan alan, <verse eid="2SA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 7:5" />&lt;&lt;San ma lila mɩɩnsaranyan Dafidi alɛ, nmɩ nte lila wɔ alan, &lt;Awɔ nan sere dikwo a tɛ mɩ nan sara daanɩ? <verse eid="2SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 7:6" />Ye duwi gɛtɛ na ka Isareli bete na ye Egyipiti bè sere ma ǹdò lɛ, mɩn tɛ sara dikwo daanɩ nya. Ǹ bɔ ntɛ sara-sara gɛ dɩyan-kwo daanɩ n tɔ. <verse eid="2SA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 7:7" />Ɔkʋn-kamasɛ gɛtɛ na ka Isareli bete na silin na san fɔ, na were lila Isareli begyegeyelɛ gɛtɛ na yɛ bɛɛ nya mɩɩn bɛnɩ Isareli bete boo koro fɔ alɛ, anʋn yii koro gɛ ɩn ka seda wo-iyon i sere dikwo ɩ tɛ mɩ?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 7:8" />Okoro nkele, dɔ̀ mɩɩnsaranyan Dafidi alɛ, Yahwe, Ɔkɛma powu Wuute fɔ ɛɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Na tiri wɔ̀ na ye bɛyɛran boo gedikʋn, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ aa nya boo koro fɔ, gɛ na mɛ wɔ̀ egyegeyelɛ na tɛ mɩɩn bɛnɩ Isareli bete. <verse eid="2SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 7:9" />Gɛ na sara ma awɔ ɔkʋn-kamasɛ gɛtɛ a san fɔ, gɛ na yɛ a di aa bɛkyʋnlɛ powu boo koro. Nkele nan yɛ wɔ̀ àà di diyere-dɩrɛ anlɛ bɛnɩ gbaa-gbaa gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa gɛtʋnkwaa gii koro fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 7:10" />Gɛ nan tiri ɔkankɩ n tɛ mɩɩn bɛnɩ Isareli bete, gɛ nan sɩ̀ bɛ dʋkɔ, fɔ bàà talɩ sere ɛbɛ gbagba baasarakʋn, fɔ ɛkɩ ɛn mɩnɩ ha bɛ. Gɛ bɛnɩ-kpen bɛn nan nɩ nyɩ bɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ fʋrʋma bɛɛ mɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 7:11" />Na sere ɔpɩ na ye sɩyɛɛ ɔkʋna gɛtɛ na tiri gɔdɔ gɩɩ bɛdɔ̀lɛ bàà nya mɩɩn bɛnɩ Isareli bete boo koro fɔ. Fɔ nan tɛ yɩ getuna ye yɩɩ bɛkyʋnlɛ baalɔ yaanɩ. Gɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;&lt;Nmɩ Yahwe gbagba nan sere dikwo n tɛ wɔ̀. <verse eid="2SA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 7:12" />Gengyi aawi ɩ̀ nɩma, gɛ à ku fɔ, nan tiri aadu wʋʋnɩ n sɩ̀ aa didin, gɛ nan yɛ wo bugyu bàà sere ɩkpaa. <verse eid="2SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 7:13" />Ɛwɔ n di ɛnɩ gɛtɛ eè sere dikwo ɛ tɛ mɩ, gɛ nan nya gɛtɛ wo bugyu bàà sara gakpaakpa. <verse eid="2SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 7:14" />Nan mɛ wote, gɛ ɛwɔ mɔ ɛɛ̀ mɛ miinbi. Gengyi gɛ ɛ̀ mɛ ade-kpen gba fɔ, nan ka gɛ ginyenibi n tiira wɔ giten n pɩna wɔ anlɛ gɛtɛ etaawe-kamasɛ ɛɛ mɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 7:15" />Mɔ mɩn nan to miin gelen gɛtɛ ǹ ba tɛ wɔ fɔ n ye wakʋn anlɛ gɛtɛ na to na ye Sawulo wakʋn pɛgɛ a ba aa di bʋ lɛ.<verse eid="2SA 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 7:16" />Aadu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ nan di bugyu Isareli gakpaakpa. Gɛ gigyu-bɩya fɔ gɩn nan ye aa gʋlɔ gaanɩ gɩ nya.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 7:17" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Natan ɛ dɔ̀ ade-tirilɛ-wùlàlɛ fɔ powu ɛ tɛ Dafidi.<verse eid="2SA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dafidi wonyun-tiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 7:18" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ Dafidi ɛ san ɛ ma kura Yahwe bʋnʋn baanɩ, gɛ e tiri onyun alan,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 7:18">&lt;&lt;Oo Yahwe-kpatakpɩrɩ, nmɩ ma mɩɩn dɩkpaara tiin di gɩnyankɩ, tɩɩn kʋtʋma, mɔ a ka mɩ gɛlɛɛ a be ye nfan. <verse eid="2SA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 7:19" />Oo Yahwe-kpatakpɩrɩ, ma nyawʋ powu wʋʋ gama fɔ, a biri a dɔ̀ ade gɛtɛ yaà be sere aasaranyan dɩkpaara. Oo Yahwe, Ɔkɛma powu Wuute, anlɛ gɛ à fʋrʋma aa mɛ a tɛ bɛnɩ-nyalɛ?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 7:19">&lt;&lt; <verse eid="2SA 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 7:20" />Oo Yahwe-Kpatakpɩrɩ, anʋn gɛ nmɩ Dafidi nan nɩ talɩ n dɔ̀ wɔ̀? Yema à nyɩ̀ nmɩ aasaranyan. <verse eid="2SA 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 7:21" />Aade-dɔ̀lɛ ma aa gelenbi yii koro a mɛ ade ma gɩsaa nyayɩ powu a ka a wùlà nmɩ aasaranyan. <verse eid="2SA 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 7:22" />Oo Yahwe-Kpatakpɩrɩ, à lɩ. Ɛkɩ ɛn ma anlɛ awɔ, gɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛkɩ ɛn ma fɩya ma awɔ, anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛtɩ gbagba tɩ nʋn ma taaten lɛ. <verse eid="2SA 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 7:23" />Gɩfɩɩ gɩkɩ gɩn ma gɛtʋnkwaa gii koro anlɛ Isareli gɛtɛ a tiri a ye gɩdɩ gaanɩ gɛ a ka bɛ a mɛ awɔ gbagba aa bɛnɩ fɔ. Ade-dɩrɛ ma gɩsaa gɛtɛ a mɛ a tɛ bɛ fɔ ɩ yɛ à di diyere gɛtʋnkwaa powu gaanɩ. A berema bɩfɩɩ ma buu bekpen a ye aa bɛnɩ gɛtɛ a tiri a ye Egyipiti gɛtɛ bàà mɛ aayo fɔ bɔɔ bʋnʋn, ɔkʋna gɛtɛ bɛ̀ san bɛɛ fɔrɔ fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 7:24" />A mɛ Isareli bete awɔ gbagba aa bɛnɩ gakpaakpa, gɛ awɔ Yahwe a biligi boo Wurubwarɛ. <verse eid="2SA 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 7:25" />Nkele, Yahwe, Wurubwarɛ, yɛ aade gɛtɛ a dɔ̀ a sɩ̀ a tɛ aasaranyan ma wɔ dɩkpaara fɔ yàà ba waanɩ gakpaakpa. Mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ a dɔ̀ a sɩ̀ fɔ, <verse eid="2SA 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 7:26" />gɛlɛ fɔ aa diyere daà ye gakpaakpa. Fɔ bɛnɩ baà dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Yahwe-Kpatakpɩrɩ fɔ è di Wurubwarɛ tɛ Isareli.&gt; Gɛ aasaranyan Dafidi dɩkpaara daà yela gakpaakpa aa bʋnʋn. <verse eid="2SA 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 7:27" />Oo Yahwe Ɔkɛma wuute, Isareli bete boo Wurubwarɛ a tiri ade nyayɩ a wùlà nmɩ aasaranyan, gɛ a dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Nan sere dɩkpaara n tɛ wɔ̀.&gt; Gɛlɛ wuu koro aasaranyan wo koro gi ton wɔ, gɛ e tiri onyun nyawʋ ɛ tɛ wɔ̀ alan, <verse eid="2SA 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 7:28" />&lt;Oo Yahwe-Kpatakpɩrɩ, à di Wurubwarɛ, aa di aade-dɔ̀lɛ-sɩ̀lɛ yii koro, gɛ a dɔ̀ ade-kpara nyayɩ à sɩ̀ aasaranyan. <verse eid="2SA 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 7:29" />Nkele yɛ wàà mɛ aa gelenbi gɛtɛ àà hira nmɩ aasaranyan dɩkpaara, fɔ wàà sara gɛlɛ wu ma ye aa bʋnʋn baanɩ gakpaakpa. Yema awɔ, Yahwe-Kpatakpɩrɩ a tabʋrʋ a sɩ̀, gɛ aa gehira fɔ gii koro aasaranyan dɩkpaara daà wura gehira gakpaakpa.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2SA 8" />
  <para style="s1">Akpa-akpa gɛtɛ Dafidi e di yii koro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 8:1" />Ɔya wʋkɩ waanɩ fɔ, Dafidi ɛ tà bɩtà ma Filisiti bete, gɛ e di boo koro, gɛ ɛ nyɩ bɛ ɛ sa wɔ gatɩn, gɛ e to Gati gɛtɛ dì di boo ditele-dɩrɛ.<verse eid="2SA 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 8:2" />Dafidi e di Mowabi bete mɔ boo koro, gɛ ɛ yɛ bɛnɩ fɔ bɛ dʋrɔ gɛtʋnkwaa, ɩgba yaanɩ, gɛ ɛ ka ɔŋʋʋ ɛ kɛrɛ bɛ. Ɛ̀ kɛrɛ ɔŋʋʋ fɔ dɩnyɔɔ-kamasɛ fɔ, ɛ yɛ be wolo bɛ. Mɔ gengyi ɛ̀ kɛrɛ ɔgba siyeefɛ fɔ, ɛ yɛ be kere bɛ bɛ ya bàà sara nkpa. Mowabi bete gɛtɛ be kere bɛ bɛ ya ben wolo fɔ, be biligi Dafidi bɛsʋmalɛ, gɛ gɩkyan-kamasɛ fɔ, bee le sɩka bɛ tɛ Dafidi.<verse eid="2SA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 8:3" />Ɛwʋ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ fɩya fɔ, Dafidi ɛ kpà ma Rehobi wobi Hadadese gɛtɛ è di Soba wogyu, ɔkʋna gɛtɛ ɛɛ fɔrɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ma to Efurati getu gɩɩ gɛtʋnkwaa gɩɩlanlan fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 8:4" />Gɛ Dafidi e gye Hadadese wo tiiramisan ɛbɛ nkpɩn ton (1,000), ma tiiramisan ɛbɛ yɩɩ bɛsaralɛ ɩgbaa isiyee ma nkpɩn ton (7,000), ma bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ san ma bɩsɩrɩ disepekyi dɩkɩ (20,000). Gɛ Dafidi e kebi tiiramisan ɛbɛ baabengyi fɔ yɩɩ-ɩsɩrɩ-kpa, mɔ e kere baanɩ akpilin ton (100) ɛ ya bàà tiira tiiramisan ɛbɛ akpilin ton (100) fɔ.<verse eid="2SA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 8:5" />Gɛ ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Siriya bete gɛtɛ be ye Damasiko bɛ ba bàà bɛ kpà Soba wogyu Hadadese fɔ, Dafidi e wolo Siriya bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtalɛ fɔ disepekyi ma gbaa (22,000). <verse eid="2SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 8:6" />Okoro Dafidi ɛ ka bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ akpen-akpen ɛ sɩ̀ Damasiko ditele diinyun, gɛ Siriya bete bɛ sara Dafidi wɔ gatɩn, gɛ be le lonpoo bɛ tɛ wɔ. Gɛ Yahwe ɛ yɛ Dafidi e di akpa yii koro ɔkʋn-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛ san fɔ.<verse eid="2SA 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 8:7" />Dafidi ɛ ka Hadadese wɔ bɛndɩrɛ-bi bɔɔ sɩka-sɩya wanyan dɩyɛlɛ koro bɩtà baanɩ fɔ, gɛ bɛ ka yɩ bɛ ba Yerusalem. <verse eid="2SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 8:8" />Egyu-dɩrɛ Dafidi e biri e kpila awɔrɔnyan-sɩya kpekpesi e ye Teba ma Berotayi atele gɛtɛ ì di Hadadese watele fɔ yaanɩ.<verse eid="2SA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 8:9" />Gɛ Hamati wogyu Toyi ɛ nʋn alɛ, Dafidi e di Hadadese ma wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtalɛ powu boo koro fɔ, <verse eid="2SA 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 8:10" />ɛ sa wobi Yoram Egyu-dɩrɛ Dafidi wakʋn ɛ̀ɛ̀ ma sa wɔ onyun, fɔ èè sila wɔ gɛtɛ e di Hadadese gɛtɛ ɛɛ tɩ̀ kpà ma ɛwɔ Toyi fɔ wo koro. Yoram ɛ ka sɩka-fututu, ma sɩka-sɩya, ma gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya ɛ ma tɛ wɔ.<verse eid="2SA 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 8:11" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ Dafidi ɛ ka anyan nyayɩ powu ɛ tɛ Yahwe anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ fʋrʋma ɛ ka sɩka-sɩya ma sɩka-fututu, gɛtɛ e wura e ye bɩfɩɩ gɛtɛ e di buu koro ɛ tɛ Yahwe fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 8:12" />Ntʋnkwaa gɛtɛ Dafidi e di buu koro fɔ n di, Edom, ma Mowabi, ma Amon, ma Filisiti, ma Amaleki. Dafidi ɛ nɩ ka anyan gɛtɛ e wura e ye Rehobi wobi Hadadese gɛtɛ è di Soba wogyu wakʋn fɔ ɛ tɛ Yahwe.<verse eid="2SA 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 8:13" />Okoro ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛ ma wolo Edom bete ɩgbaa yɛkɩ (18,000) Bʋbɔlɛ bʋʋ Dɩtagba daanɩ e were, gɛ e biri e ye dʋkɔ e be gyu fɔ, e di diyere gepepe.<verse eid="2SA 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 8:14" />Gɛ ɛ ka bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ akpen-akpen ɛ sɩ̀ Edom gɩfɩɩ gaanɩ. Gɛ Edom bete fɔ be biligi Dafidi bɛsʋmalɛ. Gɛ Yahwe ɛ yɛ Dafidi e di akpa powu yii koro ɔkʋn-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛ san fɔ.<verse eid="2SA 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dafidi Bɛndɩrɛ-bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 8:15" />Okoro Dafidi e di bugyu ɛ tɛ Isareli bete powu, gɛ ɛ mɛ ade gɛtɛ ì we kyɛkyɛ, gɛ ɩ̀ tʋna ɛ tɛ wɔ bɛnɩ powu. <verse eid="2SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 8:16" />Fɔ Seruya wobi Yowabi è di gɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ bɔɔndɩrɛ, gɛ Ayiludi wobi Yewosafati mɔ è di gɛ ɛŋwaralɛ. <verse eid="2SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 8:17" />Ahitubi wobi Sadoki, ma Abiyata wobi Ahimeleki mɔ bè di gɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ, gɛ Seraya mɔ è di gɛ ɛŋwaralɛ, <verse eid="2SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 8:18" />Yehoyada wobi Benaya è di Kereti bete ma Peleti bete bɔɔnyalɛ, gɛ Dafidi bebi mɔ bè di wɔ bɛndɩrɛ-bi.<verse eid="2SA 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2SA 9" />
  <para style="s1">Dafidi ma Mefiboseti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 9:1" />Gɛ Dafidi e lila alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛnɩ ɛkɩ e ni kuruma Sawulo dɩkpaara, gɛtɛ nan tiri miin gelen n wùlà wɔ Yonatan wo koro?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 9:2" />Ɔkʋna wʋtɔkɔ fɔ, Sawulo dɩkpaara dɩɩsaranyan ɛkɩ ɛ sara gɛtɛ bee kpèlè wɔ alɛ Siba. Be kpèlè wɔ bɛ mɔma Dafidi, gɛ e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Awɔ n di Siba?&gt;&gt; Gɛ e yera alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩɩn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 9:3" />Gɛ Dafidi e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛkɩ en mini kuruma Sawulo dɩkpaara, gɛtɛ nan tiri Wurubwarɛ gelen n wùlà wɔ?&gt;&gt; Gɛ Siba e tiri wuunyun ɛ tɛ egyu Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Yonatan wobi-teni ɛkɩ gɛtɛ è di ɔtagasɩ fɔ n sa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 9:4" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ Dafidi e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ganɩ gɛ ɛ̀ sa?&gt;&gt; Gɛ Siba e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛ̀ sa Lo-Deba ditele, Amile wobi Makiri dɩkpaara.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 9:5" />Gɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ Dafidi ɛ sa bɛnɩ Lo-Deba ditele, Amile wobi Makiri dɩkpaara, gɛ bɛ ma ka wɔ bɛ ba.<verse eid="2SA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 9:6" />Gɛtɛ Yonatan wobi Mefiboseti gɛtɛ è di Sawulo wɔnana ɛ ba Dafidi wakʋn fɔ, ɛ waran e kura gebù gaanɩ. Gɛ Dafidi e kpèlè wɔ alan,&lt;&lt;Mefiboseti!&gt;&gt; Gɛ Mefiboseti e yera wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Miinfonte!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 9:7" />Gɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Kara yɛ gɩsaa gàà ton wɔ̀, yema nan nyɩ n tiri gɩnɩ-gelen n wùlà wɔ̀, aate Yonatan wo koro. Nan birima ntʋnkwaa gɛtɛ bu di aatu Sawulo woyo fɔ powu n tɛ wɔ̀. Gɛ aà di ma nmɩ mɩɩnkpʋlɔ wuu koro ɔya-kamasɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 9:8" />Gɛ Mefiboseti ɛ waran e kura gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛnyan gɛ nmɩ aasaranyan ǹ di, gɛ a kʋna nmɩ gɛtɛ n we anlɛ ɛkpɛɛ-kulɛ lɛ miin koro?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 9:9" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ Dafidi e kpèlè Sawulo wɔsaranyan Siba, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ǹ de gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ gì di Sawulo ma wɔ dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ powu booyo fɔ ntɛ tɛ aafonte wɔnana. <verse eid="2SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 9:10" />Awɔ ma aa bebi, ma aa bɛsaranyan yaà fʋn gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ, fɔ yàà ka anyandilɛ ɩ bɛ tɛ wɔ, fɔ aafonte wɔnana èè wura anyandilɛ. Mɔ Mefiboseti, aafonte wɔnana fɔ bɩrɛ, eè ti di gɛ mɩɩnkpʋlɔ wuu koro.&gt;&gt; Fɔ Siba ɛ̀ ba bebi-teni fwo-ton, ma bɛsaranyan dikpilin. <verse eid="2SA 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 9:11" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Siba ɛ dɔ̀ Egyu-dɩrɛ Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Miinfonte, nmɩ aasaranyan nan mɛ ade-kamasɛ gɛtɛ a dɔ̀ mɩ fɔ.&gt;&gt; Okoro Mefiboseti e di egyu Dafidi wɔkpʋlɔ wuu koro anlɛ egyu bebi-tenibi fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 9:12" />Fɔ Mefiboseti ɛ̀ ba ebi-teni gɛtɛ bee kpèlè wɔ alɛ Mika. Gɛ Siba dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ powu be biligi Mefiboseti bɛsaranyan. <verse eid="2SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 9:13" />Okoro Mefiboseti ɛ sara Yerusalem, yema ee di gɛ egyu Dafidi wɔkpʋlɔ wuu koro ɔya-kamasɛ. Mɔ Mefiboseti è di gɛ ɔtagasɩ.<verse eid="2SA 9:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2SA 10" />
  <para style="s1">Dafidi e di Amon bete boo koro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 10:1" />Nyawʋ wʋʋ gama fɔ, Amon bete boogyu fɔ e ku, gɛ wobi Hanun e di bugyu e sere wɔ gɩsɩrɩ. <verse eid="2SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 10:2" />Gɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Nan tiri gɩnɩ-kpara n wùlà Nahasa wobi Hanun, anlɛ gɛtɛ wote e tiri gɩnɩ-kpara e wùlà mɩ fɔ.&gt;&gt; Okoro Dafidi ɛ sa wɔ bɛsaranyan gɛ bɛ ma sa wɔ wote diku fɔ diinyun. Gɛtɛ Dafidi bɛsaranyan fɔ bɛ ma gyu Amon bete bɔɔ gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ fɔ, <verse eid="2SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 10:3" />Amon bete bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛ be lila boofonte Hanun alan, &lt;&lt;Aa to a di alɛ Dafidi bɛsaranyan gɛtɛ ɛ sa aakʋn bàà bɛ sa wɔ̀ onyun lɛ, wù di gɛ gebù gɛ è de ɛɛ tɛ aate? Dafidi ɛn sa gɛ wɔ bɛsaranyan fɔ alɛ bɛ bɛ nya ditele fɔ bàà kpà ma ɛtɩ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 10:4" />Okoro Hanun e gye Dafidi bɛsaranyan fɔ, gɛ ɛ wɔrɔ baanɩ-kamasɛ bikpri ɔfan, gɛ be kebi bɔɔ ngba bʋʋ gama gatɩn-gatɩn, gɛ e berema bɛ.<verse eid="2SA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 10:5" />Gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛ nʋn ade fɔ, ɛ sa bɛnɩ gɛ bɛ ma tuma bɛ, yema bɛ sa bɛ ɩnɩnfa gepepe. Gɛ egyu Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ sara Yeriko ma sere gɛtɛ yii bikpri fɔ bàà gyu, pɛ yàà ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 10:6" />Gɛtɛ Amon bete bɛ nyɩnla alɛ bɛ sa Dafidi owurufa fɔ, bɛ ma hayɩ Siriya bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ san ma bɩsɩrɩ disepekyi (20,000) be ye Beti-Rebo, ma Soba. Gɛlɛ ke gɛ bɛ hayɩ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ nkpɩn ton (1,000) be ye Maaka wogyu wakʋn. Gɛ be ni biri bɛ hayɩ bɛnɩ ɩgbaa kooron (12,000) mɔ be ye Tobi wakʋn.<verse eid="2SA 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 10:7" />Gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛ nʋn ade nyayɩ fɔ, ɛ sa Yowabi ma bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ powu bàà ma kpà ma ɛbɛ. <verse eid="2SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 10:8" />Gɛ Amon bete fɔ be be yela ditele fɔ diitunu, fɔ Siriya bete gɛtɛ be ye Soba ma Rehobi, ma bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be ye Tobi ma Maaka fɔ mɔ bɛ pɩna koro bè yela gama bee so akpa.<verse eid="2SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 10:9" />Gɛtɛ Yowabi e we alɛ bɛnɩ fɔ be silin be tuma wɔ bʋnʋn ma wɔ gama fɔ, e tiri Isareli bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ nyɩ̀ akpa fɔ bɛkɩ, gɛ e gyegeye bɔɔ bʋnʋn gɛ bɛ kpà ma Siriya bete fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 10:10" />Yowabi ɛ ka bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ-kurumakyɛɛ fɔ ɛ sa wonobi Abisayi gʋlɔ, gɛ e tiri bɛ osele alɛ bɛ ma kpà ma Amon bete fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 10:11" />Gɛ Yowabi ɛ dɔ̀ wonobi Abisayi alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi Siriya bete fɔ bɔɔkɛma wʋ̀ da mɩ fɔ, wù di gɛtɛ àà bɛ kpà mɩ, mɔ gengyi Amon bete fɔ bɔɔkɛma wʋ̀ da wɔ̀ fɔ, nmɩ mɔ nan bɛ kpa wɔ̀. <verse eid="2SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 10:12" />Yela kin-kin fɔ àà yɛ taà sere oturu tɩ kpà tɩ tɛ tɩɩ bɛnɩ, ma Wurubwarɛ atele fɔ. Yahwe ɛɛ̀ mɛ ɛwʋ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ kɔlɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 10:13" />Gɛtɛ Yowabi ma wɔ bɛnɩ be serenti be gyu gɛtɛ bàà ma kpà ma Siriya bete fɔ, Siriya bete fɔ be serenti. <verse eid="2SA 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 10:14" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Amon bete fɔ be we alɛ Siriya bete fɔ bee serenti fɔ, ɛbɛ mɔ be serenti be ye Abisayi bʋnʋn, gɛ be be gyu ditele fɔ daanɩ. Okoro Yowabi e ye akpa fɔ yaanɩ ɛ ba Yerusalem.<verse eid="2SA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 10:15" />Nkele Siriya bete be we gɛtɛ nka bɔɔ dɩkʋsʋ n di Isareli bete, okoro be tuma akpi fɔ powu ɔkʋn-kɩlɩn. <verse eid="2SA 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 10:16" />Gɛ Hadadese ɛ sa bɛnɩ, gɛ bɛ ma ka Siriya bete be ye Efurate getu giifen. Gɛ Sobaki gɛtɛ è di Hadadese bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔndɩrɛ fɔ e gyegeye bɔɔ bʋnʋn, gɛ bɛ san Helam ditele daanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 10:17" />Gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛ nʋ̀n ade nyayɩ fɔ, ɛ kʋla Isareli bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ powu, gɛ bɛ kààrà Yodan getu fɔ, gɛ bɛ da Helam ditele daanɩ. Fɔ Siriya bete fɔ bɛ tɩyɛ akpa yɩɩ gba bàà kpà ma Dafidi. <verse eid="2SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 10:18" />Mɔ Siriya bete fɔ be serenti be ye Isareli bete fɔ baakʋn, gɛ Dafidi e wolo Siriya bete boo betiiramisan yɩɩ bɛsaralɛ fɔ baanɩ nkpɩn bisiyee ma akpilin ton (700), ma bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ san ma bɩsɩrɩ asepekyi anyɔɔ (40,000). Dafidi e wolo Sobaki gɛtɛ è di bɔɔ bɩtà bʋʋtàlɛ ɛndɩrɛ fɔ dʋkɔ. <verse eid="2SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 10:19" />Gɛtɛ begyu gɛtɛ bɛ mɛ onyun-kɩlɩn ma Hadadese fɔ powu be we alɛ Isareli bete be di boo koro fɔ, bɛ ka koro bɛ tɛ Isareli bete fɔ, gɛ bɛ sara bɔɔ gatɩn. Okoro gɩsaa gi ton Siriya bete fɔ gɛtɛ bàà biri nɩ mɛ onyun ma Amon bete, fɔ bàà kpà ma Isareli bete.<verse eid="2SA 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2SA 11" />
  <para style="s1">Dafidi ma Batiseba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 11:1" />Ɛsʋn gɛnʋ̀n gɩɩya gaawi-gyegeyelɛ yaanɩ gɛtɛ begyu bɛɛ san akpa fɔ, Dafidi ɛ sa Yowabi, ma egyu bɛnɩ, ma Isareli bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ powu, gɛ bɛ ma muru Amon bete, gɛ bɛ sʋ Raba ditele bɛ sa. Mɔ Dafidi ɛ wɔ ɛ sara Yerusalem ditele daanɩ.<verse eid="2SA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 11:2" />Gɛ duwi dɩkɩ ɔgyɔlɔ Dafidi ɛ tɔ e ye wɔ gɛdʋrɔkʋn gɛ ɛ̀ san ɛ̀ san wo digyu-kwo dɩɩ gɛwalɩkʋn gatala, gɛ e we ɛnanɩ ɛkɩ ye gatala dʋkɔ ee kù. Fɔ ɛnanɩ fɔ ɛ̀ ba ɔmɩrɩ gepepe. <verse eid="2SA 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 11:3" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Dafidi ɛ sa ɛnɩ ɛkɩ alɛ ɛ ma lila alɛ ɛnyan gɛ wù di. Gɛ ɛnɩ fɔ ɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Wù di Eliyam wobi-nanɩ Batiseba, gɛtɛ è di Hiti-te Uriya wɔsɔ fɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 11:4" />Gɛ Dafidi ɛ sa bɛnɩ bɛ ma kpèlè wɔ bɛ ba. Gɛtɛ e be gyu fɔ, Dafidi ɛ dʋrɔ ma ɛwɔ. (Fɔ ɛnanɩ fɔ ɛ bɔ e kù e were.) Wʋ gama fɔ e biri ɛ da dɩkpaara. <verse eid="2SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 11:5" />Gamama fɔ ɛnanɩ fɔ e we gɛtɛ è de diboro, gɛ ɛ sa Dafidi ɔtʋn alan, &lt;&lt;Ǹ de diboro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 11:6" />Okoro Dafidi ɛ sa Yowabi ɔtʋn alan,&lt;&lt;Yɛ Hiti-te Uriya ɛ̀ɛ̀ kya mɩ gʋlɔ.&gt;&gt; Gɛ Yowabi ɛ yɛ Uriya ɛ ba Dafidi wakʋn. <verse eid="2SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 11:7" />Gɛtɛ Uriya ɛ ba wakʋn fɔ, Dafidi e lila wɔ anlɛ gɛtɛ Yowabi è si, gɛ e lila wɔ anlɛ gɛtɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ bè we, ma anlɛ gɛtɛ akpa fɔ ɩɩ san. <verse eid="2SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 11:8" />Gɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ Uriya alan, &lt;&lt;San aa dɩkpaara, fɔ àà ma tuna.&gt;&gt; Gɛtɛ Uriya e ye digyu-kpara dʋkɔ fɔ, egyu Dafidi ɛ yɛ bɛ ka anyan-kyɛlɛ bɛ ma tɛ wɔ. <verse eid="2SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 11:9" />Mɔ Uriya ɛn san wɔ dɩkpaara. Ɛwɔ ma wofonte bɛsaranyan fɔ powu bɛ dʋrɔ gɛ digyu-kpaara fɔ diitunu.<verse eid="2SA 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 11:10" />Gɛtɛ bɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Uriya ɛn san wɔ dɩkpaara&gt;&gt; fɔ, Dafidi e lila Uriya alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ an san dɩkpaara, aasɔ wakʋn gɛtɛ a ye ditele a kyɛrɩ lɛ? &gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 11:11" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Uriya ɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ, ma Isareli bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ ma Yuda bete bɛ̀ dɔ ayan-kwo yaanɩ, gɛ miinfonte Yowabi ma wɔ bɛsaranyan mɔ bɛ̀ dɔ okòro dɩfa daanɩ. Waà mɛ lan gɛ nmɩ nan talɩ n san mɩɩn dɩkpaara n ma di, fɔ nan nyʋn, fɔ nan dʋrɔ ma mɩɩnsɔ? Na nya gɛtɛ à si nkpa lɛ, mɩn nan mɛ gɛlɛ gaade n nya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 11:12" />Gɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ Uriya alan, &lt;&lt;Sara nfan duwi-kɩlɩn fɩya, fɔ gɩsa nan tiri wɔ̀ osele.&gt;&gt; Okoro Uriya ɛ wɔ Yerusalem duwi dɩtɔkɔ, ma duwi-nyɔɔfɛ fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 11:13" />Gɛ Dafidi e kpèlè wɔ alɛ e be di ma ɛwɔ. Uriya e di gɛ ɛ yɛ wɔ ɛ nyʋn bʋkan e suu. Mɔ gɛtɛ ofila wu gyu fɔ, Uriya ɛ ma dʋrɔ wofonte bɛsaranyan fɔ baakʋn, ɛn san wɔ dɩkpaara.<verse eid="2SA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 11:14" />Gɛtɛ kere gɩ kpa gagyɩgyan fɔ, Dafidi ɛ ŋwara gɩkpa ɛ tɛ Uriya alɛ ɛ ka ɛ san ma Yowabi.<verse eid="2SA 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 11:15" />Ɛ ŋwara gɩkpa fɔ gaanɩ alan, &lt;&lt;Ka Uriya yela akpa fɔ yɩɩgba-gyegeyelɛ waanɩ, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ wʋ̀ ba ɔkɛma fɔ, fɔ àà kere wɔ ya, anlɛ gɛtɛ waà mɛ gɛ bàà wolo wɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 11:16" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro gɛtɛ Yowabi ɛ bɛ sʋ ditele fɔ ɛ sa fɔ, ɛ yɛ Uriya ɛ ma yela ɔkʋn gɛtɛ ɛ̀ nyɩ̀ alɛ bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ fɔ bɔɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ ba ɔkɛma fɔ bɛ̀ sa fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 11:17" />Gɛtɛ ditele fɔ dɩɩ bɛnɩ be ye bɛ ba bàà bɛ kpà ma Yowabi fɔ, Dafidi bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ baanɩ bɛkɩ fɩya ma Hiti-te Uriya be ku. <verse eid="2SA 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 11:18" />Gɛ Yowabi ɛ sa bɛ ma dɔ̀ Dafidi ade gɛtɛ i sere akpa fɔ yaanɩ powu. <verse eid="2SA 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 11:19" />Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ ɛwɔ gɛtɛ ɛ sa fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi à dɔ̀ ade gɛtɛ i sere akpa fɔ yaanɩ powu a tɛ egyu Dafidi a were, <verse eid="2SA 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 11:20" />gɛ gengyi egyu Dafidi ɛ̀ ka owurufa, gɛ è lila wɔ alan, &lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ ɩ gbɛma yɩɩ bɛkyʋnlɛ fɔ boo ditele alɛ ɩ ma kpà? Ɩɩn nyɩ̀ alɛ ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bè yela ɩpɔrɩ fɔ yii koro fɔ baà tà yɩ bɩsɩnta be ye dʋkɔ? <verse eid="2SA 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 11:21" />Ɛnyan na wolo Yerube-seti wobi Abimeleki? Nka ɛnanɩ na fun dɩtaa-kpààràlɛ na ye ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wʋʋ gatala na bɛ nyɩ wɔ, gɛ e ku Tebesi ditele daanɩ?&gt; Anʋn yii koro gɛ i yela ɩ gbɛma ɔpɔrɩ fɔ? Gengyi e lila wɔ gɛlɛ fɔ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;Aasaranyan Hiti-te Uriya mɔ e ku.&gt;&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 11:22" />Okoro ɛsalɛ fɔ ɛ da, gɛ gɛtɛ ɛ ma gyu dʋkɔ fɔ, ɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi ade gɛtɛ Yowabi ɛ sa wɔ alɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ fɔ powu. <verse eid="2SA 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 11:23" />Ɛsalɛ fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Bɛnɩ fɔ be wura ɔkɛma tii koro, gɛ be ye okòro be be gyu taanɩ, mɔ ti berema bɛ tɩ san ditele fɔ diitunu. <verse eid="2SA 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 11:24" />Gɛ bɔɔ bɩsɩnta bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ bɛ tà aa bɛsaranyan fɔ bɩsɩnta be ye ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wʋʋ gatala, gɛ aa bɛnɩ fɔ bɛkɩ be ku. Aasaranyan Uriya Hiti-te fɔ mɔ e ku.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 11:25" />Gɛ egyu Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ ɛsalɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Dɔ̀ Yowabi alan, &lt;Kara yɛ nyawʋ wàà yɔ wɔ̀ koro, yema akpa yaanɩ bɩrɛ, ɛnɩ-kamasɛ ɛɛ̀ talɩ e ku. Ɩ sa aniya, fɔ yàà muru ditele fɔ.&gt; Dɔ̀ gɛlɛ sa Yowabi aniya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 11:26" />Gɛtɛ Uriya wɔsɔ ɛ nʋn alɛ wɔsan e ku fɔ, e wula wɔ. <verse eid="2SA 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 11:27" />Ɔya gɛtɛ e wula wɔsan e were fɔ, Dafidi ɛ sa bɛ ma ka wɔ bɛ ba wɔ dɩkpaara, gɛ e biligi wɔsɔ, gɛ e wo ebi-tenibi ɛ tɛ wɔ. Mɔ ade gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛ mɛ fɔ in di Yahwe gʋnʋn.<verse eid="2SA 11:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2SA 12" />
  <para style="s1">Natan ɛ dɔ̀ ade e sere Dafidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 12:1" />Yahwe ɛ sa Natan Dafidi wakʋn. Gɛ gɛtɛ e gyu wakʋn fɔ, ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Beteni bɛnyɔɔ bɛkɩ bɛ sara ditele dɩkɩ daanɩ, ɛkɩ ɛ̀ ba kɔba, gɛ ɛnyɔɔfɛ fɔ è di eyenpu. <verse eid="2SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 12:2" />Kɔba-te fɔ ɛ̀ ba bɛyɛran ma bɛkwɔ kpekpesi. <verse eid="2SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 12:3" />Mɔ eyenpu fɔ bɩrɛ ɛn ma gɩnyankɩ fɩya ma dɩyɛranbi-nanɩ gɛtɛ e siye fɔ, gɛ ɛ nya dii koro, gɛ dɩ dan ma ɔmɩrɩ ɛwɔ ma wo bebi baakʋn. Ɛwɔ ma dɩyɛranbi fɔ n te di wanyandilɛ, gɛ kuruwa-kɩlɩn anɩ gɛ bɛɛ nyʋn butu, gɛ ɛɛ dʋrɔ gɛ walɔ yaanɩ gba. Ɛyɛran fɔ ɛ̀ bɔ e we wɔ anlɛ wobi-nanɩbi. <verse eid="2SA 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 12:4" />Duwi dɩkɩ kɔba-te fɔ e wura esela, mɔ en len gɛtɛ èè gye wɔkwɔ, abɛɛ wɔyɛran fɔ ɛkɩ e ye wɔ bɛnan kpekpesi fɔ baanɩ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ka ɛ mɛ anyandilɛ tɛ wosela fɔ. Gɛ ɛ ma gye eyenpu fɔ wɔ yɛran-kɩlɩn gɛtɛ ɛ̀ ba fɔ, gɛ ɛ ka ɛ mɛ anyandilɛ ɛ tɛ esela gɛtɛ ɛ ba wakʋn fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 12:5" />Dʋkɔ fɔ Dafidi ɛ ka owurufa gepepe kɔba-te fɔ wo koro, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ Natan alan, &lt;&lt;Na nya Yahwe gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa lɛ na tɛ wɔ̀ alɛ, ete gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ gɛlɛ gaade nyayɩ fɔ, ɛ kʋtʋma diku. <verse eid="2SA 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 12:6" />Wù di gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ka bɛyɛran bɛnaa e le gutoro e sere ɛkɩlɩn fɔ gɩsɩrɩ, yema en we eyenpulɛ fɔ gutunkoro, gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ gɛlɛ gaade lɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 12:7" />Dʋkɔ fɔ Natan ɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Awɔ n di ete fɔ. Yahwe, Isareli bete boo Wurubwarɛ ɛɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Na sʋrʋ wɔ̀ bʋnɔ alɛ mɛ Isareli bete boogyu, gɛ na tiri wɔ̀ na ye Sawulo walɔ yaanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 12:8" />Na ka aafonte dɩkpaara na tɛ wɔ̀. Gɛ na ka aafonte wɔsɔ ɛbɛ na sa aalɔ yaanɩ. Na ka Isareli ma Yuda bugyu na tɛ wɔ. Gɛ gengyi nyayɩ powu ɩn sɔ wɔ̀ fɔ, nafɔ nan fɩya wɔ̀ kpekpesi. <verse eid="2SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 12:9" />Anʋn yii koro gɛ a kere Wurubwarɛ ade a ya, gɛ a mɛ ade-kpen wɔ bʋnʋn baanɩ anlɛ? A wolo Hiti-te Uriya, gɛ a ka wɔsɔ a to gɩna. Amon bete gɛ a yɛ be wolo wɔ bɩtà baanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 12:10" />Nyawʋ wuu koro, akpa yaanɩ yii diku ɩn nan were aa dɩkpaara ɩ nya, yema an bù mɩ, gɛ a ka Hiti-te Uriya wɔsɔ a to gɩna.&gt; <verse eid="2SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 12:11" />Yahwe ɛɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Nan yɛ ade-kpen yàà ye awɔ gbagba aa dɩkpaara ɩ ba aa koro. Nan to aasɔ ɛbɛ n tɛ eteni-fon, gɛ ɛɛ̀ dʋrɔ ma ɛbɛ ofila-kenken aa bʋnʋn baanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 12:12" />Awɔ a mɛ wʋ dibilin daanɩ, mɔ nmɩ bɩrɛ, nan mɛ wʋ Isareli bete powu bɔɔ bʋnʋn ofila-kenken.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 12:13" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ Natan alan, &lt;&lt;Na mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe bʋnʋn.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:13">Gɛ Natan ɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe e tiri aade-kpen e ye aa koro. An nan ni ku. <verse eid="2SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 12:14" />Mɔ, gɛtɛ an ka gebù tɛ Yahwe, gɛ a mɛ gɛlɛ gaade nyayɩ okoro, ebi gɛtɛ e wo ɛ tɛ wɔ̀ fɔ eè ku.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 12:15" />Gɛtɛ Natan e biri ɛ da wɔ dɩkpaara fɔ. Yahwe ɛ yɛ ebi gɛtɛ Uriya wɔsɔ e wo ɛ tɛ Dafidi fɔ e gyu geyeba.<verse eid="2SA 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 12:16" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Dafidi ɛ fɔ Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ ebi fɔ èè wura nkpa. Gɛ Dafidi ɛ ban onyun, gɛ e gyu wo dikwo gɛ ɛ waran ɛ dʋrɔ gɛtʋnkwaa odente fɔ powu. <verse eid="2SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 12:17" />Gɛ wɔ dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛndɩrɛ be be koturu wɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ tɔ ye gɛtʋnkwaa, fɔ èè di anyandilɛ, mɔ e terema en di gɩnyankɩ ma ɛbɛ.<verse eid="2SA 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 12:18" />Duwi-kwarankɩfɛ fɔ ebi fɔ e ku. Gɛ gɩsaa gi ton Dafidi bɛsaranyan fɔ, okoro bɛn talɩ dɔ̀ wɔ alɛ, ebi fɔ e ku. Mɔ bɛ tabʋrʋ booko-booko alan, &lt;&lt;Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ ebi fɔ è si nkpa fɔ, tɩ tabʋrʋ ma Dafidi mɔ ɛn nʋn taakʋn. Lan gɛ taà talɩ tɩ dɔ̀ wɔ alɛ, ebi fɔ e ku? An nyɩnla fɔ, ɛɛ̀ mɛ koro ade-kpen.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 12:19" />Mɔ gɛtɛ Dafidi e we gɛtɛ wɔ bɛsaranyan fɔ bɛɛ tabʋrʋ booko-booko fɔ, ɛ nyɩnla gɛtɛ wobi fɔ e ku. Gɛ e lila wɔ bɛsaranyan fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ebi fɔ e ku?&gt;&gt; Gɛ be yera wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩɩn, e ku.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 12:20" />Gɛ Dafidi ɛ tɔ e ye gɛtʋnkwaa, gɛ e kù, gɛ ɛ sʋrʋ bʋnɔ, gɛ e foma wanyan gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa fɔ, gɛ ɛ san Yahwe dɩsʋma-kwo, gɛ ɛ ma sʋma wɔ. Gɛ nkele ɛ san ɛwɔ gbagba wɔ dɩkpaara. Gɛ ɛ yɛ bɛ tɛ wɔ anyandilɛ, gɛ e di.<verse eid="2SA 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 12:21" />Ɛwʋ gɛ wɔ bɛsasaranyan fɔ be lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn gɛ a mɛ lɛ? A ban onyun, gɛ a wula a tɛ ebi fɔ ɔya gɛtɛ ɛ̀ ba nkpa fɔ, mɔ nkele gɛtɛ e ku fɔ, a tɔ, gɛ a di anyandilɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 12:22" />Gɛ e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Na ban onyun, gɛ na wula. Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ ebi fɔ ɛ̀ sa fɔ, na sa amɩnlɛ alɛ, &lt;Ɛnyan nyɩ̀? Nkɩ fɔ, Yahwe eè wula mɩ gutunkoro, fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ yɛ ebi fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ sara nkpa.&gt; <verse eid="2SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 12:23" />Mɔ nkele bɩrɛ e ku. Anʋn yii koro gɛ nan nɩ ban onyun? Ǹ talɩ n birima wɔ n ba nkpa anɩ? Duwi dɩkɩ nmɩ nan san wakʋn, mɔ ɛwɔ ɛn nan biri ɛ ba maakʋn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 12:24" />Gɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ ɛ sa wɔsɔ, Batiseba. Wʋʋ gama fɔ ɛ dʋrɔ ma ɛwɔ, gɛ e wo ebi-tenibi, gɛ ɛ sa wɔ diyere alɛ Solomon. Gɛ Yahwe e len wade, <verse eid="2SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 12:25" />Gɛtɛ Yahwe e len wade okoro, ɛ ka ɔtʋn ɛ dama Yahwe wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Natan wo koro, gɛ ɛ sa wɔ diyere alɛ Yedidiya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yedidiya wuu wùlà alɛ Yahwe ee len mɩ</char></note><verse eid="2SA 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dafidi e di Raba wo koro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 12:26" />Ɔkʋna wʋtɔkɔ fɔ, Yowabi ɛ kpà ma Amon bete, gɛ e to boo digyu-tele-dɩrɛ Raba fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 12:27" />Gɛ Yowabi ɛ sa Dafidi ɔtʋn alan, &lt;&lt;Na kpà ma Raba bete, gɛ na to ditele fɔ dii butu bʋʋ gɛkpàkʋn. <verse eid="2SA 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 12:28" />Nkele kʋla bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ-kurumakyɛɛ fɔ, fɔ yàà sʋ ditele, fɔ sa fɔ yàà to dɩ. Nka gɛlɛ fɔ, nan to ditele-dɩrɛ fɔ, fɔ miin diyere dàà gyaga dii koro.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 12:29" />Gɛlɛ wuu okoro Dafidi ɛ kʋla bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ powu e tuma, gɛ ɛ san ɛ ma kpà ma Raba bete, gɛ e to ditele fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 12:30" />Dafidi e tiri Raba wogyu dikoto e ye wo duyu dii koro, gɛ ɛ ka dɩ e tin. Dikoto fɔ dɩɩdʋrʋ waà mɛ anlɛ sɩka-sɩya bekilo dikpilin ma fwo bɛnaa (34), gɛ bɛ ka ataa-kpara bɛ sa ma ɛdɩ. Gɛ ɛ e kpila baanyan ma kɔba kpekpesi e ye ditele fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 12:31" />Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛ ka bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Raba ditele daanɩ fɔ mɔ ɛ mɛ bɛdɩ, gɛ ɛ nyɩ bɛ, bɛ ka sɔya, ma bɛkpakya, ma bɩlɛlɛ, ma akyɔɔ bɛ mɛ gʋtʋn, gɛ ɛ yɛ bɛ fɔrɩ atɩn be belen birikisi. Gɛlɛ ke gɛ ɛ mɛ Amon atele-kurumakyɛɛ fɔ powu. Gɛ Dafidi ma wɔ bɛnɩ fɔ powu be biri bɛ ba Yerusalem.<verse eid="2SA 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2SA 13" />
  <para style="s1">Aminon ma Tama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 13:1" />Fɔ Dafidi wobi-teni Abisalom ɛ̀ ba enosobi ma ɔmɩrɩ ɛkɩ gɛtɛ bee kpèlè wɔ alɛ Tama. Ɔya wʋkɩ waanɩ fɔ, wade ɩ mɛ wotesebi Aminon ɔmɩrɩ.<verse eid="2SA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 13:2" />Aminon duyu di ku wonosobi Tama wo koro gɛtɛ ɛn taa we ade gɛtɛ ɛɛ̀ mɛ gba, gɛ wʋ sa wɔ geyeba. Fɔ Tama ɛn nyɩ ete.<verse eid="2SA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 13:3" />Fɔ Aminon ɛ̀ ba ɛwɔlɔn ɛkɩ gɛtɛ bee kpèlè wɔ alɛ Yonadabi, gɛ wote n di Dafidi wonobi Simeya. Yonadabi ɛ̀ ba gɛsɛyɩ-kpen. <verse eid="2SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 13:4" />Okoro e lila Aminon alan, &lt;&lt;Oo, egyu wobi, anʋn yii koro gɛ aa bʋnʋn bʋʋ nyaa gɛgyɩgyan-kamasɛ gɛlɛ? Dɔ̀ mɩ ɛwʋ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:4">Ɛwʋ gɛ Amon ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ǹ te len Tama, mɩɩndɩrɛ Abisalom wonosobi fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 13:5" />Gɛ Yonadabi ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ma waran dʋrɔ, fɔ àà mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ aa yeba. Gengyi aate ɛ̀ ba ɛ̀ bɛ nya wɔ̀ fɔ, dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;Nte len miinnosobi Tama ɛ̀ɛ̀ bɛ mɛ anyandilɛ ɩkɩ tɛ mɩ nan di. Nte len wɔ èè be kpele anyandilɛ fɔ mɩɩn bʋnʋn nan we, fɔ nan di yɩ n ye walɔ yaanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 13:6" />Okoro Aminon ɛ ma dʋrɔ, gɛ ɛ mɛ anlɛ ee yeba. Gɛtɛ egyu Dafidi ɛ ba alɛ ɛ̀ bɛ nya wɔ fɔ, Aminon ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ǹ fɔ wɔ̀ gɛ, yɛ miinnosobi Tama ɛ̀ɛ̀ bɛ mɛ boroboro wʋkɩ tɛ mɩ mɩɩn bʋnʋn baanɩ fɔ nan di yɩ n ye walɔ yaanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 13:7" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Dafidi ɛ yɛ bɛ ma kpèlè Tama be ye digyu-kpaara, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;San aatesebi Aminon dɩkpaara, fɔ àà ma mɛ anyandilɛ tɛ wɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 13:8" />Okoro Tama ɛ san wotesebi Aminon gɛtɛ ɛ̀ dɔ fɔ dɩkpaara. Ɛ ka afɩnaa yɩɩnʋmʋ, gɛ ɛ ŋwàrà wʋ, gɛ e kuma boroboro fɔ wɔ bʋnʋn baanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 13:9" />Gɛ e tiri boroboro fɔ ɛ sa kuruwa anɩ ɛ tɛ wɔ, mɔ e terema en di.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:9">Gɛ Aminon ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Yɛ ɛkamasɛ èè ye maakʋn.&gt;&gt; Okoro ɛkamasɛ e ye wakʋn.<verse eid="2SA 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 13:10" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Aminon ɛ dɔ̀ Tama alan, &lt;&lt;Ka anyandilɛ fɔ bɛ tɛ mɩ mɩɩn gɛdʋrɔkʋn fɔ nan di yɩ aalɔ yaanɩ.&gt;&gt; Gɛ Tama ɛ ka boroboro gɛtɛ e kuma fɔ ɛ san ma wotesebi Aminon wɔ gɛdʋrɔkʋn. <verse eid="2SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 13:11" />Mɔ ɔkʋna gɛtɛ ɛ ka anyandilɛ fɔ ɛ san ma wɔ fɔ, Aminon e gye wɔ, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Miinnosobi, yɛ nan dʋrɔ ma awɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 13:12" />Gɛ Tama ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Kwa, miintesebi! Kara tɩtɩrɩ mɩ. Bɛɛn taa mɛ ade nyayɩ yaakɩ Isareli. Kara mɛ duyu-kɛma daade nyayɩ. <verse eid="2SA 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 13:13" />Gaanɩ gɛ nan ka bʋnʋn buu geku gaade nyayɩ n dama? Gɛ awɔ mɔ de? Baà kpèlè wɔ̀ enyimapulɛ kpekpesi Isareli. N fɔ wɔ̀ gɛ, tabʋrʋ ma egyu fɔ, ɛn nan terema alɛ n kara kpà wɔ̀.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 13:14" />Mɔ Aminon ɛn nʋn wakʋn, gɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ ba ɔkɛma da wɔ okoro, ɛ tɩtɩrɩ wɔ e len. <verse eid="2SA 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 13:15" />Ye dʋkɔ fɔ Aminon ɛ kyʋn wɔ kpen-kpen. Ɛ kyʋn wade ɛ da gelen gɛtɛ e tɩ̀ len wɔ fɔ. Gɛ Aminon ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Tɔ ye san!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 13:16" />Mɔ Tama ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Kwa, à berema mɩ fɔ, wù di ade-kpen da ɛwʋ gɛtɛ a wɛrɛ mɛ mɩ lɛ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:16">Mɔ ɛn nʋn wakʋn. <verse eid="2SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 13:17" />Gɛ e kpèlè wɔsaranyan, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Tiri ɛsʋgʋgyan nyawɔ ye mɩɩn bʋnʋn baanɩ, fɔ àà tan dɩtana fɔ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 13:18" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro Aminon wɔsaranyan fɔ e tiira Tama e ye okòro, gɛ ɛ tan dɩtana fɔ. Fɔ ɛ̀ sa gɛgba wurukyaa ma ɔmɩrɩ gɩkɩ, anlɛ gɛtɛ baade mɛlɛ ii wùlà gɛtɛ egyu wobi-nanɩ gɛtɛ ɛn nyɩ ete ɛɛ sa fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 13:19" />Gɛ Tama ɛ ka bʋtɔ ɛ sa wo duyu, gɛ ɛ fɛɛran wɔ gɛgba wurukyaa ma ɔmɩrɩ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa fɔ, gɛ ɛ ka walɔ ɛ gyaga wo duyu dii koro, gɛ ɛ san ɛ da ma gewula kin-kin. <verse eid="2SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 13:20" />Gɛtɛ wotesebi Abisalom e we wɔ fɔ, e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Aatesebi Aminon e len wɔ̀? Miinosobi, kere gewula ya, è di aatesebi, okoro kara ka nyayɩ sa aaturu waanɩ.&gt;&gt; Okoro Tama ɛ wɔ wotesebi Abisalom dɩkpaara gɛtɛ ɛn mɩnɩ taa nɩ fɩya ma bɛnɩ. <verse eid="2SA 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 13:21" />Gɛtɛ egyu Dafidi ɛ nʋn ade nyayɩ powu fɔ, ɛ ka owurufa ɛ kara. <verse eid="2SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 13:22" />Mɔ Abisalom ɛn dɔ̀ ade-kpen abɛɛ ade-kpara ɩkɩ tɛ Aminon. Abisalom ɛ kyʋn Aminon wade, gɛtɛ ɛ tɩtɩrɩ wonosobi Tama e len fɔ wuu koro. <verse eid="2SA 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 13:23" />Bɩkyan bʋnyɔɔ bʋʋ gama gɛtɛ bɛɛ wɔrɔ Abisalom wɔ bɛyɛran baanu Baali-Haso gɛtɛ wʋ̀ gbɛma Efrayim wɔ balan fɔ, ɛ fɩna gʋlɔ e kpèlè egyu Dafidi bebi-teni fɔ powu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yema wù di ɔsɛ-dɩrɛ wuu gedi tɛ bɛyɛran boofonte fɔ.</char></note> <verse eid="2SA 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 13:24" />Gɛ Abisalom ɛ san egyu Dafidi wakʋn, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Mɩɩn bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛɛ wɔrɔ mɩɩn bɛyɛran baanu fɔ bɛ ba. Ntɛ fɔ egyu ma wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi bàà bɛ fɩya ma nmɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 13:25" />Mɔ egyu ɛ dɔ̀ Abisalom alan, &lt;&lt;Kwa, miinbi, wun di gɛtɛ ɛtɩ powu tàà san. Yema taà mɛ ditola-dɩrɛ tɩ tɛ wɔ̀.&gt;&gt; Ma gɛtɛ Abisalom ɛ nyɩ̀ wɔ gepepe gba fɔ, e terema alɛ ɛn nan san, mɔ Dafidi e hira wɔ. <verse eid="2SA 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 13:26" />Gɛ Abisalom ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi gɛlɛ bɩrɛ fɔ, n fɔ wɔ gɛ, yɛ Aminon ɛ̀ɛ̀ san ma ɛtɩ.&gt;&gt; Gɛ egyu Dafidi e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ wù di gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ san ma ɛyɩ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 13:27" />Mɔ Abisalom e yela ade fɔ yii koro ma sere ɔkʋna gɛtɛ wote ɛ tɛ osele alɛ Aminon, ma egyu bebi fɔ powu bɛ nyɩma wɔ bɛ san. <verse eid="2SA 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 13:28" />Gɛ Abisalom ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ bɛsaranyan fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ nʋn, gengyi Aminon ɛ̀ nyʋn bʋkan, gɛ è su, gɛ ee di ɔsɛ, gɛ n dɔ̀ yɩ alan, &lt;I wolo wɔ fɔ!&gt; I wolo wɔ! Ɩ kara yɛ gɩsaa gàà ton yɩ, yema nmɩ na dɔ̀ yɩ alɛ, ɩ mɛ. I sere woturu ɩ mɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 13:29" />Okoro Abisalom bɛsaranyan fɔ bɛ mɛ Aminon anlɛ gɛtɛ Abisalom ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alɛ bɛ mɛ fɔ. Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu bebi fɔ powu bɛ tɔ, gɛ ɛkamasɛ ɛ ka wɔ dɩkpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ, gɛ be serenti bɛ da.<verse eid="2SA 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 13:30" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ bɛ̀ san ma osele bɛɛ fɔrɔ fɔ, ɔtʋn wʋ tama egyu Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Aabi Abisalom e wolo aa bebi fɔ powu, gɛ ɛkɩlɩn gba en kuruma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 13:31" />Gɛ egyu fɔ ɛ tɔ, gɛ ɛ fɛɛran wɔ gɛgba, gɛ ɛ waran ɛ dʋrɔ gɛtʋnkwaa, gɛ wɔ bɛsaranyan gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa wakʋn fɔ mɔ powu bɛ fɛɛran bɔɔ ngba.<verse eid="2SA 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 13:32" />Mɔ Dafidi wonobi Simeya wobi Yonadabi ɛ dɔ̀ egyu Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Miinfonte, kara sa amɩnlɛ alɛ aa bebi fɔ powu be ku. Aminon woko gɛ be wolo. Bo ye duwi gɛtɛ Aminon ɛ tɩtɩrɩ Tama e len fɔ gɛ Abisalom ɛ sa amɩnlɛ alɛ, eè wolo wɔ. <verse eid="2SA 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 13:33" />Miinfonte egyu, kara to di alɛ aa bebi fɔ powu be ku, Aminon woko gɛ be wolo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 13:34" />Ɔkʋna wʋtɔkɔ fɔ, Abisalom e serenti. Gɛ ɛnɩ gɛtɛ è yela Yerusalem ɩpɔrɩ yii koro ɛɛ dɩyɛ fɔ ɛ bʋma bʋnʋn ɛ nya, gɛ e we bɛnɩ kpekpesi dɩdan dii koro, ofila wʋ̀ gɛnʋ̀nkʋn wʋʋ gɩlan gɛtɛ bɛɛ waran odon fɔ wʋʋ bɩlan baanɩ bɛɛ ba. Gɛ ɛdɩyɛlɛ fɔ ɛ ma dɔ̀ egyu alan, &lt;&lt;Na we bɛnɩ bɛkɩ bɛɛ waran Horonayim wodon fɔ wʋʋ bɩlan baanɩ bɛɛ ba.<verse eid="2SA 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 13:35" />Gɛ Yonadabi ɛ dɔ̀ egyu Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Nya, aa bebi fɔ n tɛ ba, wʋ ba waanɩ anlɛ gɛtɛ na bɔ na dɔ̀ fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 13:36" />Gɛtɛ ɛ tabʋrʋ e were fɔ, egyu bebi fɔ be be gyu, gɛ bɛ gbɛrɛ afala be wula kin-kin. Egyu Dafidi ma wɔ bɛsaranyan fɔ powu mɔ be wula gepepe.<verse eid="2SA 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 13:37" />Mɔ Abisalom e serenti ɛ san Gesuri wogyu Amidu wobi Talimayi wakʋn. Mɔ Dafidi ee wula wobi fɔ duwi n di duwi. <verse eid="2SA 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 13:38" />Gɛtɛ Abisalom e serenti ɛ san Gesuri fɔ, ɛ sara dʋkɔ bɩkyan besiyee. <verse eid="2SA 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 13:39" />Gɛ egyu Dafidi e kere Aminon diku fɔ daamɩnlɛ yɩɩ gɛsa ɛ ya, gɛ ɛ yɛ ee bugiti wobi Abisalom.<verse eid="2SA 13:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2SA 14" />
  <para style="s1">Abisalom e biri ɛ ba Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 14:1" />Seruya wobi Yowabi e we gɛtɛ egyu Dafidi woturu waanɩ fɔ ee bugiti wobi Abisalom. <verse eid="2SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 14:2" />Okoro Yowabi ɛ sa bɛ san Tekowa bɛ ma ka ɛnanɩ-sayɩlɛ ɛkɩ gɛtɛ wo diyere di ye gepepe bɛ mɔma wɔ. Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ ɛna fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Mɛ aa koro anlɛ à sa diku daanɩ. Sa diku dɩɩ-ngba. Kara sʋrʋ bʋnɔ, fɔ àà mɛ koro anlɛ ɛnanɩ gɛtɛ ee wula ekulɛ ɛkɩ awi kpekpesi. <verse eid="2SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 14:3" />Fɔ àà san egyu Dafidi wakʋn, fɔ àà dɔ̀ wɔ ade gɛtɛ nan bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ̀ lɛ.&gt;&gt; Gɛ Yowabi ɛ kɔrɔ ɛ sa ɛna fɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 14:4" />Gɛtɛ Tekowa-na fɔ ɛ san egyu wakʋn fɔ, e kura wakpin yii koro, gɛ ɛ ka wɔ bʋnʋn e tin gɛtʋnkwaa gebù gaanɩ, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Egyu ǹ fɔ wɔ̀ gɛ, kpa mɩ ade nyayɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 14:5" />Gɛ egyu fɔ e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn n tɛ ha wɔ̀?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:5">Gɛ e tiri wunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Ǹ di gɛ ɛkpɩnsɔ, mɩɩnsan e ku. <verse eid="2SA 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 14:6" />Nmɩ aasʋgʋgyan n ba bebi-teni bɛnyɔɔ. Gɛ bebi fɔ be gyu akpa ma bɛwɔlɔn dɩfa daanɩ, gɛ ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ɛn ma dʋkɔ èè gye bɛ. Gɛ baanɩ ɛkɩ e tiba wɔwɔlɔn fɔ e wolo. <verse eid="2SA 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 14:7" />Gɛ nkele dɩkpaara fɔ powu dɩ tɔ di yela nmɩ aasʋgʋgyan miin koro, gɛ bɛɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt; Tiri ɛwɔ gɛtɛ e wolo wonobi fɔ ba, fɔ ɛtɩ mɔ taà wolo wɔ ti le wonobi gɛtɛ e wolo fɔ gutoro.&gt; Fɔ bàà mɩna miinbi-kurumakyɛɛ, gɛtɛ ǹ ba fɔ. Nyawʋ waà yɛ mɩɩnsan diyere ma wanyan powu yaà lulu gɛtʋnkwaa nyagɩ gii koro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 14:8" />Gɛ egyu Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ ɛna fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Biri san aa dɩkpaara, nan tɛ ose dama aa koro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 14:9" />Gɛ Tekowa-na fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ egyu Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Oo miinfonte, karan!&gt;&gt;Gengyi gɛkpa gɛtɛ aa kpa mɩ lɛ gii koro ɛkɩ ɛ̀ tabʋrʋ ɛ fɔyɩ wɔ̀ fɔ, giten tiira fɔ gɩ ba nmɩ ma miinte dɩkpaara dii koro. Mɔ egyu ma wo bugyu bɩrɛ, ɩn fɩya waanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 14:10" />Gɛ egyu fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi ɛkɩ ɛ̀ dɔ̀ wɔ̀ ade ɩkɩ fɔ, ka wɔ mɔmɔ mɩ, gɛ ɛn nan nɩ kya wɔ̀ ɛ nya kpa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 14:11" />Gɛ ɛna fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;N fɔ wɔ̀ gɛ, yɛ egyu ɛ̀ɛ̀ ka Yahwe, wɔ Wurubwarɛ fɔ kan ntam alɛ, ɛɛn yɛ ɛnɩ ɛkɩ èè wolo wobi-teni le wɔwɔlɔn fɔ gutoro, fɔ bɛ kara mɩna miinbi.&gt;&gt; Gɛ egyu Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛ̀ sa lɛ, aabi fɔ diyungu-kɩlɩn gba dɩn nan nʋ̀n gɛtʋnkwaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 14:12" />Gɛ ɛna fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Yɛ nmɩ aasʋgʋgyan nàn dɔ̀ digyebi-kɩlɩn tɛ miinfonte egyu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:12">Gɛ egyu Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Tabʋrʋ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 14:13" />Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛna fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ aan mɛ ade gɛtɛ a kan ntam alɛ aà mɛ a tɛ mɩ lɛ a tɛ Wurubwarɛ bɛnɩ? A tin aa koro dɩpwɛ ade gɛtɛ a dɔ̀ lɛ yii koro. Aan taa len awɔ gbagba aabi gɛtɛ e serenti e ye aakʋn fɔ èè biri ba. <verse eid="2SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 14:14" />Wʋ̀ mɛ laan fɔ, ɛkamasɛ eè ku, anlɛ gɛtɛ butu bʋ daa bu lu gɛtʋnkwaa gɛ bʋn taa pe gekpila fɔ. Gengyi tɩ̀ lanla koro ti ye Wurubwarɛ wakʋn fɔ, ɛn taa wolo gɛlɛ, mɔ fɔ, ee tiri isele gɛtɛ yaà ka tɩ wu biri wʋ ba wakʋn.<verse eid="2SA 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 14:15" />Na ba nan bɛ dɔ̀ gɛlɛ gaade nyayɩ n tɛ miinfonte egyu, yema bɛnɩ fɔ bɛ yɛ gɩsaa gi ton mɩ, gɛ nmɩ aasʋgʋgyan n nyɩ̀ gɛtɛ gengyi n tabʋrʋ n tɛ egyu fɔ, nkɩfɔ, ɛɛ̀ mɛ ade gɛtɛ nmɩ wɔsʋgʋgyan ɛɛ̀ dɔ̀ fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 14:16" />Nkɩfɔ egyu eè to tɩ e ye ɛwɔ gɛtɛ ee len ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɩna tɩ fɔ walɔ yaanɩ, yema ee len èè tiri ɛtɩ ma miinbi powu e ye gedikʋn gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛ tɛ tɩ fɔ gaanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 14:17" />Gɛ nkele nmɩ aasʋgʋgyan n fɔ wɔ̀ alan, &lt;Awɔ miinfonte egyu aanyun-gyebi yaà tɛ mɩ getuna, yema awɔ miinfonte egyu à we anlɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔsalɛ, gɛtɛ ɛ̀ nyɩ̀ ade-kpen ma ade-kpara.&gt; Aafonte Wurubwarɛ ɛ fɩya ma awɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 14:18" />Gɛ egyu fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ ɛna fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Kara ka ade gɛtɛ nan lila wɔ̀ lɛ bubwa mɩ.&gt;&gt; Gɛ ɛna fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Tabʋrʋ miinfonte.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 14:19" />Gɛ egyu fɔ e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Nka Yowabi na sa wɔ̀ maakʋn lɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:19">Gɛ ɛna fɔ e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩɩn. Wù di aasaranyan Yowabi na wùlà mɩ alɛ n mɛ gɛlɛ, gɛ ɛ kɔrɔ ɛ sa nmɩ aasʋgʋgyan. Na nya na tɛ wɔ̀ alɛ, ɛkɩ ɛn ma gɛtɛ ɛɛ̀ talɩ ɛ ka ade e bubwa wɔ̀.<verse eid="2SA 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 14:20" />Aasaranyan Yowabi ɛ mɛ gɛlɛ, fɔ wàà foma ade fɔ powu. Mɔ miinfonte ɛ sɛyɩ anlɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔsalɛ, gɛtɛ ɛ̀ nyɩ̀ ade gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa gɛtʋnkwaa gii koro powu.<verse eid="2SA 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 14:21" />Gɛ egyu fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ Yowabi alan, &lt;&lt;Wʋ̀ kɔlɔ, nan mɛ wʋ gɛlɛ. San, fɔ àà ma ka ɛsaranyan Abisalom ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 14:22" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yowabi e kura wakpin yii koro, gɛ ɛ ka wɔ bʋnʋn e tin gɛtʋnkwaa gebù gaanɩ, gɛ ɛ sa wɔ onyun, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ndò, nmɩ aasaranyan na nyɩnla alɛ maade ii di wɔ gʋnʋn. Yema a mɛ waade lilalɛ a tɛ wɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 14:23" />Gɛ Yowabi ɛ san Gesuri ɛ ma ka Abisalom e biri ɛ ba Yerusalem.<verse eid="2SA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 14:24" />Gɛ egyu ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Yɛ wɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ sara ɛwɔ gbagba dɩkpaara. Wun di gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ba mɩɩn bʋnʋn.&gt;&gt; Okoro Abisalom ɛ sara ɛwɔ gbagba dɩkpaara, gɛ ɛn san egyu fɔ bʋnʋn.<verse eid="2SA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 14:25" />Isareli gɩfɩɩ gaanɩ powu fɔ, ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ɛn ma gɛtɛ e ye gɩsaranyan gɛ bee sila anlɛ Abisalom. Ye wo duyu bè sere wɔ bɩsɩrɩ ɛn ma dɩpanɩ dɩkɩ wo koro gaanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 14:26" />Ɛ̀ ba ayungu kpekpesi. Gɛ ee kebi yɩ ɔya-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ì gyu, gɛ ɩ̀ ba wɔ ɔdʋrʋ fɔ. Ɛɛ tɩ̀ kɛrɛ yɩ ɛ nya. Gɛ yɩɩdʋrʋ waà mɛ anlɛ kɔba fututu akpilin ton, anlɛ gɛtɛ egyu wanyan-kɛrɛlɛ ii wùlà fɔ.<verse eid="2SA 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 14:27" />Abisalom e wo bebi-tenibi besiyee, ma ɛnanɩ kɩlɩn. Bee kpèlè ɛnanɩ fɔ alɛ Tama, gɛ ɛ dan ɛ mɛ ɔmɩrɩ gepepe.<verse eid="2SA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 14:28" />Abisalom ɛ sara Yerusalem ditele daanɩ bɩkyan bʋnyɔɔ gɛtɛ en te we egyu fɔ bʋnʋn. <verse eid="2SA 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 14:29" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Abisalom e kpèlè Yowabi alɛ ɛ bɛ ka wɔ ɛ san egyu fɔ wakʋn. Mɔ Yowabi e terema ɛn ba wakʋn. Gɛlɛ wuu koro e biri e kpèlè wɔ dɩnyɔɔfɛ, mɔ e terema ɛn ba.<verse eid="2SA 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 14:30" />Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ bɛsaranyan alan, &lt;&lt;Nya, Yowabi woli n gbɛma miinyo fɔ lɛ, gɛ ɛ̀ ba amɔrɔ dʋkɔ. Ɩ san, ɩ ma sa yɩ ɔtan.&gt;&gt; Okoro Abisalom bɛsaranyan fɔ bɛ ma sa oli fɔ ɔtan. <verse eid="2SA 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 14:31" />Gɛ Yowabi ɛ tɔ, gɛ ɛ san Abisalom dɩkpaara, gɛ e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ aa bɛsaranyan bɛ sa miinli ɔtan?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 14:32" />Abisalom e tiri wuunyun ɛ tɛ Yowabi alan, &lt;&lt;Nya, na sa wɔ ɔtʋn alɛ ba, fɔ nan sa wɔ̀ egyu wakʋn, fɔ àà ma lila wɔ alan, &lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ na ye Gesuri na ba? Gengyi ǹ sangba ǹ sa dʋkɔ gba fɔ, nafɔ wʋ̀ kɔlɔ.&gt;&gt; &gt; Nkele bɩrɛ, nte len nan we egyu bʋnʋn. Gɛ gengyi na mɛ ade-kpen ɩkɩ fɔ, e wolo mɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 14:33" />Okoro Yowabi ɛ san egyu wakʋn, gɛ ɛ ma dɔ̀ wɔ ade fɔ. Gɛ egyu fɔ e kpèlè Abisalom, gɛ ɛ san egyu fɔ wakʋn, gɛ e kura wakpin yii koro, gɛ ɛ warama wɔ bʋnʋn e tin gɛtʋnkwaa gebù gaanɩ, gɛ egyu e mu Abisalom.<verse eid="2SA 14:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2SA 15" />
  <para style="s1">Abisalom ɛ tɔ e yela Dafidi wo koro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 15:1" />Nyayɩ powu yɩɩ gama fɔ, Abisalom e wura tiiramisan ma abengyi ma bɛnɩ akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo, gɛtɛ bee gyegeye wɔ bʋnʋn. <verse eid="2SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 15:2" />Abisalom ɛɛ tɩ̀ tɔ gagyɩgyan-fuu, e be yela ditele fɔ diitunu. Gɛ gengyi ɛnɩ ɛkɩ è de wade ɛɛ ba digyutele bàà dɔ tɛ wɔ fɔ, Abisalom ee kpèlè wɔ, fɔ e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ditele mɔmɔ daanɩ gɛ a ye?&gt;&gt; Gɛ gengyi ɛ̀ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Aasaranyan e ye Isareli wofoli wʋkɩ waanɩ &gt;&gt;fɔ, <verse eid="2SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 15:3" />Abisalom ɛɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Nya, aade ɩ̀ dɔ̀, gɛ ɩ̀ kɔlɔ, mɔ ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ɛn ma gɛtɛ egyu e tiri ɛ sɩ̀ ɛ̀ɛ̀ nʋn aakʋn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 15:4" />Abisalom ee biri ɛ dɔ̀ alan,&lt;&lt;Gengyi nafɔ na wura alɛ ǹ di gɔdɔ gɩɩdɔ̀lɛ gɛtʋnkwaa nyagɩ gaanɩ fɔ, nafɔ ɛkamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ ba wade ɩkɩ fɔ ɛɛ̀ talɩ ɛ ka ɛ mɔma mɩ, fɔ nan dɔ̀ gɔdɔ fɔ n tɛ wɔ aten.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 15:5" />Nkele mɔ, ɔya-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛkɩ è be kura wɔ fɔ, ɛɛ tʋna walɔ e gye wɔ, fɔ e mù wɔ.<verse eid="2SA 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 15:6" />Anlɛ gɛ Abisalom ɛ mɛ Isareli bete powu gɛtɛ bɛ ka baade bɛ ba egyu wakʋn fɔ, gɛ e wura bɛ ɛ ba wɔ gɩlan.<verse eid="2SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 15:7" />Bɩkyan bɩnaa bʋʋ gama fɔ, Abisalom ɛ dɔ̀ egyu alan, &lt;&lt;N fɔ wɔ̀ gɛ, yɛ mɩ nan san Hebron fɔ nàn ma mɛ ade gɛtɛ na kan ntam na tɛ Yahwe alɛ nan mɛ fɔ.<verse eid="2SA 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 15:8" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ ǹ sa Gesuri gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Aram fɔ, na kan ntam alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi Yahwe è birima mɩ ɛ san Yerusalem fɔ, nan sʋma Yahwe Hebron.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 15:9" />Gɛ egyu ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;San olila waanɩ.&gt;&gt; Gɛlɛ wuu koro ɛ tɔ, gɛ ɛ da Hebron.<verse eid="2SA 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 15:10" />Mɔ Abisalom ɛ sa bɛnɩ Isareli ifoli powu yaanɩ dibilin daanɩ, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi ɩ̀ bɔ ɩ nʋn akantan ɩ̀ fʋn fɔ, ɛyɩ powu ɩ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Abisalom n di Hebron wogyu.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 15:11" />Bɛnɩ gɛkpɩn be ye Yerusalem gɛtɛ bɛ̀ tɛrɛma Abisalom. Ɛ fɩna gʋlɔ e kpèlè bɛ, mɔ bɛɛn nyɩ̀ ade ɩkɩ yaanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 15:12" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Abisalom ɛɛ tɛ gedi fɔ, ɛ sa gɛ bɛ ma kpèlè Giloni-te Ayitofeli gɛtɛ è di bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛɛ tɛ egyu Dafidi amɩnlɛ fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ. Gɛ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ fɩya ma Abisalom fɔ bɛ sɔ, gɛ Abisalom gɛtɔ-yela Dafidi wo koro fɔ gɩ wura ɔkɛma gɩ fɩya.<verse eid="2SA 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dafidi geserenti ye Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 15:13" />Ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ɛ bɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Isareli bɛnɩ fɔ powu bɛ ka boo-ituru bɛ tɛ Abisalom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 15:14" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa wakʋn Yerusalem fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ tɔ, fɔ tàà serenti. Nka gɛlɛ fɔ, taanɩ ɛkɩ ɛn nan wura osele e serenti e ye Abisalom walɔ yaanɩ. Wù di gɛtɛ tàà serenti disere-kɩlɩn, nka gɛlɛ fɔ eè be gye tɩ, fɔ èè muru ti, fɔ èè wolo ditele fɔ dɩɩ bɛnɩ powu.<verse eid="2SA 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 15:15" />Gɛ egyu bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Aa bɛsaranyan bɛ pɩna koro gɛtɛ baà mɛ gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ awɔ tiifonte egyu aà dɔ̀ fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 15:16" />Okoro egyu e ye, gɛ wɔ dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ powu bɛ tɛrɛma wɔ. Mɔ egyu e kere wodima ɛbɛ fwo ɛ ya alɛ bɛ nya dɩkpaara fɔ dii koro. <verse eid="2SA 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 15:17" />Gɛtɛ egyu ma bɛnɩ fɔ powu bee ye ditele fɔ daanɩ fɔ, bɛ ma yela dɩkpaara kurumakyɛɛ fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 15:18" />Gɛ wɔ bɛnɩ fɔ powu bɛ bɛ da be gyegeye wɔ bʋnʋn, fɩya ma Kereti bete ma Peleti bete, ma Giti bete nkpɩn busiyee gɛtɛ bɛ tɛrɛma wɔ be ye Gati ditele daanɩ fɔ.<verse eid="2SA 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 15:19" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu e lila Gati-te Itayi alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ awɔ mɔ à tɛrɛma tɩ aa fɔrɔ? Biri, fɔ àà ma sara ma egyu Abisalom. À di gɛ esela, a ye gende-fon gaanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 15:20" />Walan wuuko gɛ a ba nfan ɛbɛ. Okoro mɩn talɩ n ka wɔ̀ n san n silin, yema mɩn nyɩ̀ ɔkʋn gɛtɛ n tɛ fɔrɔ. Biri, fɔ àà ka aa bɛnɩ fɩya fɔ yàà san. Yahwe gɩnɩ-kpara ma wɔ nʋnkwarɩ wʋ sara ma ɛyɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 15:21" />Mɔ Itayi e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Na nya Yahwe gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa lɛ, ma gɛtɛ miinfonte egyu à si nkpa anɩ lɛ, ɔkʋn-kamasɛ gɛtɛ miinfonte egyu ɛɛ̀ san fɔ, diku daanɩ oo, nkpa anɩ oo, dʋkɔ gɛ nmɩ aasaranyan mɔ nan san.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 15:22" />Gɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ Itayi alan, &lt;&lt;Wʋ̀ kɔlɔ, San taà san.&gt;&gt; Okoro Giti-te Itayi ma wɔ bɛnɩ ma bɔɔ bɛfʋrɩ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛwɔ fɔ powu bɛ san bɛ da.<verse eid="2SA 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 15:23" />Gɛ gɩfɩɩ fɔ gɩɩ bɛnɩ powu be wula kin-kin ɔkʋna gɛtɛ be we bɛnɩ fɔ powu bɛɛ da fɔ. Egyu ɛ kààrà Kidiron dɩtagba, gɛ wɔ bɛnɩ mɔ powu bɛ kààrà bɛ tɛrɛma wɔ bɛ da otonkuma wʋʋ gɩlan.<verse eid="2SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 15:24" />Gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Sadoki mɔ ɛ̀ sa dʋkɔbɛ, gɛ Lefi bete gɛtɛ bɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛwɔ fɔ powu bè tola Yahwe Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ. Bɛ warama Wurubwarɛ Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ bɛ sɩ̀, gɛ Abiyata ɛ tɛ̀ gedi ka ma sere ɔkʋna gɛtɛ bɛnɩ fɔ powu be ye ditele fɔ daanɩ.<verse eid="2SA 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 15:25" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu ɛ dɔ̀ Sadoki alan, &lt;&lt;Birima Wurubwarɛ Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ san ditele fɔ daanɩ. Gengyi Yahwe è we mɩ gutunkoro fɔ, eè birima mɩ ɛ ba, gɛ ɛɛ̀ yɛ mɩ nan bè we di, ma wɔ gɛsarakʋn.<verse eid="2SA 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 15:26" />Mɔ gengyi ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Aade ɩn taa di mɩ gʋnʋn.&gt;&gt;fɔ, na yera, yɛ wɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɛ mɩ ɛwʋ gɛtɛ wʋ kɔlɔ tɛ wɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 15:27" />Gɛ egyu ɛ nɩ dɔ̀ Sadoki gɛtɛ è di gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Nka awɔ n di ewelɛ fɔ? Awɔ ma aabi Ayimasa, ma Abiyata wobi Yonatan i biri ɩ san ditele fɔ daanɩ olila waanɩ.<verse eid="2SA 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 15:28" />Nmɩ nan so getu fɔ gɩɩ gɛkààràkʋn otonkuma fɔ waanɩ ma sere ɔkʋna gɛtɛ nan wura ɔtʋn n ye aakʋn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 15:29" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro Sadoki ma Abiyata bɛ ka Wurubwarɛ Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ be biri bɛ da Yerusalem, gɛ bɛ sara dʋkɔ.<verse eid="2SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 15:30" />Mɔ Dafidi e tin wo duyu, gɛ ɛ̀ san bɩsɩrɩ-kwaa ɛɛ bʋn Olife wodon fɔ ma gewula. Gɛ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛwɔ fɔ powu mɔ be tin baayu, gɛ bee wula bɛɛ bʋn odon fɔ.<verse eid="2SA 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 15:31" />Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Ayitofeli ɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ kpa Abisalom fɔ.&gt;&gt; Gɛ Dafidi e tiri onyun alan, &lt;&lt;Oo Yahwe, yɛ Ayitofeli wamɩnlɛ gɛtɛ ɛɛ̀ tɛ Abisalom fɔ yàà biligi anyimapude.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 15:32" />Gɛtɛ Dafidi e gyu odon fɔ wʋʋ gatala, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bɛnɩ bɛɛ tɩ̀ sʋma Wurubwarɛ fɔ, Ariki-te Husayi ɛ̀ sa dʋkɔbɛ gɛtɛ è be tuma wɔ. Wɔ gɛgba gɩ fɛɛran, gɛ atɩn i milin wo duyu. <verse eid="2SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 15:33" />Gɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi à tɛrɛma mɩ a san fɔ, aà biligi ditola a tɛ mɩ.<verse eid="2SA 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 15:34" />Mɔ gengyi à biri a san ditele fɔ daanɩ, gɛ à dɔ̀ Abisalom alan, &lt;Oo egyu, nan sʋma wɔ̀ anlɛ gɛtɛ na sʋma aate nʋnkwarɩ anɩ na bɛ da fɔ, waà kpa mɩ yema aà wura a suguti Ayitofeli wamɩnlɛ gɛtɛ ɛɛ̀ tɛ Abisalom fɔ.<verse eid="2SA 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 15:35" />Gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ Sadoki ma Abiyata baà sara dʋkɔbɛ, okoro ade-kamasɛ gɛtɛ aà nʋn a ye egyu dɩkpaara fɔ, dɔ̀ yɩ tɛ bɛ. <verse eid="2SA 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 15:36" />Nya, Sadoki wobi Ahimasa ma Abiyata wobi Yonatan mɔ bɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛbɛ dʋkɔ. À talɩ a sa bɛ bàà bɛ̀ dɔ̀ mɩ ade-kamasɛ gɛtɛ aà nʋn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 15:37" />Okoro Dafidi wɔwɔlɔn Husayi e be gyu Yerusalem ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Abisalom ee gyu ditele fɔ daanɩ.<verse eid="2SA 15:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2SA 16" />
  <para style="s1">Dafidi ma Siba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 16:1" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛ waran e ye odon fɔ wʋʋ gatala bɛrɛɛ fɔ, ɛ bɛ tama Mefiboseti wɔsaranyan Siba gɛtɛ è yela ee so wɔ. Fɔ è de akpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ anyɔɔ gɛtɛ ì tola boroboro gɛkpɩn, ma iyon yaabi wuu keki akpilin ton, ma figi wo keki akpilin ton, ma bʋkan gɛtɛ bʋ̀ sa ɛnan gɩkpa gaanɩ.<verse eid="2SA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 16:2" />Gɛ egyu e lila Siba alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ a ka nyayɩ a ba?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:2">Siba e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Akpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ fɔ ì di egyu dɩkpaara diiyo, gɛtɛ bàà tɩ̀ sara yii koro, boroboro ma iyon yaabi fɔ ì di bɛsaranyan fɔ booyo gɛtɛ bàà di, gɛ bʋkan fɔ mɔ bù di ɛbɛ gɛtɛ waà taga bɛ otonkuma waanɩ fɔ booyo, fɔ bàà nyʋn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 16:3" />Gɛ egyu e lila Siba alan, &lt;&lt;Gaanɩ gɛ aafonte wɔnana fɔ ɛ̀ sa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:3">Gɛ Siba ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛ̀ sa Yerusalem, yema ɛɛ sa amɩnlɛ alan, &lt;Ndò Isareli dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ baà ka miintu bugyu fɔ bɛ tɛ mɩ.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 16:4" />Gɛ egyu ɛ dɔ̀ Siba alan, &lt;&lt;Gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ gì di Mefiboseti woyo fɔ nan ka n tɛ wɔ̀.&gt;&gt; Gɛ Siba ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Karan miinfonte. Yɛ maade yàà di wɔ̀ gʋnʋn ɔya-kamasɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Simeyi ɛ fwala Dafidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 16:5" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ egyu Dafidi ma wɔ bɛnɩ bee gyu Bahurim fɔ, ete ɛkɩ gɛtɛ e ye Sawulo dɩkpaara daanɩ fɔ e ye ɛ ba ɛɛ fwala bɛ. Ete fɔ diyere n di Simeyi, gɛ wote n di Gera. <verse eid="2SA 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 16:6" />Ma gɛtɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ powu be silin Dafidi dɩbɩyan ma ologyi gba fɔ, e fun-fun egyu Dafidi ma bɛndɩrɛ-bi fɔ powu ataa. <verse eid="2SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 16:7" />Gɛ Simeyi ɛ fwala bɛ, gɛ ɛ fa Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Kpe ye nfan, kpe ye nfan, awɔ ewololɛ bɛnɩ, omiri-kpen wuute! <verse eid="2SA 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 16:8" />Yahwe n te le wɔ̀ gutoro, Sawulo dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ bɔɔ nkalan gɛtɛ a daa a lù fɔ wuu koro. A yuri wo bugyu, mɔ nkele bɩrɛ Yahwe e to bugyu fɔ ɛ tɛ aabi Abisalom. Nya, aade-kpen i biri aa koro, yema a daa nkalan a lulu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 16:9" />Gɛ Seruya wobi Abisayi e lila egyu fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ a yɛ ɛkpɛɛ-kulɛ nyawɔ ɛɛ fwala awɔ miinfonte egyu? Yɛ mɩ nan ma belen wɔ duyu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 16:10" />Mɔ egyu fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛyɩ Seruya bebi, nyawʋ wun di yaade. Gengyi ɛɛ fwala mɩ yema Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alɛ, &lt;Fwala Dafidi!&gt;fɔ, ɛnyan nan talɩ e lila alɛ, &lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ aa mɛ gɛlɛ?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 16:11" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ Abisayi, ma wɔ bɛndɩrɛ-bi fɔ powu alan, &lt;&lt;Miinbi gɛtɛ è di nmɩ gbagba mɩɩn nkalan ee len èè wolo mɩ, waà mɛ lan gɛ Benyamin-te nyawɔ ɛn nan wolo mɩ. Kere wɔ ya! Yɛ wɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ fwala, yema Yahwe na dɔ̀ wɔ alɛ ɛ fwala.<verse eid="2SA 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 16:12" />Nkɩfɔ Yahwe eè we mɩɩn dɩyɩyɛ, fɔ èè hira mɩ sere ǹdò wʋʋ gɛfwala nyagɩ gɩɩ bɩsɩrɩ.<verse eid="2SA 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 16:13" />Okoro Dafidi ma wɔ bɛnɩ bɛ kyaga boosele fɔ wuu koro, fɔ Simeyi mɔ ɛ̀ san odon-bi wʋkɩ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ gbɛma bɛ fɔ wuu koro. Ɛɛ fɔrɔ powu fɔ, ɛɛ fwala, gɛ ee fun Dafidi ataa gɛ ɛɛ kɔkɔ atɩn e fun wɔ. <verse eid="2SA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 16:14" />Gɛtɛ Dafidi ma wɔ bɛnɩ fɔ powu bɛ ma gyu Yodan getu fɔ gaanɩ fɔ, bɛ fana, gɛ bɛ sara dʋkɔ be tuna.<verse eid="2SA 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wusayi ma Ayitofeli bɛ tɛ Abisalom amɩnlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 16:15" />Nkele Abisalom ma Isareli bete fɔ powu bɛ ba Yerusalem, fɔ Ayitofeli ɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛbɛ. <verse eid="2SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 16:16" />Gɛ Ariki-te Wusayi gɛtɛ è di Dafidi wɔwɔlɔn fɔ, ɛ san ɛ ma dɔ̀ Abisalom alan, &lt;&lt;Egyu-kpara, sara nkpa ma ɔfɔ! Egyu-kpara, sara nkpa ma ɔfɔ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 16:17" />Gɛ Abisalom e lila Wusayi alan, &lt;&lt;Gelen gɛtɛ a tiri a wùlà aawɔlɔn gɩlɛ? Anʋn yii koro gɛ an tɛrɛma aawɔlɔn Dafidi san?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 16:18" />Gɛ Wusayi ɛ dɔ̀ Abisalom alan, &lt;&lt;Kwa, ɛwɔ gɛtɛ Yahwe, ma bɛnɩ nyabɛ, ma Isareli bete powu be tiri fɔ, wakʋn gɛ nan san. <verse eid="2SA 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 16:19" />Gɛ nkele mɔ, ɛnyan gɛ n sʋma? Nka wobi fɔ? Anlɛ gɛtɛ na sʋma aate fɔ, gɛlɛ ke gɛ nan sʋma awɔ mɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 16:20" />Gɛ Abisalom ɛ dɔ̀ Ayitofeli alan, &lt;&lt;Tɛ tɩ aamɩnlɛ. Lan gɛ tɩ mɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 16:21" />Ayitofeli e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;San ma dʋrɔ ma aate wodima ɛbɛ gɛtɛ e kere ɛ ya alɛ bɛ nya digyu-kpara fɔ dii koro fɔ, gɛlɛ fɔ Isareli bete powu baà nʋn alan, aate wɔ kyʋnlɛ n di wɔ, gɛ ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ fɩya ma awɔ fɔ, baà wura ɔkɛma bɛ fɩya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 16:22" />Okoro be sere dɩyan dii dikwo bɛ tɛ Abisalom wɔ dɩkpaara dɩɩ gatala, gɛ ɛ dʋrɔ ma wote wodima ɛbɛ fɔ, Isareli bete powu bɔɔ bʋnʋn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 16:23" />Amɩnlɛ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ Ayitofeli ɛɛ̀ tɛ ɔya wʋtɔkɔ waanɩ fɔ, wù we anlɛ ɛnɩ gɛtɛ ee lila e ye gɛ Wurubwarɛ wakʋn. Gɛlɛ gɛ Dafidi ma Abisalom powu be we Ayitofeli wamɩnlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ tɛ bɛ fɔ powu.<verse eid="2SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2SA 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 17:1" />Nkele Ayitofeli ɛ dɔ̀ Abisalom alan, &lt;&lt;Nan tiri bɛnɩ ɩgbaa kooron, fɔ tàà kpà tɩ gyaga Dafidi wo koro odente nyawʋ. <verse eid="2SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 17:2" />Nan ye n tama wɔ ɔkʋna gɛtɛ ɛ fana, gɛ ɛ yɔlɔ fɔ, fɔ waà yɛ gɩsaa gàà ton wɔ, fɔ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa wakʋn fɔ powu baà serenti. Nan wolo gɛ egyu fɔ woko, <verse eid="2SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 17:3" />fɔ nan birima wɔ bɛnɩ fɔ powu n mɔma wɔ̀ anlɛ ɛsanfɔn n tɛ fɔrɔ wɔsan dɩkpaara. Aa bugiti gɛ ɛnɩ-kɩlɩn àà wolo, fɔ bɛnɩ-kurumakyɛɛ fɔ powu bàà sara olila waanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 17:4" />Abisalom ma Isareli bɛndɩrɛ fɔ powu be we gɛtɛ amɩnlɛ fɔ ɩ̀ kɔlɔ. <verse eid="2SA 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 17:5" />Mɔ Abisalom ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;I kpèlè Ariki-te Wusayi mɔ ɩ ba, fɔ taà nʋn ade gɛtɛ ɛ̀ ba ɛ̀ɛ̀ dɔ̀.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 17:6" />Gɛtɛ Wusayi ɛ ba Abisalom wakʋn fɔ, Abisalom ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Amɩnlɛ nyayɩ anlɛ gɛ Ayitofeli ɛ tɛ tɩ. Tɩ mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ abɛɛ? Gengyi tɩ kara mɛ gɛlɛ fɔ, awɔ mɔ dɔ̀ tɩ aa dɩmɩnlɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 17:7" />Gɛ Wusayi ɛ dɔ̀ Abisalom alan, &lt;&lt;Amɩnlɛ gɛtɛ Ayitofeli ɛ tɛ wɔ̀ nkele lɛ bɩrɛ, ɩn kɔlɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 17:8" />À nyɩ̀ gɛtɛ aate ma wɔ bɛnɩ bè di bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ, gɛ bɛ̀ ba owurufa anlɛ ɔpɛtɩ gɛtɛ ɛkɩ e gye wo dibi. Nkele mɔ, aate ɛ̀ nyɩ̀ akpa yaanɩ gepepe, yema ɛ kpà akpa ɛ nya. Ɛn nan dʋrɔ ma bekurumakyɛɛ fɔ odente. <verse eid="2SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 17:9" />Nkenkele gba anlɛ è bu dɩtaa-fwe dɩkɩ daanɩ abɛɛ ɔkankɩ. Gengyi Dafidi bɛnɩ bɛ̀ kya bɩtà bʋʋ gɛtà ma aa bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ, gɛ bè wolo baanɩ bɛkɩ fɔ, ɛkamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛɛ̀ nʋn ade fɔ ɛɛ̀ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Abisalom bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ kpekpesi be muru.&gt; <verse eid="2SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 17:10" />Gengyi wʋ̀ ba gɛlɛ fɔ, aa bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ ba oturu anlɛ ɛdɩ̀rɛ̀ gba fɔ, gɩsaa gaà ton bɛ. Yema ɛnɩ ɛkamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa Isareli fɔ ɛ̀ nyɩ̀ gɛtɛ aate è di bɩtà bʋʋtàlɛ-dɩrɛ, gɛ wɔ bɛnɩ powu mɔ bɛ̀ ba oturu.<verse eid="2SA 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 17:11" />Okoro maamɩnlɛ n di alɛ, ka Isareli bete powu ye Dan ditele be sere Beeseba ditele daanɩ, fɔ bàà sɔ anlɛ ɛpʋ wɔ ɩŋɛrɛ, fɔ awɔ gbagba àà gyegeye bɔɔ bʋnʋn fɔ yaà san akpa. <verse eid="2SA 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 17:12" />Ɔkʋn-kamasɛ gɛtɛ taà we Dafidi fɔ taà nʋ̀n ti tin wo koro, anlɛ dɩya na nʋ̀n gɛtʋnkwaa gii koro. Ɛwɔ Dafidi oo, wɔ bɛnɩ oo, baanɩ ɛkɩ ɛn nan kuruma ɛ sara nkpa. <verse eid="2SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 17:13" />Gengyi ɛ̀ ma bu ditele dɩkɩ daanɩ fɔ, Isareli bete powu taà ka ɩŋʋn tɩ ba ditele fɔ daanɩ, fɔ taà tiira dɩ tɩ sa diwonwo daanɩ ma ye gɛtɛ dɩtaa-kɩlɩn gba dɩn nan kuruma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 17:14" />Gɛ Abisalom ma Isareli bɛnɩ fɔ powu bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ariki-te Wusayi wamɩnlɛ fɔ ɩ̀ kɔlɔ da Ayitofeli woyo fɔ.&gt;&gt; Yema Yahwe ɛ mɛ gɛtɛ Ayitofeli wamɩnlɛ-kpara gɛtɛ ɛ tɛ fɔ ɩ kara mɛ gʋtʋn, fɔ wàà yɛ gyerebi ɛ̀ɛ̀ nʋ̀n Abisalom wo koro.<verse eid="2SA 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 17:15" />Gɛ Wusayi ɛ dɔ̀ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ Sadoki ma Abiyata alan, &lt;&lt;Amɩnlɛ gɛtɛ Ayitofeli ɛ tɛ Abisalom ma Isareli bɛndɩrɛ ɩ lɛ, gɛ nmɩ mɔ miinyo ɩ lɛ. <verse eid="2SA 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 17:16" />Okoro sa bɛnɩ bilenten fɔ bàà ma dɔ̀ Dafidi alan, &lt;Ǹdò odente nyawʋ ɛ kara dʋrɔ gɛkààràkʋn gɛtɛ gɩ̀ gbɛma otonkuma fɔ, mɔ fɔ, ɛ kààrà Yodan getu fɔ ɛ san ofen, anlɛ gɛtɛ waà mɛ gɛ bɛn nan be muru ɛwɔ ma wɔ bɛnɩ powu.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 17:17" />Nkele Yonatan ma Ayimasa bee so En-Rogeli, Yerusalem ditele daatuma, yema wʋn di gɛtɛ ɛkɩ èè we bɛ gɛtɛ bee gyu ditele fɔ daanɩ. Ɛnanɩ-sʋmalɛ ɛkɩ nan ma dɔ̀ bɛ ɔtʋn fɔ, pɛ gɛ ɛbɛ mɔ baà ma dɔ̀ egyu Dafidi. <verse eid="2SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 17:18" />Mɔ ɛsaranyan ɛkɩ e we bɛ, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ Abisalom. Gɛlɛ wuu koro bɔɔ bɛnɩ bɛnyɔɔ bɛ mɛ bilen be ye dʋkɔ, gɛ bɛ san ete ɛkɩ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa Bawurim fɔ dɩkpaara. Ɛ̀ ba ɔlɔkɔ dɩkpaara fɔ daanɩ, gɛ bɛ waran be gyu waanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 17:19" />Gɛ ete fɔ wɔsɔ ɛ ka ditinbi e tin ɔlɔkɔ fɔ wuunyun, gɛ ɛ ka anaabi ɛ nɩna dii koro gɛtɛ ɛkɩ ɛ kara nyɩnla alɛ gɩnyankɩ gɩ̀ sa dʋkɔbɛ. <verse eid="2SA 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 17:20" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Abisalom bɛsaranyan fɔ be be gyu ɛna fɔ wakʋn dɩkpaara fɔ daanɩ fɔ, be lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Gaanɩ gɛ Ayimasa ma Yonatan bɛ̀ sa?&gt;&gt; Gɛ ɛna fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Bɛ kààrà getu fɔ bɛ da giifen.&gt;&gt; Bɛsaranyan fɔ be buguti gɛlɛɛ mɔ ben we ɛnɩ ɛkɩ, okoro be biri bɛ da Yerusalem. <verse eid="2SA 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 17:21" />Bɛsaranyan fɔ bɛ da wʋʋ gama fɔ, bɛnɩ bɛnyɔɔ fɔ bɛ bʋn be ye ditiribun fɔ daanɩ bɛ ba okòro, gɛ bɛ san bɛ ma dɔ̀ egyu Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Tɔ bilenten, fɔ àà ma kààrà getu fɔ san giifen, yema anlɛ gɛ Ayitofeli ɛ tɛ amɩnlɛ dama aa koro.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 17:22" />Gɛ Dafidi ma bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa wakʋn fɔ bɛ tɔ, gɛ bɛ kààrà Yodan getu fɔ. Kere gàà bɛ kpa fɔ, ɛnɩ-kɩlɩn gba en kuruma gɛtɛ ɛn kààrà Yodan getu fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 17:23" />Gɛtɛ Ayitofeli e we alɛ bɛnɩ ben to wamɩnlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ tɛ fɔ sa fɔ, ɛ ka wɔ dɩkpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ, gɛ ɛ da wɔlɛ. Ɛ pɩna wɔ dɩkpaara ɛ sɩ̀ gepe, gɛ ɛ sa gigyen ɔŋʋn. Gɛ be lò wɔ wotu ɛbɛ boo gelòkʋn. <verse eid="2SA 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 17:24" />Dafidi ɛ da Mahanami ditele daanɩ, gɛ Abisalom ma Isareli bɛnɩ fɔ powu, bɛ kààrà Yodan getu fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 17:25" />Abisalom ɛ ka Amasa ɛ sɩ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ bɔɔndɩrɛ e sere Yowabi bɩsɩrɩ. Amasa è di Isareli-te Yeta gɛtɛ e to Yowabi wɔna Seruya wonobi Nahasa wobi Abigali gɩna fɔ wobi.<verse eid="2SA 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 17:26" />Gɛ Isareli bete ma Abisalom bɛ ma sara Gileyadi gɛtʋnkwaa gii koro.<verse eid="2SA 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 17:27" />Gɛtɛ Dafidi e be gyu Mahanayim fɔ, Amon-te Nahasi gɛtɛ e ye Raba ditele fɔ, wobi Sobi ma Lodeba-te Amile wobi Maki, ma Gileyadi-te Basilayi gɛtɛ e ye Rogelim fɔ, <verse eid="2SA 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 17:28" />bɛ ka afengen, ma bɛtasa, ma bɩtɩyɛ, ma bukunbi, ma anyan-maralɛ-kurumakyɛɛ bɛ ba. Be biri bɛ ka amɔrɔ, ma anaabi, ma ɔnʋmʋ, ma afɩnaa-sʋnlɛ, ma akyɛɛ, ma akwi, <verse eid="2SA 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 17:29" />ma ɛŋɔɔ, ma anyandilɛ, gɛtɛ i ye ɛkwɔ dɩnyʋn daanɩ bɛ bɛ tɛ Dafidi ma bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛwɔ fɔ alɛ be di. Yema bɛɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Dɩkpan ma otinbili wù de bɛnɩ fɔ, gɛ bɛ fana otonkuma fɔ waanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 17:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2SA 18" />
  <para style="s1">Abisalom diku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 18:1" />Gɛ Dafidi ɛ kʋla wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ powu gɛ e yo baanɩ akpen-akpen. Bɛkɩ bɛ ba nkpɩn ton (1,000), gɛ bɛkɩ mɔ bɛ ba akpilin ton (100), gɛ e tiri begyegeyelɛ ɛ tɛ dikpen-kamasɛ. <verse eid="2SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 18:2" />Gɛ Dafidi e biri e yo bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ powu baanɩ akpen asiyee. Dikpen dɩkɩ dɩ̀ sa Yowabi gʋlɔ gaanɩ, gɛ dɩnyɔɔfɛ dɩ̀ sa Seruya wobi Abisayi, gɛtɛ è di Yowabi wonosobi fɔ gʋlɔ gaanɩ, gɛ disiyeefɛ fɔ mɔ dɩ̀ sa Giti-te Itayi gʋlɔ gaanɩ. Gɛ egyu ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Nmɩ gbagba mɔ nan san ma ɛyɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 18:3" />Mɔ bɛnɩ fɔ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Awɔ kara ye okòro. Yema gengyi tì serenti fɔ, bɛn nan fɛ ma ɛtɩ. Gengyi taanɩ ɔfan tì ku gba fɔ, bɛn nan fɛ. Mɔ awɔ a da taanɩ bɛnɩ ɩgbaa ton (10,000). Gɛlɛ wuu koro, wʋ̀ kɔlɔ gɛtɛ àà sara ditele fɔ daanɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 18:4" />Egyu fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ kɔlɔ tɛ yɩ fɔ, nan mɛ.&gt;&gt; Okoro e yela otunu-yon, gɛ ɛɛ nya bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ powu, gɛtɛ bɛ̀ san bɛɛ fɔrɔ yaanɩ akpilin ton-ton (100), ma nkpɩn ton-ton (1,000) fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 18:5" />Gɛ egyu ɛ dɔ̀ Yowabi, ma Abisayi, ma Itayi alan, &lt;&lt;Miin koro, ɩ nya ɛsaranyan Abisalom gepepe!&gt;&gt; Gɛ bɛnɩ fɔ powu bɛ nʋn ade gɛtɛ egyu fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛ fɔ dama Abisalom wo koro. <verse eid="2SA 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 18:6" />Okoro Dafidi bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ be ye ditele bɛ ma kpà ma Isareli bete, Efrayim gɩkan gaanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 18:7" />Gɛ Dafidi bɛsaranyan fɔ be di Isareli bete fɔ boo koro dʋkɔbɛ. Gɛ bɛnɩ disepekyi (20,000) be ku duwi dɩtɔkɔ. <verse eid="2SA 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 18:8" />Akpa fɔ ɩ yasɩ ɩ san gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ powu gii koro, gɛ gɩkan fɔ gi di bɛnɩ kpekpesi duwi dɩtɔkɔ da ɛbɛ gɛtɛ be ku akpa fɔ yaanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 18:9" />Gɛ Abisalom e tuma Dafidi bɛsaranyan fɔ. Ɛ gyaga wɔ dɩkpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ dii koro, gɛ gɛtɛ dɩkpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ fɔ di gyu dɩlɛ diiyon-dɩrɛ wʋkɩ wʋʋ gatɩn fɔ, Abisalom duyu di gyu oyon fɔ wuu-itenbi yaanɩ, gɛ ɛ wɔ ɛ̀ fa ma itenbi gɛtɛ ɩ kyalɩ ɩ sa ma bɛwɔlɔn fɔ, gɛ dɩkpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ fɔ dɩ da di kere wɔ dɩ ya. <verse eid="2SA 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 18:10" />Gɛtɛ bete fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ e we wɔ fɔ, ɛ dɔ̀ Yowabi alan, &lt;&lt;Na we Abisalom gɛtɛ ɛ̀ fa ma dɩlɛ diiyon.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 18:11" />Gɛ Yowabi ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋʋn! A we wɔ? Anʋn yii koro gɛ an wolo wɔ sɩ̀ gɛtʋnkwaa dʋkɔ? Nafɔ nan tɛ wɔ̀ kɔba fututu fwo (10), ma gbagya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 18:12" />Mɔ ete fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ Yowabi alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi à tɛ mɛ sɩka-fututu nkpɩn ton (1,000) gba fɔ, mɩn nan ka mɩɩn gʋlɔ n kya egyu wobi fɔ, yema tɩ nʋn taaten yaanɩ gɛtɛ egyu ɛ dɔ̀ awɔ ma Abisayi ma Itayi alan, &lt;Miin koro, ɩ nya ɛsaranyan Abisalom gepepe!&gt; <verse eid="2SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 18:13" />Gengyi nafɔ mɩn daà bù egyu, gɛ n wolo Absalom fɔ, nafɔ ade ɩkɩ ɩn ma gɛtɛ egyu ɛn nan nʋn, gɛ awɔ gba à daà tiri mɩ a tɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 18:14" />Gɛ Yowabi ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Mɩn nan mɩna ɔya ma awɔ.&gt;&gt; Gɛ ɛ ka buturunyan bisiyee e sere Abisalom woturu. Ɔkʋna wʋtɔkɔ fɔ, Absalom ɛ̀ kyɔlɔga ma oyon fɔ gɛtɛ en te ku. <verse eid="2SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 18:15" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yowabi bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ baanɩ fwo be silin Abisalom be tuma, gɛ be wolo wɔ. <verse eid="2SA 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 18:16" />Gɛ Yowabi ɛ fʋn dɩkantan fɔ, gɛ wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ be kere geberema Isareli bete fɔ bɛ ya, yema Yowabi e ten bɛ. <verse eid="2SA 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 18:17" />Gɛ bɛ ka Abisalom be fun bɛ sa difwe-dɩrɛ dɩkɩ daanɩ gɩkan fɔ gaanɩ. Gɛ be tola ataa-dɩrɛ-dɩrɛ bɛ gyaga wo koro, gɛ Isareli bete fɔ powu be serenti bɛ da bɔɔlɛ. <verse eid="2SA 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 18:18" />Abisalom dɩsarabi daanɩ fɔ, e sere pila egyu dɩtagba fɔ daanɩ gɛtɛ wàà mɛ wɔ gɩnyan-kʋnalɛ yema ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Nn ma ebi gɛtɛ miin diyere daà gyaga wo koro fɔ bàà ka bɛ kʋna mɩ.&gt;&gt; Gɛ ɛ ŋwara wo diyere ɛ gyaga pila fɔ wo koro, gɛ be kpèlè wʋ Abisalom wo pila be ye ma ǹdò.<verse eid="2SA 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dafidi e wula Abisalom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 18:19" />Gɛ Sadoki wobi Ahimasa ɛ dɔ̀ Yowabi alan, &lt;&lt;Yɛ nan serenti n ma dɔ̀ egyu alɛ, Yahwe e tiri wɔ e ye wɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ baalɔ yaanɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 18:20" />Gɛ Yowabi ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Kara ma dɔ̀ wɔ ɔtʋn fɔ ǹdò. Yɛ duwi fon fɔ àà san, mɔ nka ǹdò. Yema egyu fɔ wobi na ku.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 18:21" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yowabi ɛ dɔ̀ Kusi-te fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;San ma dɔ̀ egyu gɩnyan gɛtɛ a we.&gt;&gt; Kusi-te fɔ e kura Yowabi gɛ e serenti ɛ da. <verse eid="2SA 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 18:22" />Gɛ Sadoki wobi Ahimasa e biri ɛ dɔ̀ Yowabi alan, &lt;&lt;Lan fɔ, yɛ nmɩ nan serenti n tɛrɛma Kusi-te fɔ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:22">Mɔ Yowabi e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Miinbi, anʋn yii koro gɛ aa len àà san? An nan wura gutoro gii gele gɩkɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 18:23" />Gɛ Ahimasa ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Wʋ mɛ laan fɔ, nan san.&gt;&gt; Okoro Yowabi ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;San!&gt;&gt; Ɛwʋ gɛ Ahimasa e serenti ɛ waran ma osele fɔ, gɛ ɛ ma da Kusi-te fɔ wo koro. <verse eid="2SA 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 18:24" />Gɛtɛ Dafidi è si itunu ɩnyɔɔ fɔ yii getite fɔ, dɩkpaara dɩɩ dɩyɛlɛ fɔ ɛ bʋn san dɩkpaara fɔ dɩɩ gatala, gɛ gɛtɛ ɛ bʋma wo duyu fɔ, e we gɛtɛ ete ɛkɩ è serenti ɛɛ ba woko. <verse eid="2SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 18:25" />Dɩkpaara dɩɩ dɩyɛlɛ fɔ e kpen e kpèlè egyu, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:25">Gɛ egyu ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi wù di gɛ woko bɩrɛ fɔ è de ɔtʋn-kpara ɛ̀ san.&gt;&gt; Fɔ ɛsaranyan fɔ ɛ̀ bɔ ɛɛ gbɛma bɛ. <verse eid="2SA 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 18:26" />Gɛ dɩkpaara dɩɩdɩyɛlɛ fɔ e biri e we gɛtɛ ɛnɩ-fon ɛkɩ mɔ è serenti ɛɛ ba. Gɛ e kpèn ɛ dɔ̀ otunu wʋʋnyaalɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Nya, ɛnɩ-fon ɛkɩ mɔ è serenti woko ɛɛ ba!&gt;&gt; Gɛ egyu alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛwɔ mɔ è de gɛ ɔtʋn-kpara ɛɛ ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 18:27" />Dɩkpara dɩɩdɩyɛlɛ fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Wʋ̀ dɔ mɩ anlɛ iti gɛtɛ egyegeyelɛ fɔ e serenti fɔ wù we anlɛ iti gɛtɛ Sadoki wobi Ahimasa e serenti fɔ.&gt;&gt; Gɛ egyu fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;È di gɛ ɛnɩ-kpara, gɛ è de ade-kpara ɛɛ ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 18:28" />Gɛ Ahimasa ɛ tabʋrʋ kin-kin ɛ tɛ egyu fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ade powu i pe!&gt;&gt; Gɛ e kura egyu fɔ bʋnʋn, gɛ ɛ ka wɔ bʋnʋn e tin gɛtʋnkwaa, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Tii sila Yahwe aa Wurubwarɛ fɔ. Ɛ yɛ i di ɛnɩ gɛtɛ ɛ tɔ e yela awɔ tiifonte egyu wo koro fɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 18:29" />Gɛ egyu fɔ e lila alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛsaranyan Abisalom ɛ̀ kɔlɔ?&gt;&gt; Ahimasa e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Ǹ fɔ wɔ̀ gɛ, ɔya gɛtɛ Yowabi ɛ sa mɩ fɔ, na we gɛtɛ ade girigiri ɩkɩ i sere, mɔ mɩn talɩ nyɩnla ade-kɩlɩn fɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 18:30" />Gɛ egyu fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan,&lt;&lt;Yela gɩlan fɔ àà so dʋkɔ.&gt;&gt; Okoro e ye ɛ ma yela gɩlan. <verse eid="2SA 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 18:31" />Gɛ Kusi-te fɔ mɔ e be gyu gɛ, ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Miinfonte egyu, nʋn ade-kpara nyayɩ. Yahwe e tiri wɔ̀ e ye ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛ tɔ be yela aa koro fɔ powu baalɔ yaanɩ ǹdò.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 18:32" />Gɛ Egyu fɔ e lila Kusi-te fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛsaranyan Abisalom ɛ̀ kɔlɔ?&gt;&gt; Kusi-te fɔ e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe ɛ yɛ miinfonte egyu bɛkyʋnlɛ ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛ tɔ be yela aa koro fɔ powu bàà mɛ anlɛ ɛsaranyan ɛtɔkɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 18:33" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu fɔ wo koro gɩ gbɛrɛ wɔ, gɛ ɛ san dɩkpaara fɔ dɩɩ gatala, gɛ ɛ ma wula. Gɛ gɛtɛ ɛ san fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Oo, miinbi Abisalom, miinbi, miinbi Abisalom! Nafɔ nmɩ n daà ku n kere wɔ̀ n ya. Oo Abisalom, miinbi, miinbi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2SA 19" />
  <para style="s1">Yowabi ɛ tabʋrʋ e sere Dafidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 19:1" />Bɛ dɔ̀ Yowabi alan, &lt;&lt;Abisalom wo koro egyu ee wula, gɛ ɛɛ yɩyɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 19:2" />Okoro duwi dɩtɔkɔ dɩɩsɩyɛ wuu gedi fɔ wu biligi dɩyɩyɛ tɛ Dafidi bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ powu, yema bɛ nʋn duwi dɩtɔkɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Egyu fɔ ee wula wobi Abisalom.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 19:3" />Gɛ bɛnɩ fɔ bɛ mɔlɩ be gyu ditele fɔ daanɩ, anlɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ be serenti be ye akpa yaanɩ gɛ bɔɔ bʋnʋn buu ku fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 19:4" />Egyu fɔ e tin wɔ bʋnʋn, gɛ e wula kin-kin alan, &lt;&lt;Oo miinbi Abisalom, oo Abisalom, miinbi, miinbi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 19:5" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yowabi ɛ san egyu fɔ wakʋn dɩkpaara, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ǹdò a sa aa bɛnɩ powu gɛtɛ be to wɔ nkpa, ma aa bebi, ma aasɔ ɛbɛ, ma aadima ɛbɛ powu ɩnɩnfa. <verse eid="2SA 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 19:6" />Yema aa len ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ kyʋn wɔ̀, gɛ aa kyʋn ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bee len wɔ̀ fɔ. A yɛ tɩ nyɩnla ǹdò alɛ, aa bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛbi, ma aa bɛsaranyan fɔ powu ben di gɩnyankɩ aa bʋnʋn baanɩ. Na we gɛtɛ nafɔ ɛtɩ powu ti ku, gɛ Abisalom è si nkpa fɔ, ɛwʋ nan di wɔ̀ gʋnʋn. <verse eid="2SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 19:7" />Tɔ ye san fɔ àà ma tabʋrʋ sa aa bɛsaranyan ɔkɛma. Na nya Yahwe alɛ, gengyi an ye san àà ma tabʋrʋ ma ɛbɛ fɔ, ɛnɩ-kɩlɩn gba ɛn nan kuruma nfan ǹdò odente nyawʋ, gɛ nyawʋ waà mɛ ade-dɩrɛ da ade gɛtɛ ɩ tama wɔ̀ ye aa gɩsaranyan gaanɩ be sere ma ǹdò lɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 19:8" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro egyu fɔ ɛ tɔ ɛ bɛ sara wɔ gɛbɩya gii koro ditele fɔ diitunu. Gɛ gɛtɛ bɛ dɔ̀ bɛnɩ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ nya, egyu fɔ n si otunu-yon fɔ.&gt;&gt; Ɛbɛ powu bɛ bɛ kʋla egyu fɔ wakʋn. Gɛ Isareli bete fɔ powu be serenti bɛ da bɔɔlɛ.<verse eid="2SA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dafidi e biri ɛ da Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 19:9" />Gɛ bɛnɩ be gyu iworo yii geto booko-booko Isareli ifoli fɔ powu yaanɩ alan, &lt;&lt;Egyu fɔ e tiri tɩ e ye tɩɩ bɛkyʋnlɛ baalɔ yaanɩ. Ɛwɔ na to tɩ e ye Filisiti bete baalɔ yaanɩ. Mɔ Abisalom wo koro e ye ditele fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 19:10" />Gɛ Abisalom gɛtɛ tɩ sʋrʋ bʋnɔ èè di bugyu tɛ tɩ fɔ e ku akpa yaanɩ. Anʋn yii koro gɛ ɩn taa sa amɩnlɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ yaà birima egyu Dafidi ɩ ba?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 19:11" />Ade fɔ ɩ nʋn egyu Dafidi, okoro ɛ sa Sadoki ma Abiyata gɛtɛ bè di gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;I lila Yuda bɛndɩrɛ alan, &lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ ɛyɩ na wɔ gama gɛtɛ yaà birima egyu ɩ ba wo digyu-kpara? <verse eid="2SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 19:12" />Ì di miinobi ɛbɛ, nmɩ gbagba mɩɩn bɛnɩ nkalan-kɩlɩn. Anʋn yii koro gɛ ɛyɩ na wɔ gama gɛtɛ yaà birima egyu ɩ ba?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 19:13" />Fɔ àà lila Amasa alan, &lt;An di gɛ nmɩ gbagba mɩɩnnɩ? Gengyi mɩn ka wɔ̀ mɛ mɩɩn bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔndɩrɛ sere Yowabi bɩsɩrɩ fɔ, Wurubwarɛ e we mɩ.&gt;&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 19:14" />Yuda bete fɔ powu be to egyu Dafidi wanyun-gyebi fɔ bɛ sa, gɛ bɛ sa bɛnɩ wakʋn, gɛ bɛ ma dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛyɩ ma aa bɛnɩ fɔ powu, i biri ɩ ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 19:15" />Okoro egyu ma wɔ bɛnɩ powu be biri bɛɛ ba gɛ be be gyu Yodan getu fɔ gaanɩ. Fɔ Yuda bete fɔ bɛ ba Giligali be be tuma egyu fɔ bàà ka wɔ kààrà Yodan. <verse eid="2SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 19:16" />Gɛ Gera wobi Simeyi gɛtɛ è di Benyamin-te, gɛ e ye Bawurim fɔ, ɛ waran bilen ma Yuda bete fɔ be be tuma egyu Dafidi. <verse eid="2SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 19:17" />Gɛ Benyamin bɛnɩ nkpɩn ton (1,000) bɛ̀ fɩya ma wɔ. Gɛ Sawulo wɔsaranyan Siba, ma wo bebi fwo-ton (15), ma wɔ bɛsaranyan dikpilin (20) fɔ mɔ be kutuma bɛ san Yodan getu fɔ, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ egyu fɔ ɛ̀ sa fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 19:18" />Gɛ bɛ kààrà bɛ ma ka egyu fɔ bɛnɩ, gɛ bɛ mɛ ade-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ee len. Gɛtɛ Gera wobi Simeyi ɛ kààrà Yodan getu fɔ, ɛ waran ɛ dʋrɔ egyu fɔ bʋnʋn, <verse eid="2SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 19:19" />gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ egyu fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ǹ fɔ wɔ̀ gɛ, miinfonte, ɛ kara nya maade-kpen, abɛɛ ɛ kara kʋna wɔsaranyan wade-kpen duwi gɛtɛ miinfonte egyu aa ye Yerusalem fɔ. Egyu ɛ kara ka wʋ ɛ sa woturu waanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 19:20" />Yema nmɩ aasaranyan n nyɩ̀ gɛtɛ na mɛ ade-kpen. Mɔ ǹdò na gyegeye na ba aakʋn ye Yosefu dɩkpaara powu daanɩ, na ba n be tuma miinfonte egyu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 19:21" />Gɛ Seruya wobi Abisayi e tiri ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Wù di gɛtɛ bàà wolo Simeyi yema ɛ fwala Yahwe wɔnɩ, gɛtɛ ɛ sʋrʋ bʋnɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 19:22" />Mɔ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yaawɔlɔn gɛ Seruya bebi ma nmɩ tɩ ba gɛ ǹdò i biligi bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bee wùlà mɩ gɩnyan gɛtɛ n mɛ? Ǹ nyɩ gɛtɛ nmɩ n di egyu tɛ Isareli bete ǹdò. Ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ɛn nan ku Isareli ǹdò.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 19:23" />Gɛ egyu fɔ ɛ kan ntam ɛ tɛ Simeyi alan, &lt;&lt;An nan ku.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 19:24" />Gɛ Sawulo wɔnana Mefiboseti mɔ ɛ waran e be tuma egyu fɔ. Ye duwi gɛtɛ egyu Dafidi ɛ da fɔ, Mefiboseti een te kù, gɛ ɛɛn tɛ wɔrɔ wo bikpri, gɛ en te fere wɔ ngba bè sere duwi gɛtɛ Dafidi e biri ɛ ba olila waanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 19:25" />Ɔya gɛtɛ e ye Yerusalem e be tuma egyu fɔ, Dafidi e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Mefiboseti, anʋn yii koro gɛ an tɛrɛma mɩ san?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 19:26" />E tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Miinfonte egyu, nmɩ gbagba mɩɩnsaranyan Siba na gban mɩ. À nyɩ̀ gɛtɛ nmɩ aasaranyan n di gɛ ɔtagasɩ, okoro na mɛ maamɩnlɛ gɛtɛ nan ka mɩɩn dɩkpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ, fɔ nan gyaga dii koro, n tɛrɛma miinfonte. Mɔ mɩɩnsaranyan e tiri mɩ ɛ tɛ. <verse eid="2SA 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 19:27" />E di miin didebila ɛ tɛ miinfonte egyu. Mɔ miinfonte egyu à we anlɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔsalɛ, okoro mɛ ɛwʋ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ kɔlɔ tɛ wɔ̀. <verse eid="2SA 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 19:28" />Miinte dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ powu bɛ kʋtʋma bàà ku miinfonte egyu gʋlɔ gaanɩ, mɔ a ka nmɩ, aasaranyan a fɩya ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bee di aakpʋlɔ wuu koro fɔ baanɩ. Osele mɔmɔ gɛ ǹ ba gɛtɛ nan nɩ fɔ egyu gɩnyankɩ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 19:29" />Egyu fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ à sangba aa tabʋrʋ? Na mɛ maamɩnlɛ alɛ, awɔ ma Siba yaà yo aatu gɛtʋnkwaa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 19:30" />Mefiboseti ɛ dɔ̀ egyu alan, &lt;&lt;Yɛ Siba ɛ̀ɛ̀ ka powu, gɛtɛ miinfonte egyu a biri a ba ditele olila waanɩ lɛ wuuko wʋ̀ sɔ mɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 19:31" />Gileyadi-te Basilayi mɔ e ye Rogelim e be yela egyu ɛ kààrà Yodan fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 19:32" />Basilayi ɛ dan gepepe. E di bɩkyan akpilin anaa (80). Ɛ̀ ba kɔba gepepe, gɛ ɛ tɛ egyu fɔ anyandilɛ ɔkʋna gɛtɛ è si Mahanayim ditele fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 19:33" />Gɛ egyu fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ Basilayi alan, &lt;&lt;Kààrà ba maakʋn fɔ àà bɛ sara maakʋn Yerusalem, fɔ nan nya àà koro.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 19:34" />Mɔ Basilayi e lila egyu fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Bɩkyan bilen gɛ nan nɩ sara nkpa anɩ, gɛ nan nɩ tɛrɛma egyu n san Yerusalem? <verse eid="2SA 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 19:35" />Na di bɩkyan akpilin anaa nkenkele. Nan nɩ talɩ n wùlà ɛwʋ gɛtɛ wù di ade-kpara ma ade-kpen? Aasaranyan ɛɛ̀ talɩ ɛ dɩya anyandilɛ ma bʋkan? Nan talɩ n nʋn ɩnʋn yɩɩ bɛnʋmalɛ beteni ma bɛnanɩ bɔɔ bɩta? Anʋn yii koro gɛ aasaranyan ɛɛ̀ nɩ ka dɩfana ɛ bɛ fɩya miinfonte egyu? <verse eid="2SA 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 19:36" />Aasaranyan ɛɛ̀ tɛrɛma wɔ ɛ kààrà Yodan fɔ n san bɛrɛɛ, mɔ anʋn yii koro gɛ egyu èè le mɩ gɛlɛ wuu gutoro nyagɩ? <verse eid="2SA 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 19:37" />N fɔ wɔ̀ gɛ, yɛ nmɩ aasaranyan nan biri, fɔ nan ma ku nmɩ gbagba mɩɩnlɛ, fɔ nan wura n gbɛma miinte ma mɩɩnna bɔɔ bɩsàn. Aasaranyan Kimiham. Miinfonte, yɛ wɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ kààrà fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ nyɩma wɔ̀ san Yerusalem, fɔ ɛ ma mɛ gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ à len ɛ tɛ wɔ̀.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 19:38" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu fɔ e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Kimiham ɛɛ̀ kààrà ɛ tɛrɛma mɩ ɛ san, gɛ nan mɛ aa gelenbi n tɛ wɔ̀, ma gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ aa len a ye maakʋn fɔ powu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 19:39" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro bɛnɩ fɔ powu bɛ kààrà Yodan getu fɔ, gɛ egyu fɔ ɛ kààrà. Gɛ egyu fɔ e mù Basilayi, gɛ e hira wɔ, gɛ Basilayi e biri ɛ da wɔlɛ. <verse eid="2SA 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 19:40" />Gɛtɛ egyu fɔ ɛ kààrà ɛ san Giligali fɔ, Kimiham ɛ fɩya ma ɛwɔ ɛ kààrà. Yuda bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ akpi-akpi fɔ powu, ma Isareli bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ akpi-akpi fɔ ɔfan bɛ kààrà ma ɛwɔ. <verse eid="2SA 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 19:41" />Gɛ Isareli bɛnɩ powu bɛ san egyu wakʋn bɛ ma lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ tɩɩ bɛfʋrɩ Yuda bete be yuri wɔ̀ bɛ da, gɛ bɛ ka egyu ma wɔ bɛnɩ powu bɛ kààrà Yodan getu bɛ ba?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 19:42" />Gɛ Yuda bete fɔ powu be tiri wuunyun bɛ tɛ Isareli bete fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Tɩ mɛ gɛlɛ yema egyu fɔ è di tɩɩfʋrɩ. Anʋn yii koro gɛ ɩ ka owurufa ade nyayɩ yii koro? Ti dì egyu fɔ gɩnyankɩ? Abɛɛ tɩ ka wɔ gɩnyankɩ ti bilingi tiiyo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 19:43" />Gɛ Isareli bete fɔ be tiri wuunyun bɛ tɛ Yuda bete fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Tɩ̀ ba gedikʋn egyu waanɩ disere fwo, gɛ tɩ̀ ba Dafidi da yɩ. Anʋn yii koro gɛ ɩɩ nya tɩ ɩ waran? Nka ɛtɩ na dàà dɔ̀ egyu gebiri ba fɔ gaade?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:43">Mɔ Yuda bɛnɩ fɔ bɛ tabʋrʋ ma akpanyanyan bɛ da Isareli bɛnɩ fɔ.<verse eid="2SA 19:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2SA 20" />
  <para style="s1">Seba ɛ tɔ e yela Dafidi wo koro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 20:1" />Waanɩ fɔ, ete ɛkɩ ɛ sara dʋkɔ gɛtɛ bee kpèlè wɔ Seba. È di ɛnɩ gɛtɛ ɛn ma tɔnɔ ade ɩkɩ yaanɩ, gɛ wote n di Benyamin-te Bikiri. Ɛ fʋ̀n dɩkantan ɛ dɔ̀ alan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 20:1">&lt;&lt;Oo Isareli bete, tɩn ma gedikʋn gɩkɩ gɛtɛ taà wura ti ye Dafidi wakʋn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 20:1">tɩn ma gɩnyankɩ gɛtɛ taà wura ti Yese wobi wakʋn! Ɛkamasɛ ɛ san wɔ dɩyan dii dikwo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 20:2" />Okoro Isareli bɛnɩ fɔ powu be kere Dafidi bɛ ya, gɛ bɛ ma tɛrɛma Bikiri wobi Seba. Mɔ Yuda bete fɔ bɩrɛ bɛ sara ma boogyu ye Yodan getu fɔ giinyun ma sere Yerusalem. <verse eid="2SA 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 20:3" />Gɛtɛ Dafidi e gyu wo diigyu-kpaara, Yerusalem ditele daanɩ fɔ, ɛ ka wodima ɛbɛ fwo gɛtɛ e kere ɛ ya alɛ bɛ nya dɩkpaara fɔ dii koro fɔ, ɛ ma sa dikwo dɩkɩ daanɩ gɛtɛ bɛnɩ bɛɛ dɩyɛ bɛ. Ɛɛ nya bɔɔ gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ bee hiyan fɔ gii koro, mɔ ɛn dʋrɔ ma ɛbɛ. Be gye bɛ bɛ sɩ̀ dikwo daanɩ gɛlɛ anlɛ bɛkpɩnsɔ gɛlɛɛ ma ye gɛtɛ be ku.<verse eid="2SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 20:4" />Gɛ egyu fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ Amasa alan, &lt;&lt;Kpèlè Yuda bete powu fɩya ma aa koro yàà ba maakʋn, nfan awi asiyee.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 20:5" />Mɔ ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Amasa ɛ ma kpèlè Yuda bete fɔ e tuma fɔ, egyu wawi gɛtɛ ɛ sɩ̀ wɔ fɔ ɩ wɛrɛ da. <verse eid="2SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 20:6" />Gɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ Abisayi alan, &lt;&lt;Nkele, Bikiri wobi Seba ee len ade ɛ sa tɩ ɛ da Abisalom. Okoro ka mɩɩn bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ-kpara fɔ, fɔ yàà tɛrɛma wɔ, nka gɛlɛ fɔ, ɛɛ̀ ma gyu atele gɛtɛ ɩpɔrɩ i silin i tuma yɩ fɔ yaanɩ, fɔ èè serenti kere tɩ ya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 20:7" />Yowabi bɛnɩ, ma Kereti bɛnɩ, ma Peleti bɛnɩ, ma bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtalɛ fɔ powu be ye Yerusalem gɛ bɛ kpà bɛ gyaga Bikiri wobi Seba wokoro.<verse eid="2SA 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 20:8" />Gɛtɛ be gyu dɩtaa-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa Gibeyon fɔ dɩɩpɩ fɔ, Amasa e be tuma bɛ. Fɔ Yowabi ɛ̀ sa wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ ngba, gɛ ɛ ban edon ma dɩfwa ɛ marama wɔ gɛtɩɩ. Gɛtɛ Yowabi ɛ sa bɩsɩrɩ ɛɛ fɔrɔ fɔ, edon fɔ e lo e ye wɔ dɩfwa fɔ daanɩ ɛ nʋ̀n. <verse eid="2SA 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 20:9" />Gɛ Yowabi e lila Amasa alan, &lt;&lt;Mɩɩnwɔlɔn à si gepe?&gt;&gt; Gɛ Yowabi ɛ ka wologyilɔ e gye Amasa bikpri, anlɛ ee len èè mù wɔ gɛ. <verse eid="2SA 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 20:10" />Fɔ Amasa en we alɛ Yowabi è de edon ɛkɩ. Gɛ Yowabi ɛ ka edon fɔ e sere wɔ diboro tiri ɩkpɩn fɩna gɛtʋnkwaa. E ku disere-kɩlɩn gɛtɛ Yowabi en mini sere edon dɩnyɔɔfɛ. Gɛ Yowabi ma wonobi Abisayi bɛ kpà bɛ gyaga Bikiri wobi Seba wo koro.<verse eid="2SA 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 20:11" />Gɛ Yowabi bɛnɩ fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ ɛ ma yela Amasa gɩlan, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛnɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛɛ̀ kpà ɛ tɛ Yowabi abɛɛ eè yela Dafidi gama fɔ, ɛɛ̀ tɛrɛma Yowabi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 20:12" />Amasa ɛ̀ dɔ osele wuu getite ee bilima wɔ nkalan waanɩ. Gɛ ete fɔ e we gɛtɛ akpi fɔ powu i be ten dʋkɔ. Gɛtɛ e we ɛ nyɩnla gɛtɛ ɛnɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛɛ ba fɔ ee ten Amasa wakʋn fɔ, e bilima Amasa e ye osele waanɩ ɛ sa dɩfa daanɩ, gɛ e fun gɛgba e tin wɔ. <verse eid="2SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 20:13" />Gɛtɛ e bilima wɔ e ye osele waanɩ e were fɔ, bɛnɩ fɔ powu bɛ fɩya ma Yowabi bàà ma kpa gyaga Bikiri wobi Seba wo koro.<verse eid="2SA 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 20:14" />Seba e silin Isareli ifoli powu yaanɩ ɛ ma gyu Abeli-Beti-Maaka ditele, ka ma ye Beri bete gɛtɛ be tuma bɔɔlanlan waanɩ fɔ, gɛ ɛbɛ powu bɛ tɛrɛma wɔ bɛ da ditele fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 20:15" />Gɛ bɛnɩ akpi fɔ powu gɛtɛ bɛ̀ fɩya ma Yowabi fɔ, bɛ sʋ Abeli-Beti-Maaka ditele bɛ sa Seba wo koro. Bɛ kʋla atɩn ma ataa bɛ sʋ ditele fɔ. Gɛ bee gbena ditele fɔ dɩɩpɔrɩ fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 20:16" />Gɛ ɛna-sɛyɩlɛ ɛkɩ ɛ sà gɩta e ye ditele fɔ daanɩ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ nʋn! Ɩ nʋn! Dɔ̀ Yowabi alɛ, ɛ ba nfan, n te len nan tabʋrʋ ma ɛwɔ. <verse eid="2SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 20:17" />Gɛ Yowabi e kpe ɛ gbɛma wɔ, gɛ ɛna fɔ e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Awɔ n di Yowabi?&gt;&gt; Gɛ e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩɩn.&gt;&gt; Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Nʋn aasʋgʋgyan wanyun-gyebi.&gt;&gt; Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ntɛ nʋn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 20:18" />Gɛ ɛna fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Wukukuba fɔ, bɛɛ tɩ̀ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;San ma bugiti aade yiinyun Abeli ditele daanɩ!&gt; Fɔ ade i were gɛfɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 20:19" />Tì si olila ma nʋnkwarɩ wanɩ Isareli gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ. Mɔ à len àà mɩna ditele gɛtɛ dì di Isareli atele powu yɩɩna fɔ. Anʋn yii koro gɛ aa len àà muru Yahwe wanyan?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 20:20" />Yowabi e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Nyawʋ wʋ san ɔfɔ! wʋ san ɔfɔ gɛtɛ nmɩ nan bwalan abɛɛ nan mɩna! <verse eid="2SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 20:21" />Nyawʋ wʋn ma waanɩ. Mɔ Efrayim idon-te ɛkɩ gɛtɛ è di Bikiri wobi Seba fɔ, ɛ tɔ e yela egyu Dafidi wo koro. Tiri ɛwɔ woko tɛ, fɔ nan ye ditele nyadɩ daanɩ.&gt;&gt; Gɛ ɛna fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ Yowabi alan, &lt;&lt;Nya, baà fun wo duyu bɛ fɩna wɔ̀.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 20:22" />Gɛ ɛna fɔ ɛ ma tabʋrʋ ma bɛnɩ fɔ wɔ gɛsɛyɩ gaanɩ, gɛ be belen Bikiri wobi Seba duyu, gɛ be fun dɩ bɛ tɛ Yowabi. Okoro ɛ fʋn dɩkantan fɔ, gɛ wɔ bɛnɩ fɔ powu bɛ yasɩ be ye ditele fɔ daanɩ. Ɛkamasɛ ɛ da wɔlɛ. Gɛ Yowabi e biri ɛ da egyu fɔ wakʋn Yerusalem. <verse eid="2SA 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 20:23" />Yowabi n di Isareli bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ powu bɔɔndɩrɛ, gɛ Yehoyada wobi Benaya mɔ ɛ nya Kereti bete ma Peleti bete fɔ boo koro. <verse eid="2SA 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 20:24" />Adoram n tɛ nya ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ mɛ gʋtʋn ma ɔkɛma fɔ boo koro, gɛ Ayiludi wobi Yewosafati mɔ è di ɛŋwaralɛ. <verse eid="2SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 20:25" />Sewa è di ɛŋwaralɛ, gɛ Sadoki ma Abiyata bè di gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ. <verse eid="2SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 20:26" />Yari-te Ira mɔ ke è di Dafidi gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ.<verse eid="2SA 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2SA 21" />
  <para style="s1">Gibeyon bete bɛ mɛ Sawulo be le gutoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 21:1" />Dafidi bugyu buu gedi gaawi yaanɩ fɔ, dɩkpan-dɩrɛ di sere bɩkyan bisiyee powu. Gɛ Dafidi e lila Yahwe. Gɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Nkalan wʋ sɔ Sawulo ma wɔ dɩkpaara dii koro, yema e wolo Gibeyon bete.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 21:2" />Okoro egyu e kpèlè Gibeyon bete fɔ, gɛ ɛ tabʋrʋ ma ɛbɛ. Gibeyon bete fɔ ben di Isareli bɛnɩ, mɔ bè di gɛ Amori bete gɛtɛ be kuruma fɔ. Wʋ̀ sa waanɩ alɛ, Isareli bete bɛ dɔ̀ gɛtɛ nafɔ bàà we boo gutunkoro, mɔ Sawulo e len gɛtɛ nafɔ èè muru bɛ, yema gelen-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ ba tɛ Isareli ma Yuda bete fɔ wuu koro. <verse eid="2SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 21:3" />Gɛ Dafidi e lila Gibeyon bete fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn gɛ n mɛ n tɛ yɩ? Lan gɛ nan mɛ fɔ yiituru wàà nʋ̀n yɩ, fɔ yàà bwala Yahwe gbagba bɛnɩ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 21:4" />Gibeyon bete fɔ bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Wun di sɩka-fututu ma sɩka-sɩya waade n sa ɛtɩ ma Sawulo ma wɔ dɩkpaara dii getite, gɛ wun di taamɩnlɛ gɛtɛ taà wolo Isareli wɔnɩ ɛkɩ.&gt;&gt; Gɛ e lila bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn gɛ ɩɩ dɔ̀ alɛ, n mɛ n tɛ yɩ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 21:5" />Bɛ dɔ̀ egyu fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛnɩ gɛtɛ e muru tɩ, gɛ ɛ mɛ wamɩnlɛ alɛ ɛɛ̀ mɩna tɩ, anlɛ gɛtɛ waà mɛ gɛtɛ tɩn nan wura gɛsarakʋn Isareli atele yaanɩ fɔ, <verse eid="2SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 21:6" />yɛ bàà tɛ tɩ wodu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ kwarankɩ (7), fɔ tàà ka bɛ tɩ san Gibeya ditele, Sawulo wɔlɛ Yahwe odon fɔ wuu koro, fɔ tàà ma wolo bɛ Yahwe bʋnʋn.&gt;&gt; Gɛ egyu fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Nan ka bɛ n tɛ yɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 21:7" />Mɔ egyu fɔ e we Sawulo wobi Yonatan wobi Mefiboseti gutunkoro, yema Efonte wɔ ntam, gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Dafidi ma Sawulo wobi Yonatan boo getite fɔ wuu koro. <verse eid="2SA 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 21:8" />Egyu fɔ ɛ ka Ayiya wobi Risipa bebi-tenibi bɛnyɔɔ gɛtɛ e wo ɛ tɛ Sawulo, Arimoni ma Mefiboseti fɔ, ma Sawulo wobi Merabi bebi-tenibi ton, gɛtɛ e wo ɛ tɛ Mewola-te Basilayi wobi Adirile fɔ, <verse eid="2SA 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 21:9" />gɛ ɛ ka bɛ ɛ tɛ Gibeyon bete fɔ. Gɛ be wolo bɛ fà Yahwe bʋnʋn, odon fɔ wuu koro, gɛ bɔɔ bɛnɩ kwarankɩ powu be muru disere-kɩlɩn. Be wolo bɛ afɩnaa yii gesila yii duwi-gyangbasɛlɛ daanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 21:10" />Ayiya wobi Risipa ɛ ka disepekyi dɩɩ dɩyan, gɛ ɛ sɩ̀ ɛ tɛ wo koro ataa fɔ yii koro. Ye kyangbelele ofila ma sere ɔya gɛtɛ ɛsʋn ɛ nʋ̀n e lu bekpena boo koro gɛ ɛ sɩ̀ disepekyi dɩɩ dɩyan fɔ. Ɛn yɛ bɛsɩsɩra bàà be di bɛ difilawi daanɩ, abɛɛ dɩfa dɩɩ bɛnan bàà bɛ̀ kɔrɔ bɛ odente. <verse eid="2SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 21:11" />Gɛtɛ bɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi gɩnyan gɛtɛ Sawulo wodima Ayiya wobi Risipa ɛ mɛ fɔ, <verse eid="2SA 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 21:12" />Dafidi ɛ san ɛ ma ka Sawulo ma wobi Yonatan baanankʋba e ye Yabesi-Gileyadi. Be yuri bɛ be ye Beti-San bɛnɩ boo getumakʋn, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ Filisiti bete bɛ fà bɛ duwi gɛtɛ Filisiti bete be wolo Sawulo Gilibowa odon wuu koro fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 21:13" />Dafidi ɛ ka Sawulo ma wobi Yonatan baanankʋba e ye dʋkɔ ɛ ba, gɛ ɛ kʋla ɛbɛ gɛtɛ be wolo bɛ fà fɔ mɔ baanankʋba. <verse eid="2SA 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 21:14" />Be lò Sawulo ma wobi Yonatan baanankʋba Sela ditele, Benyamin bete bɔɔ gɛtʋnkwaa gii koro, wote Kisi gɩsàn gɩɩpɩ. Anlɛ gɛ bɛ mɛ ɛwʋ gɛtɛ egyu e wùlà bɛ fɔ powu. Ɛwʋ wʋʋ gama fɔ, Wurubwarɛ ɛ nʋn boo inyun-tiri tɛ gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 21:15" />Akpa i biri i sere Filisiti bete ma Isareli bete boo getite, gɛ Dafidi ɛ san ma wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ, gɛ bɛ kpà ma Filisiti bete fɔ. Gɛ Dafidi ɛ fana. <verse eid="2SA 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 21:16" />Gɛ Rafa bɛkɛmalɛ fɔ baanɩ bɔɔnana ɛkɩ Isibi wonobi, gɛtɛ wɔ gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya gii giturunyan gɩɩdʋrʋ wʋ̀ ba bekilo besiyee gɛ è de edon-fon fɔ, ɛ sa amɩnlɛ gɛtɛ eè wolo Dafidi. <verse eid="2SA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 21:17" />Mɔ Seruya wobi Abisayi ɛ bɛ kpà Dafidi, gɛ Abisayi ɛ kpà ma Filisita-te fɔ, gɛ e wolo wɔ. Gɛ Dafidi bɛnɩ fɔ bɛ kan ntam alan, &lt;&lt;Dafidi, an nan nɩ san akpa ma ɛtɩ kpa, fɔ Isareli bete bɔɔtan wʋ kara bè ku.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 21:18" />Nyawʋ wʋʋ gama fɔ akpa i biri i sere ma Filisiti bete Gobi ditele dɩɩ gɩlan. Gɛ Wusa-te Sibekayi e wolo Safi, gɛtɛ è di Rafa bɛkɛmalɛ fɔ wodu waanɩ wʋʋnɩ ɛkɩ. <verse eid="2SA 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 21:19" />Gɛ akpa-fon i biri i sere ma Filisiti bete Gobi ditele dɩɩ gɩlan. Gɛ Betelehem-te Yaare-Oregim wobi Elihanan e wolo Gati-te Goliyati, gɛtɛ wodon wù we anlɛ gɩtʋrʋnyan gɛtɛ bɛɛ ka bɛ lɔ ayan fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 21:20" />Akpa-fon i biri i sere Gati ditele dɩɩ gɩlan. Gɛ ete-dɩrɛ ɛkɩ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ ba alobi ma bɩsɩrɩbi kooron-kooron, gɛ ɛyɩ powu ɩ ma mɛ dikpilin ma anaa fɔ ɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛbɛ, gɛ ɛwɔ mɔ è di Rafa bɛkɛmalɛ fɔ boodu waanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 21:21" />Gɛtɛ ɛ nya Isareli bete alɛ bè di bɛfɔbʋlɩlɛ fɔ, Dafidi wonobi Simeya wobi Yonatan e wolo wɔ. <verse eid="2SA 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 21:22" />Bɛnɩ bɛnaa nyabɛ powu, bè di gɛ Rafa bɛkɛmalɛ bɔɔ bɛnana gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Gati fɔ, gɛ bɛ nʋ̀n Dafidi ma wɔ bɛsaranyan fɔ baalɔ yaanɩ.<verse eid="2SA 21:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2SA 22" />
  <para style="s1">Dafidi ɛ nʋma ɔnʋn e sila Yahwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 22:1" />Gɛtɛ Yahwe e to Dafidi e ye Sawulo ma wɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ do baalɔ yaanɩ fɔ, Dafidi ɛ nʋma ɔnʋn nyawʋ ɛ tɛ Yahwe alan,<verse eid="2SA 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 22:2" />Yahwe n di mɩɩn dɩtaa-dɩrɛ, ma miin gebukʋn, ma miintolɛ-yalɛ.<verse eid="2SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 22:3" />Miin Wurubwarɛ n di mɩɩn dɩtaa-dɩrɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:3">wanɩ gɛ nte bu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:3">Ɛwɔ n di mɩɩn gɩwɔrɔnyan-dɩyɛlɛ koro, ma miin getoya gɩɩkɛma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:3">Yahwe n di mɩɩnkɛmakʋn, ma miin gebukʋn, ma miintolɛ-yalɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:3">Gɛ a tiri mɩ a ye dɩgangan dɩɩ bɛnɩ baalɔ yaanɩ.<verse eid="2SA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 22:4" />Na kpèlè Yahwe, ɛwɔ na kʋtʋma ma gesila.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:4">E to mɩ e ye mɩɩn bɛkyʋnlɛ baalɔ yaanɩ.<verse eid="2SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 22:5" />Diku di silin mɩ anlɛ butu bʋʋ gɛgbɛrɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:5">Butu walɩlɛ-mɩnalɛ-anyan milin mɩ.<verse eid="2SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 22:6" />Gɩsàn gɩɩ-ɩŋʋʋ i milin mɩ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:6">Diku di ten ɔdʋ.<verse eid="2SA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 22:7" />Mɩɩn dɩfana daanɩ fɔ, na kpèlè Yahwe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:7">Na kpèlè Wurubwarɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:7">Ɛ nʋn mɩɩn gɩta ye wo dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:7">Gɛ miin gewula gi gyu waten yaanɩ.<verse eid="2SA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 22:8" />Gɛ gɛtʋnkwaa gi gyu gɩsaa, gɛ gi kpenti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:8">Gatala gii gesere-gyagakʋn gi kpenti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:8">Gɩsaa gi ton gatala gaanyan, yema ɛ ka owurufa.<verse eid="2SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 22:9" />Iwe i ye waninfere yaanɩ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:9">Ɔtan meli-meli wu ye wonyun waanɩ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:9">Atanga-ŋɛŋɛ ii ye wonyun waanɩ.<verse eid="2SA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 22:10" />Ɛ wanla gatala, gɛ ɛ waran ɛ ba gatɩn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:10">ma dɩkpaba-diya wɔ bɩsɩrɩ bʋʋ gatɩn.<verse eid="2SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 22:11" />Ɛ sara kerubi wo koro tɔ afiye yaanɩ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:11">Gɛ ɛ sara afiye yaabanban yii koro ɛ san-san.<verse eid="2SA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 22:12" />Ɛ yɛ dibilin di tin wɔ anlɛ dɩyan dii dikwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:12">akpaba ma otin, ma butu bu silin wɔ.<verse eid="2SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 22:13" />Wɔ bʋnʋn baanɩ buu gesiye fɔ gaanɩ gɛ ɔtan-meli-meli fɔ wuu ye.<verse eid="2SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 22:14" />Yahwe fa e ye gatala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:14">gɛ bɛ nʋn Ɛkpatakpɩrɩ fɔ gɩta.<verse eid="2SA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 22:15" />Gɛ ɛ tà bɩsɩnta, gɛ ɛ yasɩ wɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:15">Ɛ sa gesiye gɛtɛ gi berema bɛ be serenti.<verse eid="2SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 22:16" />Ɛpʋ gamɩ gba gɩ yɛ gii we,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:16">Gɛtʋnkwaa gii gesere-gyagakʋn gɩ yɛ gɩ̀ dɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:16">Gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ fa wɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:16">gɛ e mugusi owurufa waanɩ fɔ.<verse eid="2SA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 22:17" />Ɛ tʋna gʋlɔ e ye gatala, gɛ e ton mɩ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:17">e tiira mɩ e ye butu ma alun baanɩ.<verse eid="2SA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 22:18" />E to mɩ e ye mɩɩn bɛkyʋnlɛ ma ɩkɛma baakʋn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:18">ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛn taa len maade, gɛ bɛ̀ ba ɔkɛma da mɩ fɔ.<verse eid="2SA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 22:19" />Bɛɛ tà mɩ bɩtà ɔkʋna gɛtɛ n sa dɩyɩyɛ daawi yaanɩ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:19">mɔ Yahwe n di mɩɩnkpàlɛ.<verse eid="2SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 22:20" />Ɛ ka mɩ ɛ ba ɔkʋn gɛtɛ ade-kpen ɩn ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:20">e to mɩ yema ee len maade.<verse eid="2SA 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 22:21" />Yahwe ɛ tɩyɛla mɩ yema maade-kpara yii koro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:21">gɛtɛ maalɔ ɩn ma dɩdɩɩ wuu koro ɛ nʋn maakʋn.<verse eid="2SA 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 22:22" />Yema na sa Yahwe wo-isele yii koro.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:22">mɩɩn mɛ ade-kpen ɩkɩ mɩɩn Wurubwarɛ bʋnʋn.<verse eid="2SA 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 22:23" />Ǹ te di wo-ise powu yii koro.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:23">Min terema wade-wùlàlɛ fɔ.<verse eid="2SA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 22:24" />Ɛ̀ nyɩ gɛtɛ n ma dɩdɩɩ dɩkɩ wɔ bʋnʋn baanɩ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:24">gɛ na tiri miin koro na ye ade-kpen yaanɩ.<verse eid="2SA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 22:25" />Yahwe ɛ tɩyɛla mɩ anlɛ gɛtɛ maade-tʋnalɛ ɩ̀ dɔ̀,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:25">anlɛ gɛtɛ n we fɩrɩnfɩrɩn wɔ bʋnʋn baanɩ fɔ,<verse eid="2SA 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 22:26" />Oo! Yahwe, aa di nʋnkwarɩ a tɛ ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛ ba nʋnkwarɩ fɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:26">Ɛbɛ gɛtɛ boo koro gɩn ma ade-kpen ɩkɩ fɔ, aa yɛ bee we gɛtɛ a ma ade-kpen ɩkɩ.<verse eid="2SA 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 22:27" />À we fɩrɩnfɩrɩn tɛ ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bè we fɩrɩnfɩrɩn fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:27">gɛ ade-kpen yɩɩ bɛmɛlɛ fɔ, bee we wɔ̀ anlɛ diyu-kɛma diite.<verse eid="2SA 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 22:28" />Aa to ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ warama koro gatɩn fɔ nkpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:28">mɔ aa warama ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ bʋma koro gatala fɔ gatɩn.<verse eid="2SA 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 22:29" />Oo! Yahwe, awɔ n di mɩɩn kandɩya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:29">a berema dibilin gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa maanɩ fɔ.<verse eid="2SA 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 22:30" />Aakɛma waanɩ fɔ ǹ talɩ ǹ di mɩɩn bɛkyʋnlɛ boo koro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:30">aakɛma wuu koro n talɩ n firigi n kààrà bɔɔ-ɩpɔrɩ.<verse eid="2SA 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 22:31" />Wurubwarɛ bɩrɛ wosele wʋ̀ tʋna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:31">Yahwe wanyun-gyebi ɩ̀ sa waanɩ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:31">È di gebukʋn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:31">tɛ ɛbɛ powu gɛtɛ bɛɛ ma bu wakʋn fɔ.<verse eid="2SA 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 22:32" />Ɛnyan n di Wurubwarɛ, Yahwe gama?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:32">Gɛ ɛnyan n di dɩtaa-dɩrɛ fɩya ma tii Wurubwarɛ?<verse eid="2SA 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 22:33" />Wurubwarɛ nyawɔ n di miin gebukʋn-dɩrɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:33">gɛ ɛ yɛ miinsele wʋ̀ tʋna.<verse eid="2SA 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 22:34" />Ɛɛ sa mɩɩn bɩsɩrɩ ɔkɛma anlɛ ɛpɩtɩrɩkyɛ woyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:34">ɛ yɛ mɩ n yela idon yii koro.<verse eid="2SA 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 22:35" />E wùlà mɩ bɩtà buu gɛtà,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:35">fɔ nan talɩ n tiira gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya gɩɩ gyangarɩ. <verse eid="2SA 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 22:36" />Oo! Yahwe, a nya miin koro gɛ a to mɩ nkpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:36">aa gɛkpa gɩ yɛ mɩ na mɛ ɛnɩ-dɩrɛ.<verse eid="2SA 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 22:37" />An yɛ mɩɩn bɛkyʋnlɛ bàà gye mɩ bɩtà,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:37">an yɛ mɩ nan nʋ̀n bɩtà baanɩ.<verse eid="2SA 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 22:38" />Na kpà na gyaga mɩɩn bɛkyʋnlɛ boo koro, gɛ na di boo koro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:38">Min kere gɛkpà ma ɛbɛ ya ma sere gɛtɛ na muru bɛ.<verse eid="2SA 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 22:39" />Na wolo bɛ na fɩna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:39">bɛ nʋ̀n mɩɩn bɩsɩrɩ baanɩ gɛ bɛn mɩnɩ talɩ tɔ.<verse eid="2SA 22:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 22:40" />A sa mɩ ɔkɛma tɛ akpa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:40">A yɛ na di mɩɩn bɛkyʋnlɛ boo koro.<verse eid="2SA 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 22:41" />A yɛ mɩɩn bɛkyʋnlɛ be serenti be biri bɔɔ gama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:41">na muru ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ kyʋn mɩ fɔ.<verse eid="2SA 22:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 22:42" />Bɛ gbɛrɛ afala be kpèlè etolɛ-yalɛ, mɔ ɛkɩ ɛn ma gɛtɛ èè to bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:42">bɛ gbɛrɛ afala be kpèlè Yahwe, mɔ en yera bɛ. <verse eid="2SA 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 22:43" />Na kpààrà bɛ na mɛ anlɛ itunbu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:43">na kyikya-kyikya boo koro anlɛ dɩdan daanɩ daatɩn.<verse eid="2SA 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="2SA 22:44" />A tiri mɩ a ye mɩɩn bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛɛ tɔ be yela miin koro fɔ baalɔ yaanɩ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:44">a mɛ mɩ bɩfɩɩ buugyegeyelɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:44">Gɛ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ mɩn nyɩ̀ bɛ fɔ, bɛ sara mɩɩn gatɩn bɛ sʋma mɩ. <verse eid="2SA 22:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="2SA 22:45" />Besela be be kura mɩ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:45">gengyi bɛ bɔ bɛ nʋn mɩɩn gɩta fɔ, bee bù mɩ.<verse eid="2SA 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="2SA 22:46" />Gɩsaa gi gyu bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:46">be ye baabukʋn bɛ ba ma koro gɩɩ gɛgbɛrɛ. <verse eid="2SA 22:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="2SA 22:47" />Yahwe ɛ̀ sa. Baà sila miintolɛ-yalɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:47">Ɛwɔ n di dɩtaa-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ e to mɩ.<verse eid="2SA 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="2SA 22:48" />Ɛwɔ na yɛ gɛ na di mɩɩn bɛkyʋnlɛ boo koro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:48">ɛ ka bɩfɩɩ ɛ sa mɩɩn gatɩn.<verse eid="2SA 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="2SA 22:49" />ɛwɔ na tiri mɩ a ye mɩɩn bɛkyʋnlɛ baalɔ yaanɩ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:49">a bʋma mɩ gatala a da mɩɩn bɛkyʋnlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:49">gɛ a tiri mɩ a ye dɩgangan dɩɩ bɛnɩ baalɔ yaanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="2SA 22:50" />Oo! Yahwe, nyawʋ wuu koro gɛ n tɛ tɔ̀là wɔ̀ bɩfɩɩ powu baanɩ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:50">n nʋma gesila gɩɩnʋn n sila aa diyere.<verse eid="2SA 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="2SA 22:51" />A yɛ aagyu e di bɩfɩɩ kpekpesi buu koro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:51">e tiri wo gelen gakpaakpa fɔ e wùlà wɔnɩ gɛtɛ ɛ sʋrʋ bʋnɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:51">Dafidi ma wɔ bɛnana gakpaakpa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 22:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2SA 23" />
  <para style="s1">Dafidi wanyun-gyebi kurumakyɛɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 23:1" />Dafidi anyun-gyebi-kurumakyɛɛ n tɛ ba lɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:1">&lt;&lt;Yese wobi Dafidi waade-dɔ̀lɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:1">ɛwɔ gɛtɛ Ɛkpatakpɩrɩ ɛ bʋma gatala fɔ wanyun-gyebi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:1">ɛwɔ gɛtɛ Yakobu wo Wurubwarɛ ɛ sʋrʋ bʋnɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:1">Isareli wɔ-ɩnʋn yɩɩnʋmalɛ.<verse eid="2SA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 23:2" />Yahwe Gifiye gɩ dama miin koro gɩ tabʋrʋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:2">wanyun-gyebi ɩ̀ sa miinyun waanɩ.<verse eid="2SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 23:3" />Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ ɛ tabʋrʋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:3">Isareli Dɩtaa-dɩrɛ dɩ dɔ̀ mɩ alan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:3">&lt;Gengyi ɛkɩ ɛ̀ ka osele kpara e di bugyu ɛ tɛ bɛnɩ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:3">gengyi ɛ̀ ka Wurubwarɛ geserenti e di bugyu ɛ tɛ bɛnɩ fɔ,<verse eid="2SA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 23:4" />è we anlɛ gagyɩgyan giifila</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:4">ntɛ ŋalagɩ gɛtɛ akpaba ɩn ma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:4">anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛsʋn ɛɛ nʋ̀n ɛ kpa gɛ wʋʋ ŋmaŋɩ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:4">gɛ wʋʋ yɛ dɩfa dɩɩ tara gɛtʋnkwaa gii koro fɔ.<verse eid="2SA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 23:5" />Gɛlɛ gɛ Wurubwarɛ ee hira mɩɩn dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">yema ɛ tà dikola gakpaakpa ma nmɩ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">Dikola gɛtɛ dɩn nan furu dɩ nya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ ɛ sɩ gɛtɛ dɩn nan foma dɩ nya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:5">Ɛwʋ gɛtɛ nte len powu wʋ lɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">Ɛ yɛ na di ade yii koro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">gɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛɛ̀ nyɩ ɛ yɛ ɛwʋ powu wàà ba waanɩ.<verse eid="2SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 23:6" />Mɔ ade-kpen yɩɩ bɛnɩ bè we anlɛ iwiya gɛtɛ be fun be lulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:6">ɛkɩ ɛɛn talɩ ɛ ka alɔ-kwaa ɛ kʋla yɩ.<verse eid="2SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 23:7" />Ɛkamasɛ gɛtɛ ee len ɛ̀ɛ̀ kʋla iwiya fɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:7">wù di gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ka gɩwɔrɔnyan abɛɛ oyon ɛ kʋla yɩ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:7">pɛ gɛ ɛɛ̀ talɩ e kuma yɩ yɩɩ gɛdʋrɔkʋn dʋkɔ.<verse eid="2SA 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dafidi bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɛkɛmalɛ</para>
  <para style="r">1 Ɩya-Ɩya 11:10-341</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 23:8" />Dafidi bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ ma ɔkɛma fɔ baayere n tɛ ba lɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 23:8">Takemon-te Yosebi-Basebeti è di bɛnɩ besiyee fɔ boo gyegeyelɛ. E wolo bɛnɩ nkpɩn bɩnaa (800) akpa-kɩlɩn yaanɩ.<verse eid="2SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 23:9" />Bɛkɛmalɛ besiyee fɔ baanɩ ɛnyɔɔfɛ n di Dodo wobi Eleyasa gɛtɛ è di Ahohi-te fɔ. Ɛ̀ fɩya ma Dafidi gɛ bɛ sʋpa Filisiti bete ɔkʋna gɛtɛ be tuma Pasi-Damim bàà kpà, gɛ Isareli bɛ kɔkɔ iti fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 23:10" />Mɔ ɛ tɔ e yela, gɛ e wolo Filisiti bete ma ye ɔkʋna gɛtɛ wɔ gʋlɔ gi ku wɔ, gɛ edon fɔ ɛ wɔ wɔ gʋlɔ gaanɩ, gɛ Yahwe ɛ yɛ be di boo koro duwi dɩtɔkɔ. Gɛ bɛnɩ fɔ powu be biri bɛ ba Eleyasa wakʋn, gɛ bɛ bɛ ka bekulɛ fɔ baanyan.<verse eid="2SA 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 23:11" />Bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ ma ɔkɛma besiyee fɔ baanɩ esiyeefɛ fɔ n di Harari-te Agee wobi Sama. Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Filisiti bete be tuma Lehi gɛtʋnkwaa gɛtɛ akyɛɛ ɩ yɔn gaanɩ fɔ, Isareli bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ be serenti be ye Filisiti bete baakʋn. <verse eid="2SA 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 23:12" />Mɔ Sama ɛ ma yela gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gii getite, gɛ ɛ kpà e to gɛtʋnkwaa ma gaakyɛɛ fɔ, gɛ e wolo Filisiti bete, gɛ Yahwe ɛ yɛ be di boo koro gepepe.<verse eid="2SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 23:13" />Gɛtɛ wʋ nɩma anyan yɩɩ gɛya yɩɩya fɔ, bɛndɩrɛ-bi dikpilin ma fwo (30) fɔ baanɩ besiyee bɛ ba Adulam dɩtaa-fwe, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ Dafidi è bu fɔ. Fɔ Filisiti bete bɔɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ mɔ be tuma Refayim dɩtagba daanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 23:14" />Ɔkʋna wʋtɔkɔ fɔ, Dafidi ɛ̀ sa gebukʋn dʋkɔ, gɛ Filisiti bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ bɛkɩ bɛ̀ sa Betelehem ditele daanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 23:15" />Duwi dɩkɩ otinbili wu ton Dafidi, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛnyan n ma kpà butu e ye ɔlɔkɔ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Betelehem wotunu fɔ ɛ mɔma mɩ nan nyʋn!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 23:16" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ ma ɔkɛma besiyee fɔ be gyu Filisiti bete fɔ baanɩ be ye, gɛ bɛ ma kpà butu be ye Betelehem ɔlɔkɔ fɔ yaanɩ bɛ mɔma Dafidi. Mɔ ɛn nyʋn bʋ fɔ, ɛ da bʋ e lù anlɛ gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ ɛ tɛ Yahwe. <verse eid="2SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 23:17" />Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Oo Yahwe, wʋ san ɔfɔ gɛtɛ nan nyʋn butu nyabʋ. Nka gɛlɛ fɔ waà mɛ anlɛ ntɛ nyʋn bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ ka bɔɔ nkpa bɛ sɩ̀ lɛ bɔɔ nkalan&gt;&gt; Okoro Dafidi ɛn nyʋn bʋ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 23:17">Bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ ma ɔkɛma besiyee fɔ baakɛmade fɔ ɩkɩ ɩ lɛ.<verse eid="2SA 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 23:18" />Seruya wobi Yowabi wonobi Abisayi n di bɛndɩrɛ-bi dikpilin ma fwo (30) fɔ boogyegeyelɛ. Ɛ ka wɔ gɩtʋrʋnyan e wolo bɛnɩ gɛkpɩn ma akpilin ton (300), gɛ ɛwɔ mɔ e di diyere-dɩrɛ anlɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ ma ɔkɛma besiyee fɔ ke. <verse eid="2SA 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 23:19" />Wo diyere di ye bɛndɩrɛ-bi dikpilin ma fwo fɔ powu baanɩ, gɛ e bè biligi boogyegeyelɛ mɔ bɛn kalan wɔ fɩya ma bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ ma ɔkɛma besiyee.<verse eid="2SA 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 23:20" />Yehoyada wobi Benaya gɛtɛ e ye Kabisele fɔ mɔ è di bɩtà bʋʋtàlɛ-dɩrɛ. Ɛ mɛ ade-dɩrɛ-dɩrɛ, gɛ e wolo Mowabi bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ-dɩrɛ-dɩrɛ bɛnyɔɔ. Nkele mɔ, e gyu difwe daanɩ ɛ ma wolo ɛdɩ̀rɛ̀ duwi dɩkɩ gɛtɛ wù di olili-dɩrɛ wuu duwi daanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 23:21" />Gɛ e wolo Egyipiti bɩtà bɩtàlɛ gagaraga ɛkɩ. Ma gɛtɛ Egyipiti-te fɔ è de gɩtʋrʋnyan gba fɔ, Benaya ɛ ma tama wɔ ma woyon-tonlɛ, gɛ ɛ labɩrɩ gɩtʋrʋnyan fɔ e ye Egyipiti-te fɔ gʋlɔ gaanɩ, gɛ ɛ ka gɩ e sere wɔ e wolo. <verse eid="2SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 23:22" />Ade-dɩrɛ-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ Yehoyada wobi Benaya ɛ mɛ fɔ ɩkɩ ɩ lɛ. Ɛwɔ mɔ e di diyere anlɛ bɛndɩrɛ-bi dikpilin ma fwo fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 23:23" />Wo diyere di dɩ da bɛndɩrɛ-bi dikpilin ma fwo fɔ. Mɔ ɛn nɩma bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ ma ɔkɛma besiyee fɔ. Gɛ Dafidi ɛ mɛ wɔ bɛdɩyɛlɛ fɔ bɔɔndɩrɛ.<verse eid="2SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 23:24" />Bɛnɩ dikpilin ma fwo fɔ n di:</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:24">Yowabi wonobi Asaheli,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:24">ma Betelehem-te Dodo wobi Elanan,<verse eid="2SA 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 23:25" />ma Harodi-te Sama,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:25">ma Harodi-te Elika,<verse eid="2SA 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 23:26" />ma Paliti-te Helesi,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:26">Tekowa-te Ikesi wobi Ira,<verse eid="2SA 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 23:27" />ma Anatoti-te Abiyese,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:27">ma Husafa-te Mebunayi,<verse eid="2SA 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 23:28" />ma Ahohi-te Salimon,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:28">Netofati-te Maharayi<verse eid="2SA 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 23:29" />ma Netofati-te Baana wobi Heledi, Ribayi gɛtɛ e ye Gibeya gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Benyamin gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ fɔ wobi Itayi,<verse eid="2SA 23:29" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 23:30" />Piraton-te Benaya,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:30">ma Gasa-getu-te Hidayi,<verse eid="2SA 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 23:31" />Aribati-te Abi-Alibon,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:31">ma Bahumi-te Asimaweti,<verse eid="2SA 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 23:32" />Salibon-te Elihaba,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:32">ma Yasihen bebi-teni,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:32">ma Yonatan <verse eid="2SA 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 23:33" />Harari-te Sama wobi-teni,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:33">ma Harari-te Sarari wobi Ahiyam,<verse eid="2SA 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 23:34" />Maaka-te Asabayi wobi Elifeleti,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:34">ma Giloni-te Ahitofeli wobi Eliyam,<verse eid="2SA 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 23:35" />Kameli-te Hesiro,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:35">ma Abi-te Paarayi,<verse eid="2SA 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 23:36" />Natan wobi Igali gɛtɛ e ye Soba fɔ,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:36">ma Hagri wobi<verse eid="2SA 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 23:37" />Amon-te Seleki,</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:37">ma Bereto-te Naharayi, gɛtɛ è di Seruya wobi Yowabi wakpa-nyan yiitolalɛ fɔ,<verse eid="2SA 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 23:38" />Itri-te Ira</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="2SA 23:38">ma Itri-te Garebi,<verse eid="2SA 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 23:39" />ma Hiti-te Uriya.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2SA 23:39">Ɛbɛ powu bɛ̀ bà bɛnɩ dikpilin ma fwo-kwarankɩ.<verse eid="2SA 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2SA 24" />
  <para style="s1">Dafidi ɛ kalan bɛnɩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 24:1" />Yahwe e biri ɛ ka owurufa Isareli bete boo koro, gɛ ɛ fʋba ɛ sa Dafidi gɛtɛ ɛ ma ha bɛ. Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;San, fɔ a ma kalan Isareli ma Yuda bete.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 24:2" />Okoro Egyu Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ Yowabi gɛtɛ è di bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;San Isareli wo-ifoli fɔ powu yaanɩ, fɔ àà yɛ bàà kalan bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ ye Dan ma sere Beeseba ditele. Fɔ nan wura n nyɩnla baasɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 24:3" />Mɔ Yowabi ɛ dɔ̀ egyu fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe aa Wurubwarɛ fɔ ɛ yɛ bɛnɩ fɔ baasɔ fɩya disere akpilin ton, fɔ miinfonte egyu ɛ̀ɛ̀ ka wɔ gʋnʋn we bɛ. Mɔ anʋn yii koro gɛ miinfonte egyu ee len ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɛ gɛlɛ gaade nyayɩ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 24:4" />Mɔ egyu fɔ wanyun-gyebi fɔ ɩ da Yowabi ma bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɛndɩrɛ fɔ. Okoro be kpe be ye egyu fɔ bʋnʋn bɛ da, gɛtɛ bàà ma kalan Isareli bɛnɩ fɔ.<verse eid="2SA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 24:5" />Gɛtɛ bɛ kààrà Yodan getu fɔ, bɛ sara bɛ gbɛma Arore ditele gɩlan gatɩn gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa dɩtagba fɔ dii getite, wʋʋ gama fɔ bɛ bʋn bɛ da Gadi ma Yaseri atele yaanɩ. <verse eid="2SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 24:6" />Bɛ san Gileyadi ma Tatim-Hodisi ma Dan-Yaan ma gyu Sidon ditele. <verse eid="2SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 24:7" />Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛ san Tire ditele gɛtɛ be sere ɔpɔrɩ be silin dɩ fɔ daanɩ, ma Hiwi bete ma Kanaan bete baatele yaanɩ. Gɛ bɛ san Beeseba gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Yuda fɔ.<verse eid="2SA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 24:8" />Gɛtɛ bɛ san atele fɔ powu yaanɩ be tuma fɔ, be biri bɛ ba Yerusalem. Be di bebon yɛkɩ ma awi dikpilin.<verse eid="2SA 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 24:9" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yowabi ɛ ka bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ kalan fɔ baasɔ e be wùlà egyu. E wura bɛnɩ asepekyi akpilin anyɔɔ (800,000) ye Isareli gɛtɛ baà talɩ bɛ san akpa. Gɛ e wura bɛnɩ asepekyi dikpilin ma ton (500,000) e ye Yuda.<verse eid="2SA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 24:10" />Mɔ gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛ kalan bɛnɩ fɔ e were fɔ, woturu wʋ gbɛrɛ wɔ. Gɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ Yahwe alan, &lt;&lt;Na mɛ ade-kpen-dɩrɛ yema ade gɛtɛ na mɛ lɛ yii koro. Yahwe, n fɔ wɔ̀ gɛ, ka nmɩ aasaranyan maade-kpen kyɛ mɩ, yema na mɛ anyimapu-de.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 24:11" />Pɛ Dafidi ɛ̀ bɛ lama tɔ gagyɩgyan-fuu fɔ, Yahwe ɛ wɛrɛ tabʋrʋ ma wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Gadi gɛtɛ è di ewelɛ tɛ Dafidi fɔ alan, <verse eid="2SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 24:12" />&lt;&lt;San ma dɔ̀ Dafidi alan, &lt;Nmɩ Yahwe alɛ, ǹ de geten-tiira akpen asiyee ntɛ sɩ̀ aa bʋnʋn. Tiri yaanɩ wʋkɩ fɔ nan yɛ wʋ wàà ba aa koro.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 24:13" />Okoro Gadi ɛ san Dafidi wakʋn gɛ ɛ ma lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Aa len dɩkpan dàà ba aa gɛtʋnkwaa gii koro bɩkyan bisiyee? Abɛɛ, aa len gɛtɛ àà serenti ye aa bɛkyʋnlɛ baakʋn bebon besiyee ɔkʋna gɛtɛ ɛbɛ mɔ bɛ kpa bɛ gyaga aa koro? Abɛɛ aa len gɛtɛ gyerebi ɛ̀ɛ̀ nʋ̀n aa gɛtʋnkwaa gii koro awi asiyee? Okoro sa waamɩnlɛ fɔ àà dɔ̀ mɩ anlɛ gɛtɛ nan biri n ma dɔ̀ ɛwɔ gɛtɛ ɛ sa mɩ fɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 24:14" />Gɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ Gadi alan, &lt;&lt;Ade fɔ powu ì di ade ma gɩsaa tɛ mɩ. Yɛ tɩ tàà nʋ̀n Yahwe walɔ yaanɩ, yema wo gutunkoro gɩ̀ sɔ. Mɔ kara yɛ tɩ tàà nʋ̀n bɛnɩ-nyalɛ baalɔ yaanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 24:15" />Okoro Yahwe ɛ yɛ gyerebi ɛ nʋ̀n Isareli gɛtʋnkwaa gii koro ye gagyɩgyan gɩtɔkɔ ma sere ɔkʋna gɛtɛ ɛ sɩ̀. Gɛ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be ku ye Dan ma sere Beeseba fɔ, bɛ ba asepekyi asiyee ma ɩgbaa ton (70,000) <verse eid="2SA 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 24:16" />Gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔsalɛ ɛ tʋna wɔ gʋlɔ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɩna Yerusalem fɔ, Yahwe e foma wamɩnlɛ ma giten gii getiira gɛtɛ gɩɩ tama bɛ fɔ. Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔsalɛ gɛtɛ ee wolo bɛnɩ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ten! Wʋ kʋtɩ gɛlɛ!&gt;&gt; Fɔ Yahwe wɔsalɛ fɔ è yela Yebusi-te Arawuna wanaabi yii getibakʋn.<verse eid="2SA 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 24:17" />Gɛtɛ Dafidi e we Wurubwarɛ wɔsalɛ gɛtɛ ee wolo bɛnɩ fɔ, ɛ dɔ̀ Yahwe alan, &lt;&lt;Nmɩ na mɛ ade-kpen gɛ na mɛ ade gɛtɛ ɩn kɔlɔ. Mɔ nyabɛ bɩrɛ, bè di gɛ bɛyɛran, anʋn gɛ bɛ mɛ? Tiira gɛ nmɩ, ma mɩɩn dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ giten.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dafidi e sere gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 24:18" />Duwi dɩtɔkɔ daanɩ fɔ Gadi ɛ san Dafidi wakʋn, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Bʋn san gatala, fɔ àà ma sere gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn tɛ Yahwe, Yebusi-te Arawuna wanaabi yii getibakʋn fɔ gaanɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 24:19" />Okoro Dafidi ɛ bʋn ɛ da anlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ dama Gadi wo koro ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 24:20" />Gɛtɛ Arawuna ɛ nya gɛ e we egyu fɔ ma wɔ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛɛ ba wakʋn fɔ, ɛ gbɛrɛ e ye okòro gɛ e kura egyu bɩsɩrɩ baanɩ ɛ ka wɔ bʋnʋn e tin gɛtʋnkwaa.<verse eid="2SA 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 24:21" />Gɛ Arawuna ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn na ba gɛ miinfonte egyu aa ba nmɩ aasaranyan maakʋn lɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 24:21">Dafidi e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Na ba nan be siye aanaabi yii getibakʋn fɔ, fɔ nan talɩ n mara gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn n tɛ Yahwe, fɔ wàà yɛ gyerebi gɛtɛ ɛ nʋn bɛnɩ fɔ boo koro fɔ èè ten.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2SA 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 24:22" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Arawuna ɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Miinfonte egyu, ka gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ gii di wɔ gʋnʋn fɔ tɛ Yahwe gedi. Nya Bɛkwɔ-teni n yela lɛ, ka bɛ tɛ gekuma gii gedi, gɛ anaabi yii getibakʋn fɔ ɩ lɛ fɩya ma iyon gɛtɛ bɛɛ sa bɛkwɔ be-tiira fɔ, àà ka yɩ mɛ bʋtan. <verse eid="2SA 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 24:23" />Arawuna ɛ ka yɩ powu ɛ tɛ egyu fɔ, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe aa Wurubwarɛ ɛ nʋn aanyun-tiri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2SA 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 24:24" />Mɔ egyu fɔ e tiri wuunyun ɛ tɛ Arawuna alan, &lt;&lt;Kwa, nan le wɔ̀ anyan fɔ yii gutoro. Mɩn nan tɛ Yahwe miin Wurubwarɛ gekuma gii gedi gɛtɛ mɩn nan le gɩnyankɩ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 24:24">Okoro Dafidi ɛ ka gɛ sɩka-fututu abi akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo (50) e siye anaabi yii getibakʋn ma bɛkwɔ-teni fɔ. <verse eid="2SA 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 24:25" />Dafidi e sere gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn ɛ tɛ Yahwe dʋkɔ, gɛ ɛ tɛ wɔ gekuma ma olila yii gedi. Ɛwʋ gɛ Yahwe ɛ nʋn gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ giinyun-tiri, gɛ ɛ yɛ gyerebi gɛtɛ nafɔ ɛ̀ sa Isareli fɔ e ten.<verse eid="2SA 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 24" />
</usx>